
# game/a1s6.rpy:3
translate spanish a1s6_3a6e1507:

    # "A few minutes later, Amicus is flat on his stomach, looking under his bed as he mumbles something under his breath."
    "Unos minutos después, Amicus está boca abajo, mirando bajo la cama y murmurando algo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:4
translate spanish a1s6_20ae193c:

    # "I stand awkwardly off to the side, watching as he sweeps a paw underneath, as if feeling for something."
    "Me quedo incómodamente a un lado y lo veo barrer con una mano por debajo, como buscando algo al tacto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:5
translate spanish a1s6_9e2304d6:

    # m "\"What are you doing?\""
    m "\"¿Qué estás haciendo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:6
translate spanish a1s6_263132eb:

    # "Amicus grunts as he gets to his knees, then stands up, looking up at the ceiling as he turns in a slow circle."
    "Amicus gruñe al ponerse de rodillas y después se levanta; mira el techo mientras gira despacio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:8
translate spanish a1s6_d1591564:

    # a "\"Looking for whatever Cass might have been doing.\""
    a "\"Busco lo que Cass pudiera estar haciendo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:9
translate spanish a1s6_8ca1e6dd:

    # m "\"You know what he was doing?\""
    m "\"¿Sabes qué hacía?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:10
translate spanish a1s6_d8934f73:

    # a "\"I have my suspicions.\""
    a "\"Tengo mis sospechas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:11
translate spanish a1s6_4c5ddf2d:

    # m "\"Which are?\""
    m "\"¿Cuáles?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:12
translate spanish a1s6_7a40d4b1:

    # "Amicus stops his turning and looks at me, folding his arms."
    "Amicus deja de girar, me mira y cruza los brazos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:13
translate spanish a1s6_66732799:

    # a "\"Well, I'm not sure, but a recording device possibly, or he was just snooping for information.\""
    a "\"No estoy seguro, pero quizá un dispositivo de grabación, o simplemente buscaba información a escondidas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:14
translate spanish a1s6_5ba3bb5d:

    # m "\"Can we just ask Com?\""
    m "\"¿Podemos preguntarle a Com?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:15
translate spanish a1s6_814397fc:

    # a "\"No, his capabilities are very limited despite what his intelligence might suggest. He doesn't record our activities specifically so we can't spy on each other; rules put in place millennia ago.\""
    a "\"No; sus capacidades son muy limitadas pese a lo que sugiera su inteligencia. No registra nuestras actividades precisamente para que no podamos espiarnos; son reglas de hace milenios.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:16
translate spanish a1s6_48d777f6:

    # "I sigh and look at the door, still feeling a little shaken up at what had just happened."
    "Suspiro y miro la puerta, todavía algo alterado por lo ocurrido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:17
translate spanish a1s6_64f68652:

    # m "\"Why can't you lock the door, or something?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué no puedes cerrar la puerta con llave o algo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:18
translate spanish a1s6_f887bb98:

    # "Amicus shrugs."
    "Amicus se encoge de hombros."

# game/a1s6.rpy:20
translate spanish a1s6_56fdbcd1:

    # a "\"That's something only the emperor can do. Again, rules that have been in place for a very long time.\""
    a "\"Solo el emperador puede hacerlo. Son reglas que llevan muchísimo tiempo vigentes.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:21
translate spanish a1s6_cf52434f:

    # m "\"That doesn't seem safe.\""
    m "\"No parece seguro.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:22
translate spanish a1s6_a47bf672:

    # a "\"Well, only the most trusted are allowed in the palace after all, which tends to only be family.\""
    a "\"Solo se permite estar en el palacio a los más fiables, que suelen ser familiares.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:23
translate spanish a1s6_cc4e28c1:

    # m "\"Aside from Neferu.\""
    m "\"Salvo Neferu.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:24
translate spanish a1s6_25de02e8:

    # a "\"Aside from him, yes.\""
    a "\"Salvo él, sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:25
translate spanish a1s6_eeeb5dcd:

    # m "\"You don't have much freedom for being the emperor's son.\""
    m "\"Tienes poca libertad para ser hijo del emperador.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:27
translate spanish a1s6_c67a5700:

    # a "\"You just noticed?\""
    a "\"¿Acabas de darte cuenta?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:29
translate spanish a1s6_5286e5a6:

    # "Amicus huffs and stands in the middle of the room, his arms folded, a deep frown on his face."
    "Amicus resopla en medio de la habitación, con los brazos cruzados y el ceño muy fruncido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:30
translate spanish a1s6_2291e871:

    # m "\"He was probably just trying to find out what you're planning for the next trial. We know some stuff about him already.\""
    m "\"Seguramente quería averiguar qué planeas para la siguiente prueba. Nosotros ya sabemos algunas cosas de él.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:31
translate spanish a1s6_8e3323ca:

    # a "\"Mmh.\""
    a "\"Mmh.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:32
translate spanish a1s6_3ff385b0:

    # "Amicus continues to look concerned."
    "Amicus sigue preocupado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:33
translate spanish a1s6_3ffe5d76:

    # m "\"What is it?\""
    m "\"¿Qué es?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:34
translate spanish a1s6_7c164a26:

    # a "\"I just...\""
    a "\"Es que...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:35
translate spanish a1s6_dcfb9068:

    # "Amicus lowers his voice."
    "Amicus baja la voz."

# game/a1s6.rpy:37
translate spanish a1s6_56496167:

    # a "\"..worry it might have something to do with you. After what he said as he was leaving...it's left me uneasy, is all.\""
    a "\"...temo que tenga que ver contigo. Después de lo que dijo al marcharse...me ha dejado inquieto, nada más.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:38
translate spanish a1s6_12af59b2:

    # "Oh yeah, that thing about executing me."
    "Ah, sí, lo de ejecutarme."

# game/a1s6.rpy:39
translate spanish a1s6_35886d5e:

    # "I haven't had time to think about the possibility of someone on the verge of near-absolute power wanting me dead yet."
    "Todavía no he podido pensar en que alguien a punto de tener un poder casi absoluto quiera verme muerto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:40
translate spanish a1s6_1b754e41:

    # m "\"Do you think he was serious?\""
    m "\"¿Crees que hablaba en serio?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:41
translate spanish a1s6_11ad0c3f:

    # "Amicus is quiet for a moment."
    "Amicus guarda silencio un momento."

# game/a1s6.rpy:43
translate spanish a1s6_236e1fbe:

    # a "\"No...but obviously I'm not going to assume he wasn't. I won't even give him a chance at the emperorship now.\""
    a "\"No...pero no voy a dar por hecho que no lo decía en serio. Ahora ni siquiera le daré una oportunidad de ser emperador.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:44
translate spanish a1s6_e499761a:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/a1s6.rpy:45
translate spanish a1s6_b346dae9:

    # m "\"And you were going to before?\""
    m "\"¿Antes sí ibas a dársela?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:47
translate spanish a1s6_c2c081ac:

    # a "\"No! I'm just going to make extra sure now.\""
    a "\"¡No! Ahora me aseguraré aún más.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:48
translate spanish a1s6_d60eb140:

    # "I'm quiet, deciding to sit on the bed instead."
    "Me quedo callado y decido sentarme en la cama."

# game/a1s6.rpy:49
translate spanish a1s6_32d8385b:

    # "I don't like that this situation has become a lot more serious than it already was."
    "No me gusta que esto sea mucho más serio de lo que ya era."

# game/a1s6.rpy:50
translate spanish a1s6_c4f527e8:

    # "After a moment, Amicus comes to sit next to me, the depression he creates in the mattress forcing me to lean sideways into him."
    "Al rato Amicus se sienta a mi lado; hunde el colchón y me obliga a inclinarme hacia él."

# game/a1s6.rpy:51
translate spanish a1s6_80f4f52c:

    # "He wraps an arm around me."
    "Me rodea con un brazo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:53
translate spanish a1s6_053bc662:

    # a "\"Don't worry about it at all. He has no chance and besides, I wouldn't let him touch you.\""
    a "\"No te preocupes. No tiene ninguna posibilidad y, además, no dejaría que te tocara.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:54
translate spanish a1s6_b31db3db:

    # m "\"How would you be able to do that if he's the emperor though?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo podrías impedirlo si fuera emperador?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:56
translate spanish a1s6_7a7fe58e:

    # a "\"Well, I'm also his older brother. Some relationships don't change, even if the official ones do.\""
    a "\"También soy su hermano mayor. Algunas relaciones no cambian, aunque las oficiales sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:57
translate spanish a1s6_b2e661d9:

    # "I stay quiet, unconvinced."
    "Sigo callado, sin estar convencido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:59
translate spanish a1s6_75d1083d:

    # a "\"Anyway, it would look awfully bad on his record. He just let his anger get the best of him. He'll quickly forget about the matter with the next trial coming up.\""
    a "\"Además, quedaría fatal en su historial. Se dejó llevar por la ira. Con la siguiente prueba tan cerca, olvidará pronto el asunto.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:60
translate spanish a1s6_26600159:

    # "Amicus squeezes me."
    "Amicus me estrecha."

# game/a1s6.rpy:61
translate spanish a1s6_d8ff6a7b:

    # a "\"And this is all assuming he'd win. He won't.\""
    a "\"Y eso suponiendo que ganara. No lo hará.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:62
translate spanish a1s6_a98e443b:

    # m "\"That's what you said last time.\""
    m "\"Eso dijiste la última vez.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:64
translate spanish a1s6_6a627c79:

    # a "\"And we had an unforeseeable mishap last time. There isn't much possibility for one of those to happen in this trial.\""
    a "\"Y hubo un contratiempo imprevisible. En esta prueba hay pocas posibilidades de algo así.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:66
translate spanish a1s6_36648890:

    # "We sit there a while longer, Amicus rubbing my shoulder with his paw."
    "Seguimos sentados un rato; Amicus me frota el hombro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:67
translate spanish a1s6_2b784e70:

    # "Despite my rising anxiety, it's comforting, and before long I'm leaning my head against his shoulder."
    "Pese a mi creciente ansiedad, me reconforta; pronto apoyo la cabeza en su hombro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:72
translate spanish a1s6_be27d597:

    # "A week later, Amicus and I sit in the gardens, enjoying the cool, fresh morning air."
    "Una semana después, Amicus y yo disfrutamos en los jardines del fresco aire matinal."

# game/a1s6.rpy:73
translate spanish a1s6_6bbf7b3b:

    # m "\"So, what's your main argument?\""
    m "\"¿Cuál es tu argumento principal?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:75
translate spanish a1s6_624289ed:

    # a "\"That Adastra has been on a steady rise politically and economically since the beginning of the {i}Ad Astra{/i} policy era. Why take steps backwards when we're so clearly moving in the right direction?\""
    a "\"Que Adastra ha crecido de forma constante en lo político y económico desde el comienzo de la era de la política {i}Ad Astra{/i}. ¿Por qué dar pasos atrás cuando está tan claro que avanzamos en la dirección correcta?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:76
translate spanish a1s6_88dc90c8:

    # m "\"And Cassius?\""
    m "\"¿Y el de Cassius?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:78
translate spanish a1s6_803b6dbb:

    # a "\"That Adastra's decline over the past few hundred years is due to that policy. Instead of looking outward to the children and other siblings, we should instead be looking inward to better ourselves.\""
    a "\"Que el declive de Adastra en los últimos siglos se debe a esa política. En vez de mirar hacia los Hijos y los demás Hermanos, deberíamos mirar hacia nosotros mismos y mejorar.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:79
translate spanish a1s6_2d589eca:

    # "Amicus scratches his nose."
    "Amicus se rasca la nariz."

# game/a1s6.rpy:81
translate spanish a1s6_3b752d2e:

    # a "\"Well, that's the basics anyway.\""
    a "\"Esas son las bases.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:83
translate spanish a1s6_6254305a:

    # a "\"Obviously there is much, much more to it.\""
    a "\"Hay muchísimo más, por supuesto.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:84
translate spanish a1s6_c0bad9c8:

    # m "\"So how are you gonna counter that argument? Seems like a pretty good one to me.\""
    m "\"¿Cómo vas a contrarrestarlo? A mí me parece un buen argumento.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:86
translate spanish a1s6_441c1f19:

    # a "\"If the wheel of your chariot is caught on a stone, does that mean the campaign should be turned around and ended?\""
    a "\"Si una rueda de tu carro queda atascada en una piedra, ¿debe la campaña dar la vuelta y terminar?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:87
translate spanish a1s6_533446a6:

    # "He looks at me, and I just stare back."
    "Me mira y yo le devuelvo la mirada sin más."

# game/a1s6.rpy:89
translate spanish a1s6_3999bd33:

    # a "\"Well, the answer is no; you simply need to give it a push.\""
    a "\"La respuesta es no: basta con darle un empujón.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:90
translate spanish a1s6_825b7646:

    # m "\"In other words?\""
    m "\"¿En otras palabras?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:92
translate spanish a1s6_91591116:

    # a "\"In other words, the downturn over the past 200 years is simply a stone in the road. Why throw away ten millennia of progress due to a few centuries of light hardship?\""
    a "\"El declive de los últimos 200 años es una piedra en el camino. ¿Por qué tirar diez milenios de progreso por unos siglos de dificultades leves?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:93
translate spanish a1s6_36d3adcd:

    # a "\"Besides, it was completely predictable: the war with the Khemians and the resulting end of diplomatic relations with most of the other siblings caused it.\""
    a "\"Además, era completamente previsible: lo provocaron la guerra con los Khemianos y la consiguiente ruptura diplomática con la mayoría de los demás Hermanos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:95
translate spanish a1s6_f2723af4:

    # a "\"We certainly can't have any leverage in the galaxy when the only siblings speaking to us are the cats. If we can fix those relations, we could be well on our way to prosperity again.\""
    a "\"No podemos influir en la galaxia si los únicos Hermanos que nos hablan son los gatos. Si arreglamos las relaciones, podríamos volver a prosperar.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:96
translate spanish a1s6_25df439a:

    # m "\"Well, that and un-stunting your children.\""
    m "\"Y dejar de frenar el desarrollo de vuestros Hijos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:98
translate spanish a1s6_9cc334db:

    # a "\"Yes, that too.\""
    a "\"Sí, eso también.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:99
translate spanish a1s6_2bd58c52:

    # m "\"Which I still can't believe you did.\""
    m "\"Todavía no puedo creer que hicierais eso.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:101
translate spanish a1s6_b9506e9e:

    # a "\"Again, it wasn't ME. Anyway, that will also be part of my argument: upraise the children fully as the partial uplift programs are now clearly a failure.\""
    a "\"Repito que no fui YO. También argumentaré que debemos elevar plenamente a los Hijos: los programas de elevación parcial han fracasado claramente.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:102
translate spanish a1s6_e29161a5:

    # m "\"And end the slavery.\""
    m "\"Y acabar con la esclavitud.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:104
translate spanish a1s6_46e1b975:

    # a "\"And consider the debts repaid, yes.\""
    a "\"Y considerar saldadas las deudas, sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:105
translate spanish a1s6_495c000c:

    # m "\"Debts that didn't exist in the first place, sure.\""
    m "\"Deudas que nunca existieron, claro.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:107
translate spanish a1s6_31a9222b:

    # a "\"Listen, [mc], I have to use VERY careful language so as not to upset the people, not to mention the triumvirates. Feelings are sensitive at times like these and must be considered despite how tedious...or untrue it can be.\""
    a "\"Escucha, [mc], debo usar un lenguaje MUY cuidadoso para no molestar al pueblo, y mucho menos a los triunviros. En momentos como estos los sentimientos están a flor de piel y hay que tenerlos en cuenta, por tedioso...o poco sincero que resulte.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:108
translate spanish a1s6_619c344e:

    # "Amicus is right; the wolves are very sensitive when it comes to their culture and history."
    "Amicus tiene razón: los lobos son muy sensibles con su cultura e historia."

# game/a1s6.rpy:109
translate spanish a1s6_b79959ca:

    # "I'm starting to realize that their hubris is probably their biggest downfall."
    "Empiezo a comprender que su arrogancia probablemente sea su mayor debilidad."

# game/a1s6.rpy:110
translate spanish a1s6_3c833db1:

    # "I lean back on the bench, starting to feel a little sweaty under the rising sun."
    "Me recuesto en el banco y empiezo a sudar un poco bajo el sol que asciende."

# game/a1s6.rpy:111
translate spanish a1s6_ccc6223b:

    # m "\"Isn't that gonna be Cassius's whole thing, though? Appeal to their feelings, throw out the etiquette, and get straight to the point?\""
    m "\"¿Pero no será esa la estrategia de Cassius? Apelar a sus sentimientos, olvidarse de las formas e ir al grano.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:113
translate spanish a1s6_ee5a513f:

    # a "\"Possibly, but I'm confident my composure and consideration will win over the triumvirates.\""
    a "\"Posiblemente, pero confío en que mi compostura y consideración me ganarán el apoyo de los triunviros.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:114
translate spanish a1s6_e4487ba7:

    # m "\"You ever considered NOT being so confident, maybe preparing for the worst?\""
    m "\"¿Has considerado NO estar tan seguro y prepararte para lo peor?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:116
translate spanish a1s6_5234c2ef:

    # a "\"I'm confident that I'm prepared for the worst.\""
    a "\"Estoy seguro de estar preparado para lo peor.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:117
translate spanish a1s6_e44562c2:

    # "I roll my eyes and Amicus glares at me."
    "Pongo los ojos en blanco y Amicus me mira con hostilidad."

# game/a1s6.rpy:119
translate spanish a1s6_ad468b6d:

    # a "\"I don't understand why you're so insistent on projecting yourself onto me. Just because {i}you{/i} aren't sure of yourself doesn't mean that {i}I{/i} should be the same.\""
    a "\"No entiendo por qué insistes tanto en proyectarte en mí. Que {i}tú{/i} no estés seguro de ti mismo no significa que {i}yo{/i} deba estar igual.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:120
translate spanish a1s6_e499761a_1:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/a1s6.rpy:121
translate spanish a1s6_a32a3184:

    # m "\"Ouch.\""
    m "\"Ay.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:123
translate spanish a1s6_ecef8a0a:

    # a "\"...Sorry. But I strongly believe in what I'm doing. How can I ever be an emperor if I'm not sure that what I'm doing is right?\""
    a "\"...Perdona. Pero creo firmemente en lo que hago. ¿Cómo puedo ser emperador si no estoy seguro de hacer lo correcto?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:124
translate spanish a1s6_e1c7349c:

    # m "\"Sure...but all I'm saying is that you might not always be right, and you need to be prepared for that.\""
    m "\"Claro...solo digo que no siempre tendrás razón y debes estar preparado.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:126
translate spanish a1s6_b4e84a82:

    # a "\"Trust me, I'm learning as I go, and after the last trial, I'm preparing for everything.\""
    a "\"Créeme, aprendo sobre la marcha y, después de la última prueba, me preparo para todo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:127
translate spanish a1s6_c89493bb:

    # m "\"How are they even going to choose the winner? Wouldn't they just pick who they agree with most?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo elegirán al ganador? ¿No escogerán al que más coincida con sus ideas?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:129
translate spanish a1s6_ddcfea03:

    # a "\"Technically no, they're supposed to choose the best performance, the most convincing and dramatic.\""
    a "\"Técnicamente no: deben elegir la mejor actuación, la más convincente y dramática.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:130
translate spanish a1s6_9255b818:

    # m "\"How very Wolven.\""
    m "\"Qué propio de los lobos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:131
translate spanish a1s6_b924b287:

    # a "\"Mmh...\""
    a "\"Mmh...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:132
translate spanish a1s6_ab61a356:

    # m "\"So you just have to convince a majority of the triumvirates?\""
    m "\"¿Así que solo tienes que convencer a la mayoría de los triunviros?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:133
translate spanish a1s6_5ddc6a0e:

    # a "\"Well, yes, but Cato's vote holds twice the power of a triumvirate vote, so I need at least either four triumvirates, or two triumvirates, plus Cato.\""
    a "\"Bueno, sí, pero el voto de Cato vale el doble que el de un triunviro, así que necesito al menos cuatro triunviros, o dos triunviros más Cato.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:134
translate spanish a1s6_54d120ea:

    # m "\"And what are Cato's beliefs?\""
    m "\"¿Y qué cree Cato?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:135
translate spanish a1s6_f887bb98_1:

    # "Amicus shrugs."
    "Amicus se encoge de hombros."

# game/a1s6.rpy:137
translate spanish a1s6_aca6d39f:

    # a "\"He doesn't talk about them much, but again it shouldn't matter.\""
    a "\"No habla mucho de eso, pero no debería importar.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:139
translate spanish a1s6_6a3706fc:

    # "He's certainly right about Cato not talking much about himself."
    "Tiene razón: Cato no habla mucho de sí mismo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:140
translate spanish a1s6_24b238bc:

    # "But that tends to be the way everyone is around here."
    "Aunque casi todos son así aquí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:141
translate spanish a1s6_f46584b4:

    # "I can tell Amicus isn't all that interested in talking about this though, so I try to think of something else."
    "Amicus no parece querer hablar del tema, así que intento pensar en otra cosa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:142
translate spanish a1s6_4483d6d0:

    # m "\"What started the war with the Khemians, by the way?\""
    m "\"Por cierto, ¿qué provocó la guerra con los Khemianos?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:144
translate spanish a1s6_490bf8e5:

    # a "\"Their ambitions got the best of them. They began to interact with some of our abandoned children, some of which were very close to Adastra.\""
    a "\"Sus ambiciones los dominaron. Empezaron a tratar con algunos de nuestros Hijos abandonados, algunos muy cercanos a Adastra.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:145
translate spanish a1s6_2f737126:

    # m "\"Oh, is that illegal, or something?\""
    m "\"¿Eso es ilegal o algo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:147
translate spanish a1s6_1838044b:

    # a "\"Well...technically not if they're abandoned, but it's never really happened considering if a species is abandoned then that's a signal to the other siblings that the race is un-upliftable.\""
    a "\"Técnicamente no si están abandonados, pero nunca había pasado: que una especie sea abandonada indica a los otros Hermanos que no se la puede elevar.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:148
translate spanish a1s6_3a8d4f5e:

    # m "\"So they weren't breaking any rules?\""
    m "\"¿Entonces no rompían ninguna regla?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:150
translate spanish a1s6_693ba37d:

    # a "\"Even if they weren't breaking laws, they were clearly provoking us by uplifting races just a few hundred light years away from our moon. They are an arrogant people.\""
    a "\"Aunque no violaran leyes, nos provocaban elevando especies a solo unos cientos de años luz de nuestra luna. Son un pueblo arrogante.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:151
translate spanish a1s6_1502a996:

    # m "\"Neferu seems nice, always polite.\""
    m "\"Neferu parece agradable, siempre educado.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:152
translate spanish a1s6_84d141c7:

    # "Amicus smirks."
    "Amicus sonríe con malicia."

# game/a1s6.rpy:154
translate spanish a1s6_d35d0de7:

    # a "\"Well, that's how they often get their way; a facade of niceties to pull you into their trap. Either way, the war was a draw despite their technical advantage. Wolven tenacity beats Khemian tech any day.\""
    a "\"Bueno, así suelen salirse con la suya: una fachada de amabilidad para atraerte a su trampa. En cualquier caso, la guerra acabó en empate a pesar de su ventaja tecnológica. La tenacidad de los lobos supera a la tecnología Khemiana cualquier día.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:155
translate spanish a1s6_381d6e3d:

    # "Despite Amicus's more progressive views on things, he's not immune to Wolven hubris either, it seems."
    "A pesar de sus ideas más progresistas, parece que Amicus tampoco es inmune a la arrogancia de los lobos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:156
translate spanish a1s6_04c5c0f6:

    # "But I'm not in the mood to argue with him about that."
    "Pero no tengo ganas de discutirlo con él."

# game/a1s6.rpy:157
translate spanish a1s6_4942ff40:

    # m "\"You know, Neferu reminds of a culture on Earth...the Egyptians. I wonder if they uplifted there too?\""
    m "\"Neferu me recuerda a una cultura terrestre...los egipcios. ¿Quizá también elevaron allí a alguien?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:159
translate spanish a1s6_4354910e:

    # "Amicus looks down at me, then snorts."
    "Amicus me mira desde arriba y resopla."

# game/a1s6.rpy:161
translate spanish a1s6_f208352e:

    # a "\"More likely they just share simple aesthetics. Your people being uplifted twice while having no knowledge of the {i}Galaxias{/i} is impossible. The Khemians rarely abandon anyway...actually I don't think they ever have. They tend to have the best of luck.\""
    a "\"Lo más probable es que solo compartan una estética sencilla. Es imposible que tu gente haya sido elevada dos veces sin saber nada de {i}Galaxias{/i}. Además, los Khemianos rara vez abandonan...de hecho, creo que nunca lo han hecho. Suelen tener muy buena suerte.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:162
translate spanish a1s6_6a54bd74:

    # "Amicus stretches."
    "Amicus se estira."

# game/a1s6.rpy:164
translate spanish a1s6_0f27a0cc:

    # a "\"Honestly though, this talk is boring. This is my only day off before the trial next week. We should be doing something fun.\""
    a "\"Esta charla es aburrida. Es mi único día libre antes de la prueba de la próxima semana. Deberíamos divertirnos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:165
translate spanish a1s6_20defb42:

    # m "\"Like what?\""
    m "\"¿Como qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:166
translate spanish a1s6_bd22dc24:

    # "Amicus looks around, then grins."
    "Amicus mira alrededor y sonríe."

# game/a1s6.rpy:168
translate spanish a1s6_2bf2f860:

    # a "\"Want to practice {i}pugnu{/i} with me?\""
    a "\"¿Quieres practicar {i}pugnu{/i} conmigo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:169
translate spanish a1s6_c651d0c8:

    # m "\"No.\""
    m "\"No.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:171
translate spanish a1s6_36acf70c:

    # a "\"Aww, come on.\""
    a "\"Venga, por favor.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:172
translate spanish a1s6_596f2ccd:

    # "I know Amicus would go easy on me, but I really don't feel like getting sweaty and exhausted right now."
    "Sé que Amicus sería suave conmigo, pero no me apetece acabar sudado y agotado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:173
translate spanish a1s6_96a8f1de:

    # m "\"Why don't we just go to the island and have a picnic again?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué no vamos a la isla y hacemos otro pícnic?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:175
translate spanish a1s6_eed3f9fa:

    # a "\"Oh! Yeah, great idea.\""
    a "\"¡Oh! Sí, buena idea.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:178
translate spanish a1s6_8603f928:

    # "Amicus grins and hops up, already making his way to the beach as he calls out to Com to get the food ready."
    "Amicus sonríe, se levanta de un salto y ya va hacia la playa mientras pide a Com que prepare la comida."

# game/a1s6.rpy:179
translate spanish a1s6_7c5a0a14:

    # "With a sigh, I get up and jog after him toward the Sightseer."
    "Suspiro, me levanto y corro tras él hacia la Observadora."

# game/a1s6.rpy:183
translate spanish a1s6_e263d634:

    # "I stand on the beach, hands on my hips as I look out at the sparkling lake, the breeze that's coming off the water cool and soothing."
    "Estoy en la playa con las manos en las caderas, mirando el lago reluciente; la brisa del agua es fresca y agradable."

# game/a1s6.rpy:184
translate spanish a1s6_2fb8ec92:

    # "Adastra City sparkles in the distance as well, making the tall structures look like they have a glass, or crystal coating."
    "La ciudad de Adastra también brilla a lo lejos y sus altos edificios parecen revestidos de vidrio o cristal."

# game/a1s6.rpy:185
translate spanish a1s6_fba5a139:

    # "I look back at Amicus, the wolf in the process of spreading out a blanket under the shade of the trees."
    "Miro a Amicus, que extiende una manta a la sombra de los árboles."

# game/a1s6.rpy:186
translate spanish a1s6_82aec158:

    # m "\"You sure Cato isn't gonna kick your ass for doing this again?\""
    m "\"¿Seguro que Cato no te dará otra paliza por esto?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:187
translate spanish a1s6_33d984c4:

    # "I see the wolf's ears flick down for a moment."
    "Veo bajar las orejas del lobo un instante."

# game/a1s6.rpy:189
translate spanish a1s6_a0b24dc9:

    # a "\"That was for missing an appointment. I don't have any today.\""
    a "\"Eso fue por faltar a una cita. Hoy no tengo ninguna.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:190
translate spanish a1s6_591c0bd4:

    # "I resist telling Amicus that it was about much more than a missed lesson, and instead I walk over to help him spread the blanket out more evenly."
    "Me contengo para no decir que fue mucho más que una clase perdida y lo ayudo a extender mejor la manta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:192
translate spanish a1s6_34b202c8:

    # a "\"Thank you! Now, shall we eat?\""
    a "\"¡Gracias! ¿Comemos?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:196
translate spanish a1s6_7e4c6c34:

    # "Amicus pulls the cloth off the basket, revealing tightly packed and covered plates, along with bottles of wine and {i}virdi{/i}."
    "Amicus retira la tela de la cesta, dejando al descubierto platos bien apretados y cubiertos, junto con botellas de vino y {i}virdi{/i}."

# game/a1s6.rpy:197
translate spanish a1s6_397d8c14:

    # "This time, the food is a selection of wraps full of meat and cheeses along with chilled, salted cucumbers."
    "La comida consiste esta vez en pan enrollado con carnes y quesos, acompañado de pepinos fríos con sal."

# game/a1s6.rpy:198
translate spanish a1s6_f7002c02:

    # "Amicus splays out in that luxurious Roman way as he pulls his plate of food up next to his chest, immediately stuffing a whole wrap in his muzzle."
    "Amicus se recuesta con ese lujo romano, coloca el plato junto al pecho y se mete enseguida un pan enrollado entero en el hocico."

# game/a1s6.rpy:199
translate spanish a1s6_46e31f1c:

    # "I'm a bit more dainty, instead sitting next to the wolf cross-legged as I nibble at my own wrap."
    "Yo soy más delicado: me siento a su lado con las piernas cruzadas y doy pequeños bocados al mío."

# game/a1s6.rpy:200
translate spanish a1s6_53f611b8:

    # "We eat in silence for a little while, Amicus gobbling up the majority of the food like always."
    "Comemos un rato en silencio; Amicus devora la mayor parte, como siempre."

# game/a1s6.rpy:201
translate spanish a1s6_6b16e15d:

    # "I notice the wolf drinking more wine than he usually does, probably because it's his day off."
    "Noto que bebe más vino de lo habitual, probablemente por ser su día libre."

# game/a1s6.rpy:202
translate spanish a1s6_6067ec64:

    # "After taking a particularly large swig, he points at my legs."
    "Después de un trago especialmente grande, señala mis piernas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:204
translate spanish a1s6_95504baa:

    # a "\"I don't know how you're comfortable doing that; looks like hell on the knees.\""
    a "\"No sé cómo estás cómodo así; parece un infierno para las rodillas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:205
translate spanish a1s6_aad87ec1:

    # m "\"Well, laying down like you are actually hurts my neck. I don't know how you do it for so long.\""
    m "\"Tumbarme como tú me duele en el cuello. No sé cómo aguantas tanto.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:206
translate spanish a1s6_10d650f0:

    # "I rub the left side of my neck as I say that, then carefully uncork the bottle of {i}virdi{/i}."
    "Me froto el lado izquierdo del cuello al decirlo y destapo con cuidado la botella de {i}virdi{/i}."

# game/a1s6.rpy:207
translate spanish a1s6_a3da22b5:

    # a "\"Cato's the same way, but he's old.\""
    a "\"A Cato le pasa lo mismo, pero es viejo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:208
translate spanish a1s6_00d55ff6:

    # "I take a sip of the cold drink that I've come to really like over the past few weeks."
    "Bebo un sorbo de la bebida fría que tanto me ha gustado en estas semanas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:209
translate spanish a1s6_6144e201:

    # m "\"Speaking of Cato. Who exactly is he? How'd he become the acting emperor?\""
    m "\"Hablando de Cato, ¿quién es exactamente? ¿Cómo llegó a ser emperador provisional?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:210
translate spanish a1s6_aa2593b8:

    # "I try circling us back around to the conversation we'd had earlier, wanting to know more about the wolf that's apparently ruling all of Adastra right now."
    "Intento retomar la conversación anterior para saber más del lobo que parece gobernar toda Adastra."

# game/a1s6.rpy:212
translate spanish a1s6_2f341333:

    # a "\"Oh! Well, he was father's friend since childhood. He was the Imperial Legate during the Khemian War.\""
    a "\"¡Oh! Bueno, era amigo de mi padre desde la infancia. Fue el legado imperial durante la Guerra Khemiana.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:213
translate spanish a1s6_8659f7f9:

    # m "\"Is that an important position?\""
    m "\"¿Es un cargo importante?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:215
translate spanish a1s6_4ceab8c9:

    # a "\"It's the highest rank in the military, aside from the emperor, of course. He's credited with preventing outright defeat.\""
    a "\"El rango militar más alto, aparte del emperador. Se le atribuye haber evitado una derrota total.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:216
translate spanish a1s6_a5b0e666:

    # m "\"Huh...must be kind of weird for him to have Neferu walking around in the palace.\""
    m "\"Debe de resultarle raro tener a Neferu por el palacio.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:218
translate spanish a1s6_a44677e7:

    # a "\"Another reason I wonder why Virginia brought him to the palace. Cato's scars aren't just physical.\""
    a "\"Otra razón por la que me pregunto por qué Virginia lo trajo. Las cicatrices de Cato no son solo físicas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:219
translate spanish a1s6_c2555556:

    # m "\"Physical?\""
    m "\"¿Físicas?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:220
translate spanish a1s6_5c29414f:

    # a "\"I take it you've noticed the visor, yes? Well, he lost an eye and part of his skull during the war. Eventually, the other eye failed as well, and he had to go to our parent to have mechanical vision installed.\""
    a "\"Has visto el visor, ¿no? Perdió un ojo y parte del cráneo en la guerra. Después falló el otro ojo y acudió a nuestro Padre para que le instalaran visión mecánica.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:222
translate spanish a1s6_332eb194:

    # a "\"Anyway, Neferu was born decades after the war, so I doubt Cato holds anything against him specifically.\""
    a "\"Neferu nació décadas después de la guerra; dudo que Cato tenga algo contra él en particular.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:223
translate spanish a1s6_a08ac6ec:

    # m "\"Is he alright with the alliance thing?\""
    m "\"¿Está de acuerdo con la alianza?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:224
translate spanish a1s6_4b8b0163:

    # "Knowing this about Cato makes me worry that he might not agree with Amicus on one of his most controversial policies."
    "Saber eso de Cato me hace temer que no apoye una de las políticas más polémicas de Amicus."

# game/a1s6.rpy:225
translate spanish a1s6_d4174b16:

    # a "\"I doubt that, but I think he understands it's necessary if we're to begin re-establishing relations with the other siblings.\""
    a "\"Lo dudo, pero creo que entiende su necesidad si queremos restablecer relaciones con otros Hermanos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:226
translate spanish a1s6_de33013b:

    # m "\"Hmm...\""
    m "\"Hmm...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:227
translate spanish a1s6_8e471e15:

    # "I feel my stomach turn a little as I realize we might be disadvantaged in this trial as well."
    "Se me revuelve un poco el estómago al pensar que también podríamos estar en desventaja en esta prueba."

# game/a1s6.rpy:228
translate spanish a1s6_9b541833:

    # m "\"Amicus...what's going to happen if you lose this next trial?\""
    m "\"Amicus...¿qué pasará si pierdes la siguiente prueba?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:230
translate spanish a1s6_0bbe384e:

    # a "\"Again, don't wor—\""
    a "\"Otra vez, no te preocu—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:231
translate spanish a1s6_f444377d:

    # m "\"I know you don't think it can happen, but if it DOES...what happens to me?\""
    m "\"Sé que crees que no puede ocurrir, pero si OCURRE...¿qué me pasa a mí?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:233
translate spanish a1s6_47caa0d5:

    # "Amicus frowns at me, a meat wrap halfway to his face before he sets it back down."
    "Amicus me mira con el ceño fruncido, con un rollo de carne a medio camino de la boca antes de volver a bajarlo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:234
translate spanish a1s6_009ff7e6:

    # a "\"First of all, I won't have you worrying about Cassius's words. What he said was out of anger, and besides, I'll have measures in place to stop it from ever happening.\""
    a "\"Primero, no quiero que te preocupes por las palabras de Cassius. Habló por ira y, además, tomaré medidas para que jamás ocurra.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:235
translate spanish a1s6_ae817c0e:

    # m "\"What measures?\""
    m "\"¿Qué medidas?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:236
translate spanish a1s6_dd2bca73:

    # a "\"I'm...not fully sure of that yet, but I will have them in place by the time the next trial comes...very good measures.\""
    a "\"Aún...no lo tengo del todo claro, pero estarán listas para la próxima prueba...medidas muy buenas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:237
translate spanish a1s6_15b15847:

    # m "\"And aside from that? What do I do next?\""
    m "\"¿Y aparte de eso? ¿Qué hago después?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:238
translate spanish a1s6_a08fc22a:

    # "Amicus thinks."
    "Amicus reflexiona."

# game/a1s6.rpy:240
translate spanish a1s6_35fe0502:

    # a "\"Like I said before, I'll ensure a way home for you. The problem is the illegality of you being here. The more people who know about it, the more likely a monitor may be alerted to what happened.\""
    a "\"Te aseguraré una forma de volver a casa. El problema es que tu presencia es ilegal. Cuantos más lo sepan, más probable será que un monitor descubra lo ocurrido.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:242
translate spanish a1s6_6d6bc829:

    # a "\"I need to be very careful about who I let know about the situation.\""
    a "\"Debo elegir con mucho cuidado a quién se lo cuento.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:243
translate spanish a1s6_f0f1d907:

    # m "\"Okay...\""
    m "\"Vale...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:244
translate spanish a1s6_6c857bbb:

    # "I look down at my food, suddenly having lost my appetite."
    "Miro la comida y pierdo de golpe el apetito."

# game/a1s6.rpy:245
translate spanish a1s6_5f2059b0:

    # "Amicus sighs, sounding annoyed."
    "Amicus suspira, aparentemente molesto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:247
translate spanish a1s6_987ec479:

    # a "\"Come on, [mc], this is likely going to be your last few weeks here. Stop focusing so much on what's unlikely to happen. Let's enjoy ourselves a little bit.\""
    a "\"Vamos, [mc], probablemente estas sean tus últimas semanas aquí. Deja de centrarte en algo tan improbable. Disfrutemos un poco.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:249
translate spanish a1s6_b38380e1:

    # "The wolf suddenly sits up, brushing the crumbs off his fur before swigging down more wine."
    "El lobo se incorpora, se quita las migas del pelo y bebe más vino."

# game/a1s6.rpy:251
translate spanish a1s6_ec8b7a7e:

    # a "\"Come, let's practice combat.\""
    a "\"Ven, practiquemos el combate.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:252
translate spanish a1s6_06fb94d7:

    # m "\"What? I said I didn't want to do that.\""
    m "\"¿Qué? Dije que no quería.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:254
translate spanish a1s6_4a67ae54:

    # a "\"Well, since you're so worried about Cassius, I'll teach you a few tricks to take him down.\""
    a "\"Como te preocupa Cassius, te enseñaré unos trucos para derribarlo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:255
translate spanish a1s6_55c73a4e:

    # m "\"Take him down?\""
    m "\"¿Derribarlo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:257
translate spanish a1s6_e5940d5a:

    # a "\"Well, I don't trust him to keep his paws to himself now, so if he ever tries to take advantage of you while I'm not around, you can at least hold him off long enough to get away.\""
    a "\"Ya no confío en que mantenga las manos quietas. Si intenta aprovecharse de ti cuando no esté, podrás detenerlo lo suficiente para escapar.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:258
translate spanish a1s6_d5166bfc:

    # m "\"Yeah, and that won't make everything worse.\""
    m "\"Sí, y eso no empeorará todo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:260
translate spanish a1s6_01adf5d8:

    # a "\"Well, after what happened a few days ago, I suppose it can't get much worse.\""
    a "\"Después de lo que pasó hace unos días, supongo que no puede empeorar mucho.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:261
translate spanish a1s6_a75c792e:

    # "I slowly get to my feet, straightening out my robes."
    "Me levanto despacio y me arreglo la túnica."

# game/a1s6.rpy:262
translate spanish a1s6_f881281e:

    # m "\"I'm not so sure about that. Besides, we just ate.\""
    m "\"No estoy tan seguro. Además, acabamos de comer.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:264
translate spanish a1s6_96910dda:

    # "Amicus laughs."
    "Amicus ríe."

# game/a1s6.rpy:265
translate spanish a1s6_06bda32a:

    # a "\"It's not like you're Cato. I think I'll be able to keep my food and drink down.\""
    a "\"No eres Cato. Creo que podré evitar vomitar lo que he comido y bebido.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:266
translate spanish a1s6_ba07af94:

    # m "\"What about me!?\""
    m "\"¡¿Y yo?!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:268
translate spanish a1s6_ebeb9bc0:

    # a "\"I'm not going to hit you or anything.\""
    a "\"No voy a golpearte ni nada.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:270
translate spanish a1s6_55c2b031:

    # "Amicus squares his stance, standing in the sand off to the side of the blanket, still in the shade."
    "Amicus afirma su postura sobre la arena, a un lado de la manta y todavía a la sombra."

# game/a1s6.rpy:271
translate spanish a1s6_920e5d57:

    # "I sigh, recognizing that Amicus is in one of those moods where it's hard to talk him out of doing something."
    "Suspiro: está en uno de esos estados en que cuesta quitarle una idea de la cabeza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:272
translate spanish a1s6_ccfe7d45:

    # "I walk over to stand in front of the wolf, my arms folded."
    "Me acerco y me planto frente al lobo, con los brazos cruzados."

# game/a1s6.rpy:273
translate spanish a1s6_541f5946:

    # a "\"And about Cato...I could probably beat him in a fair fight. He just caught me by surprise that last time.\""
    a "\"Sobre Cato...podría vencerlo en una pelea justa. La última vez me pilló por sorpresa.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:274
translate spanish a1s6_f79b8db2:

    # "I pause, then raise an eyebrow."
    "Me detengo y levanto una ceja."

# game/a1s6.rpy:275
translate spanish a1s6_9d3344cb:

    # m "\"What do you mean?\""
    m "\"¿Qué quieres decir?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:277
translate spanish a1s6_3a023877:

    # a "\"I mean he started fighting no holds barred without warning. I'd have given him the business if I'd known he were going to do that.\""
    a "\"Empezó a luchar sin restricciones ni aviso. Le habría dado lo suyo si hubiera sabido que lo haría.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:278
translate spanish a1s6_594adfd0:

    # m "\"Hey, I don't think of you any less for losing a fight...to an old man.\""
    m "\"Oye, no te tengo en menos por perder una pelea...contra un viejo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:280
translate spanish a1s6_7abfe71f:

    # "Amicus furrows his brow, the way he does when he's realizing that I'm teasing him."
    "Amicus frunce el ceño al comprender que me burlo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:281
translate spanish a1s6_4486aa1d:

    # a "\"I'm serious.\""
    a "\"Hablo en serio.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:282
translate spanish a1s6_dd1fb494:

    # m "\"So am I. I mean, you almost had me that one time in the spaceship. You're a real force to be reckoned with.\""
    m "\"Yo también. Casi me venciste aquella vez en la nave. Eres una fuerza temible.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:284
translate spanish a1s6_1586e4bb:

    # a "\"It's not smart to tease a wolf before a fight, human.\""
    a "\"No es inteligente burlarse de un lobo antes de pelear, humano.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:285
translate spanish a1s6_7446285d:

    # m "\"I'm not teasing.\""
    m "\"No me burlo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:286
translate spanish a1s6_986f488a:

    # a "\"Mhm, and kicking an unsuspecting man in the balls isn't exactly a win in my book.\""
    a "\"Dar una patada en los huevos a alguien desprevenido no cuenta como victoria para mí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:287
translate spanish a1s6_40a7ee18:

    # m "\"It is in mine.\""
    m "\"Para mí sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:288
translate spanish a1s6_9840bd78:

    # a "\"Clearly. Speaking of which—\""
    a "\"Está claro. Hablando de eso—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:290
translate spanish a1s6_c7b8943b:

    # "Amicus suddenly steps forward, thrusting his knee up at my crotch."
    "Amicus da un paso adelante y lanza la rodilla hacia mi entrepierna."

# game/a1s6.rpy:291
translate spanish a1s6_02ef3e6c:

    # "I can only watch in horror as it comes up fast, stopping just an inch from my groin."
    "Solo puedo observar horrorizado cómo asciende deprisa y se detiene a una pulgada de mi ingle."

# game/a1s6.rpy:292
translate spanish a1s6_44d1c0b8:

    # "We both stand there for a moment before I gasp and stumble back, holding my nuts even though Amicus didn't make contact."
    "Nos quedamos quietos un instante; después jadeo y retrocedo, sujetándome los huevos aunque no me haya tocado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:293
translate spanish a1s6_85872ef6:

    # m "\"What the hell!?\""
    m "\"¡¿Qué coño?!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:294
translate spanish a1s6_c5da86f8:

    # a "\"If you don't want Cassius to hold broken bones against you, go for the genitals. That should be enough to stun him. This goes for anyone else who might try to attack you.\""
    a "\"Si no quieres que Cassius te reproche unos huesos rotos, apunta a los genitales. Debería bastar para aturdirlo. Sirve con cualquiera que intente atacarte.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:295
translate spanish a1s6_54c374e5:

    # "Annoyed, I make as if to do the same to Amicus, but he's already blocking."
    "Molesto, amago con hacerle lo mismo a Amicus, pero ya está bloqueando."

# game/a1s6.rpy:297
translate spanish a1s6_06f04491:

    # a "\"Haha! Yes, like that, though try to be a little more subtle. You telegraph your moves far too much.\""
    a "\"¡Jaja! Sí, así, pero sé más sutil. Anuncias demasiado tus movimientos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:298
translate spanish a1s6_04e15d96:

    # "I stop struggling with the wolf, breathing heavily."
    "Dejo de forcejear con el lobo, jadeando."

# game/a1s6.rpy:299
translate spanish a1s6_ef56a217:

    # m "\"Fine...\""
    m "\"Bien...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:300
translate spanish a1s6_fd6e5762:

    # "Then, as Amicus starts to drop his guard, I try to swat him in the crotch."
    "Cuando baja la guardia, intento darle un manotazo en la entrepierna."

# game/a1s6.rpy:301
translate spanish a1s6_b2390548:

    # "He snatches up my hand immediately."
    "Me atrapa la mano enseguida."

# game/a1s6.rpy:303
translate spanish a1s6_b15b88e7:

    # a "\"Ah! Better, [mc], though you should probably try something harder than a flowery slap.\""
    a "\"¡Ah! Mejor, [mc], pero prueba algo más fuerte que un manotazo delicado.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:305
translate spanish a1s6_c2071970:

    # "I try to shove the wolf away, but he steps to the side...and gives me a shove as well."
    "Intento apartarlo, pero se hace a un lado...y también me empuja."

# game/a1s6.rpy:309
translate spanish a1s6_89fbceaa:

    # "I trip over something, and it's not until I'm on my ass that I realize he'd stuck his foot out behind me."
    "Tropiezo y solo al caer de culo comprendo que había puesto el pie detrás de mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:310
translate spanish a1s6_842ca667:

    # "I look up at Amicus as he stands over me, the expression on his face showing me that he's trying very hard not to laugh."
    "Miro hacia Amicus, que está sobre mí intentando con todas sus fuerzas no reírse."

# game/a1s6.rpy:312
translate spanish a1s6_1b0ee8d8:

    # a "\"Tangle up his feet and you should be able to send him to the ground fairly easily. If he breaks any of his bones from the fall, then at least he can't say you did it intentionally.\""
    a "\"Trábale los pies y podrás derribarlo fácilmente. Si se rompe algún hueso en la caída, no podrá decir que lo hiciste a propósito.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:313
translate spanish a1s6_bc6a3c0a:

    # "Amicus reaches down with a paw to help me up."
    "Amicus me tiende una mano para ayudarme."

# game/a1s6.rpy:314
translate spanish a1s6_3f6bf113:

    # "I take it and he pulls me up easily, almost lifting me off my feet."
    "La tomo y me levanta fácilmente, casi despegándome los pies del suelo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:315
translate spanish a1s6_02024f96:

    # m "\"This is great and all, but I don't see how this is gonna help me. I wasn't even the one that broke his tail, and he wanted me killed.\""
    m "\"Está muy bien, pero no veo cómo me ayuda. Ni siquiera fui quien le rompió la cola y quería matarme.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:317
translate spanish a1s6_05f2c03c:

    # a "\"Again, with me standing in his way, he won't ever get the chance to try anything, if he even intends to. This is only to give you a chance to get away from him.\""
    a "\"Conmigo de por medio no tendrá oportunidad de intentar nada, si es que lo pretende. Esto solo te dará una posibilidad de escapar.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:318
translate spanish a1s6_2c03b041:

    # "Amicus brushes the sand off my robes."
    "Amicus me sacude la arena de la túnica."

# game/a1s6.rpy:319
translate spanish a1s6_0c015c99:

    # a "\"Besides, this is useful in any situation, not just for Cassi-US!\""
    a "\"Además, sirve en cualquier situación, no solo con Cassi-US!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:321
translate spanish a1s6_034cfcb2:

    # "Amicus chokes on his last syllable as I ram my shoulder into him, grabbing at his legs to try and trip him up, kind of like I saw Cato do to him in the amphitheater."
    "Se atraganta con la última sílaba cuando lo embisto con el hombro y le agarro las piernas para derribarlo, como vi hacer a Cato en el anfiteatro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:322
translate spanish a1s6_fe025f7c:

    # "Obviously, someone as small as me going up against a hulking wolf like Amicus is bound to fail, but the wolf does stumble back a few steps."
    "Alguien tan pequeño como yo está condenado a fracasar ante un lobo enorme como Amicus, pero lo hago retroceder unos pasos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:323
translate spanish a1s6_8f863953:

    # a "\"H-hey!\""
    a "\"¡E-eh!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:325
translate spanish a1s6_30fa954f:

    # "Amicus chuckles and I feel him let himself fall backwards to the sand."
    "Amicus se ríe y siento que se deja caer hacia atrás sobre la arena."

# game/a1s6.rpy:327
translate spanish a1s6_27c50037:

    # "It reminds me of the last time we'd wrestled on the beach, except now I end up on top with my fall cushioned by his body, my face bouncing against his massive chest."
    "Me recuerda a la última vez que luchamos en la playa, pero ahora quedo encima y su cuerpo amortigua la caída; mi cara rebota contra su enorme pecho."

# game/a1s6.rpy:328
translate spanish a1s6_88a4717d:

    # "Amicus grins at me."
    "Amicus me sonríe."

# game/a1s6.rpy:329
translate spanish a1s6_c944c6e5:

    # a "\"Oof! Not bad, not bad. With a little more force, you might be able to knock down someone as small as Cassius.\""
    a "\"¡Uf! Nada mal. Con más fuerza podrías derribar a alguien tan pequeño como Cassius.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:330
translate spanish a1s6_7287699b:

    # "I pin the wolf down, my hands on his shoulders."
    "Lo inmovilizo con las manos en sus hombros."

# game/a1s6.rpy:331
translate spanish a1s6_88a7f45c:

    # m "\"Oh please, I knocked you down fair and squ-ARE!\""
    m "\"Por favor, te derribé limpiamente y sin tram-PAS!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:332
translate spanish a1s6_4cb4c65b:

    # "This time, I'm the one to yelp on my last syllable, Amicus easily reversing our positions as he rolls us both over."
    "Esta vez grito en la última sílaba: Amicus invierte fácilmente nuestras posiciones y nos hace rodar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:333
translate spanish a1s6_27727ee9:

    # "I find myself staring up at the wolf, his massive paws on my shoulders, his knees spread to either side of my thighs as he's careful not to rest his weight on top of me."
    "Miro al lobo sobre mí, con sus enormes manos en mis hombros y las rodillas a ambos lados de mis muslos; procura no dejar caer su peso encima."

# game/a1s6.rpy:334
translate spanish a1s6_9dde583c:

    # "He grins down at me, chest heaving for breath as his tongue dangles out his muzzle a bit, the way it sometimes does when he's buzzed, giving his grin a dopey quality."
    "Me sonríe jadeando, con la lengua un poco fuera del hocico, como cuando está algo bebido; eso le da un aire bobalicón."

# game/a1s6.rpy:335
translate spanish a1s6_29c5c964:

    # "He's hunched over me to the point where his tongue almost touches my nose."
    "Está tan inclinado sobre mí que su lengua casi toca mi nariz."

# game/a1s6.rpy:336
translate spanish a1s6_a4104dae:

    # "Although I try to keep my face in a scowl, I can't stop the smile from coming through, and pretty soon I'm laughing a little."
    "Intento mantener el ceño fruncido, pero no puedo ocultar la sonrisa y pronto me río un poco."

# game/a1s6.rpy:337
translate spanish a1s6_17a9190b:

    # "I'm about to tell Amicus that this whole thing is hardly fair when he leans down fully, pressing his lips to mine in a kiss."
    "Voy a decirle que esto no es nada justo cuando se inclina del todo y me besa en los labios."

# game/a1s6.rpy:339
translate spanish a1s6_1f9a4ea1:

    # "I gasp in surprise, but it's through my nose as my mouth is sealed to his."
    "Jadeo sorprendido, pero por la nariz, porque mi boca está pegada a la suya."

# game/a1s6.rpy:340
translate spanish a1s6_2430a4df:

    # "My eyes are wide, his closed as he presses harder against my lips."
    "Tengo los ojos muy abiertos; él los cierra y aprieta más sus labios contra los míos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:341
translate spanish a1s6_3fc2438f:

    # "As he'd bent over me, his paws left my shoulders to instead hold my head steady, one paw against my cheek, the other cupped around my head, his whole body huddling around my face."
    "Al inclinarse dejó mis hombros para sujetarme la cabeza: una mano contra mi mejilla y otra rodeando la cabeza, con todo su cuerpo acurrucado alrededor de mi rostro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:342
translate spanish a1s6_be90baa7:

    # "I don't move, not hugging back, but not turning away either."
    "No me muevo; no lo abrazo, pero tampoco aparto la cara."

# game/a1s6.rpy:343
translate spanish a1s6_db234f12:

    # "Instead, I just lay there as I feel my heart skip a beat, the feeling of the big, strong wolf crouched over me, kissing me, sending a thrill from my chest down to my crotch."
    "Me quedo tumbado, sintiendo un vuelco del corazón; el gran lobo fuerte sobre mí, besándome, me envía una emoción del pecho a la entrepierna."

# game/a1s6.rpy:344
translate spanish a1s6_3aff93a7:

    # "The wolf's broad, cold nose twitches against mine before a hot huff of breath escapes it and washes over my face."
    "Su ancha nariz fría se mueve contra la mía; después un cálido soplo de aire me baña el rostro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:345
translate spanish a1s6_2cbdbe37:

    # "At the same time, Amicus suddenly rolls off of me, our lips parting just as quickly as they'd connected as he flops to the side on his back, mirroring my spread-eagle position."
    "Al mismo tiempo Amicus rueda fuera de encima de mí; los labios se separan tan rápido como se unieron y queda boca arriba a mi lado, con brazos y piernas abiertos como yo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:346
translate spanish a1s6_2bfbf961:

    # "We lay there next to each other, my heart hammering as I listen to the wolf breathing heavily next to me."
    "Nos quedamos tumbados juntos; el corazón me martillea mientras lo oigo respirar con fuerza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:348
translate spanish a1s6_8c4eeb7b:

    # "Aside from that, the only other sounds are the waves washing up against the shore a few dozen yards away."
    "Aparte de eso, solo se oyen las olas en la orilla, a unas pocas docenas de yardas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:349
translate spanish a1s6_5a4ec406:

    # "A few minutes pass in silence as I wait for the wolf to say something."
    "Pasan unos minutos en silencio mientras espero que diga algo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:350
translate spanish a1s6_4731fc45:

    # "He doesn't, and finally it gets to the point where {i}I{/i} have to say something."
    "No lo hace y al final tengo que hablar {i}yo{/i}."

# game/a1s6.rpy:351
translate spanish a1s6_2a419574:

    # m "\"Soooo...\""
    m "\"Así queee...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:353
translate spanish a1s6_8ca1e2e3:

    # a "\"Hm?\""
    a "\"¿Hm?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:354
translate spanish a1s6_57ba4367:

    # "Amicus responds instantly with an innocent, inquisitive grunt."
    "Amicus responde enseguida con un gruñido inocente e inquisitivo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:355
translate spanish a1s6_30c1e05a:

    # m "\"Uh...what was that?\""
    m "\"Eh...¿qué ha sido eso?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:357
translate spanish a1s6_2b5d6c7c:

    # a "\"'That'...Oh, the kiss?\""
    a "\"'Eso'... Ah, ¿el beso?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:358
translate spanish a1s6_bf023949:

    # m "\"Yeah...\""
    m "\"Sí...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:359
translate spanish a1s6_b18f15a5:

    # a "\"Just thought I owed it to you after Meera. I botched it during the performance after all.\""
    a "\"Pensé que te lo debía después de Meera. Al fin y al cabo, lo arruiné durante la actuación.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:360
translate spanish a1s6_ad6689ae:

    # "The wolf sounds distant, distracted, like he's not paying attention to me."
    "El lobo suena distante, distraído, como si no me estuviera prestando atención."

# game/a1s6.rpy:361
translate spanish a1s6_784c9da8:

    # "I finally prop myself up on an elbow, looking directly at Amicus now."
    "Por fin me incorporo apoyándome en un codo y miro directamente a Amicus."

# game/a1s6.rpy:362
translate spanish a1s6_0b4eb0fa:

    # m "\"Really?\""
    m "\"¿De verdad?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:364
translate spanish a1s6_dd446c7b:

    # "Like a child, Amicus looks away toward the lake, not saying anything."
    "Como un niño, Amicus aparta la mirada hacia el lago sin decir nada."

# game/a1s6.rpy:365
translate spanish a1s6_f8415527:

    # "I wait a while longer, giving him a chance to respond, a chance he doesn't take."
    "Espero un poco más, dándole una oportunidad de responder que no aprovecha."

# game/a1s6.rpy:366
translate spanish a1s6_3f739ce1:

    # "I sigh."
    "Suspiro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:367
translate spanish a1s6_72c38985:

    # m "\"Talk to me.\""
    m "\"Habla conmigo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:368
translate spanish a1s6_69c17fb7:

    # a "\"What is there to say?\""
    a "\"¿Qué hay que decir?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:369
translate spanish a1s6_e499761a_2:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/a1s6.rpy:370
translate spanish a1s6_4bea4da2:

    # m "\"A lot. I'm kinda confused honestly.\""
    m "\"Mucho. La verdad es que estoy bastante confundido.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:371
translate spanish a1s6_d287c430:

    # "A big, huffing sigh, then—"
    "Un gran suspiro resoplado, y luego—"

# game/a1s6.rpy:372
translate spanish a1s6_146d1898:

    # a "\"I like you, [mc], quite a bit in fact.\""
    a "\"Me gustas, [mc]; bastante, de hecho.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:373
translate spanish a1s6_c2ae1f7a:

    # m "\"I know. I like you too.\""
    m "\"Lo sé. Tú también me gustas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:374
translate spanish a1s6_cd4b90bb:

    # "We'd technically confessed our feelings to each other when Amicus asked me on that \"date\", but only technically."
    "Técnicamente nos habíamos confesado nuestros sentimientos cuando Amicus me invitó a aquella \"cita\", pero solo técnicamente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:375
translate spanish a1s6_aa7aedc6:

    # m "\"Are you drunk?\""
    m "\"¿Estás borracho?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:376
translate spanish a1s6_2e6a67e0:

    # a "\"...Maybe a little...but I knew what I was doing.\""
    a "\"...Puede que un poco... pero sabía lo que estaba haciendo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:377
translate spanish a1s6_486859e8:

    # "More silence."
    "Más silencio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:378
translate spanish a1s6_74b1ef73:

    # m "\"Amicus.\""
    m "\"Amicus.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:379
translate spanish a1s6_8ca1e2e3_1:

    # a "\"Hm?\""
    a "\"¿Hm?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:380
translate spanish a1s6_832b0432:

    # m "\"Could you look at me?\""
    m "\"¿Podrías mirarme?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:381
translate spanish a1s6_2cccdee7:

    # "Amicus's ears go flat, then he slowly turns his head toward me, but his eyes are down, looking at my chest rather than my face."
    "Amicus aplana las orejas y luego vuelve despacio la cabeza hacia mí, pero mantiene los ojos bajos, mirando mi pecho en lugar de mi cara."

# game/a1s6.rpy:382
translate spanish a1s6_a3f87669:

    # "I think about making a \"my eyes are up here\" joke, but I know it'll fall flat with him."
    "Se me ocurre hacer una broma de \"mis ojos están aquí arriba\", pero sé que no la entendería."

# game/a1s6.rpy:383
translate spanish a1s6_fbbab472:

    # m "\"Listen, we've already sort of talked about this. The problem is the situation we're in. It makes the whole...dating thing impossible.\""
    m "\"Escucha, ya hemos hablado más o menos de esto. El problema es la situación en la que estamos. Hace imposible todo eso de... salir juntos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:384
translate spanish a1s6_5005d8cd:

    # "I see Amicus smile at the word, then frown again."
    "Veo a Amicus sonreír al oír la palabra y luego volver a fruncir el ceño."

# game/a1s6.rpy:385
translate spanish a1s6_47f9e7fe:

    # a "\"I know...but if we feel the same, why not be a little closer? I know you'll have to leave soon, but that doesn't mean we can't enjoy the time we have together.\""
    a "\"Lo sé... pero si sentimos lo mismo, ¿por qué no acercarnos un poco más? Sé que tendrás que marcharte pronto, pero eso no significa que no podamos disfrutar del tiempo que tenemos juntos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:386
translate spanish a1s6_067872ce:

    # m "\"Sure...but I think that'll make saying goodbye a little harder, don't you?\""
    m "\"Claro... pero creo que eso hará que despedirnos sea un poco más difícil, ¿no te parece?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:387
translate spanish a1s6_8d9a2409:

    # a "\"Maybe. But we'll find a way to see each other again.\""
    a "\"Quizá. Pero encontraremos una manera de volver a vernos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:388
translate spanish a1s6_cae6ae7a:

    # "What he's saying makes sense, but this whole situation has red flags all over it."
    "Lo que dice tiene sentido, pero toda esta situación está llena de señales de alarma."

# game/a1s6.rpy:389
translate spanish a1s6_4affea70:

    # "Having feelings for my abductor in a situation that's completely illegal is so wrong in so many ways."
    "Sentir algo por mi secuestrador en una situación completamente ilegal está mal de muchísimas maneras."

# game/a1s6.rpy:390
translate spanish a1s6_6c7cd7fa:

    # "Amicus is talking about it like it could be an innocent fling, but this feels like more than that."
    "Amicus habla de ello como si pudiera ser una aventura inocente, pero siento que es más que eso."

# game/a1s6.rpy:391
translate spanish a1s6_95d4df7f:

    # "The wolf has the the same dejected look he'd worn when he'd came out to me a few weeks ago."
    "El lobo tiene la misma expresión abatida que cuando me confesó su orientación hace unas semanas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:392
translate spanish a1s6_c879ead4:

    # "So, I reach out a hand and rest it in his paw."
    "Así que extiendo una mano y la dejo en su zarpa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:394
translate spanish a1s6_b1d5dced:

    # "He looks at me then, ears still low, but his expression hopeful."
    "Entonces me mira, con las orejas aún bajas, pero con una expresión esperanzada."

# game/a1s6.rpy:395
translate spanish a1s6_31f7ea7d:

    # m "\"Everything's just so messed up and complicated.\""
    m "\"Todo está tan mal y es tan complicado.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:397
translate spanish a1s6_0082f079:

    # a "\"Yes...I'm sorry. I shouldn't have kissed you.\""
    a "\"Sí... Lo siento. No debería haberte besado.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:398
translate spanish a1s6_320c31e4:

    # m "\"Maybe not...\""
    m "\"Quizá no...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:399
translate spanish a1s6_17df0a8d:

    # "I swallow."
    "Trago saliva."

# game/a1s6.rpy:400
translate spanish a1s6_9147498c:

    # m "\"But I liked it.\""
    m "\"Pero me gustó.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:402
translate spanish a1s6_e8275c27:

    # "Amicus snaps his eyes back up to look at me."
    "Amicus alza de golpe los ojos para mirarme."

# game/a1s6.rpy:403
translate spanish a1s6_af121244:

    # a "\"Really?\""
    a "\"¿De verdad?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:404
translate spanish a1s6_c806ebc0:

    # m "\"Yeah.\""
    m "\"Sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:406
translate spanish a1s6_d6486976:

    # "The wolf lets out a huge sigh of relief."
    "El lobo deja escapar un enorme suspiro de alivio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:408
translate spanish a1s6_a38a5226:

    # a "\"You didn't kiss back though. It worried me that I'd made a mistake once again.\""
    a "\"Pero no me devolviste el beso. Me preocupó haber vuelto a cometer un error.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:409
translate spanish a1s6_0195d320:

    # m "\"I was surprised is all...and what do you mean, 'once again'?\""
    m "\"Solo estaba sorprendido... ¿y qué quieres decir con 'vuelto'?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:410
translate spanish a1s6_bc62fb25:

    # "The wolf seems to contemplate something, then turns on his side too, finally facing me."
    "El lobo parece reflexionar sobre algo y luego se tumba también de lado, por fin de cara a mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:412
translate spanish a1s6_172e0a7f:

    # a "\"About five years ago, I shared my first kiss with another male.\""
    a "\"Hace unos cinco años, di mi primer beso a otro macho.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:413
translate spanish a1s6_ba8d8248:

    # m "\"Oh?\""
    m "\"¿Ah, sí?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:414
translate spanish a1s6_4c19475c:

    # a "\"At the time, there were rumors that I'd...performed poorly with a female my father had arranged me to be with.\""
    a "\"Por entonces corrían rumores de que... no había rendido bien con una hembra con la que mi padre había dispuesto que estuviera.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:415
translate spanish a1s6_2d6ee573:

    # m "\"Oh.\""
    m "\"Ah.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:417
translate spanish a1s6_b6208523:

    # "Amicus's ears turn red."
    "Las orejas de Amicus se ponen rojas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:418
translate spanish a1s6_6d1cb705:

    # a "\"Anyway, so this male approaches me during the summer festival. He was the son of one of the triumvirs of Tricelli. He made it very clear what he wanted from me.\""
    a "\"En fin, aquel macho se me acercó durante el festival de verano. Era hijo de uno de los triunviros de Tricelli. Dejó muy claro lo que quería de mí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:420
translate spanish a1s6_8c284b7e:

    # a "\"He kissed me on the balcony while a covert drone recorded the exchange. It was broadcast on the information channels the next day.\""
    a "\"Me besó en el balcón mientras un dron oculto grababa el encuentro. Al día siguiente lo emitieron en los canales de información.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:421
translate spanish a1s6_e499761a_3:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/a1s6.rpy:422
translate spanish a1s6_fdcfd18e:

    # m "\"Why?\""
    m "\"¿Por qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:423
translate spanish a1s6_5032ff83:

    # "Amicus shrugs, looking down at the sand."
    "Amicus se encoge de hombros, mirando la arena."

# game/a1s6.rpy:424
translate spanish a1s6_03c5b896:

    # a "\"The triumvir had a past grievance with my father. He used mine and his own son's sexual preferences to get back at him.\""
    a "\"El triunviro tenía un antiguo agravio contra mi padre. Usó mis preferencias sexuales y las de su propio hijo para vengarse de él.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:425
translate spanish a1s6_bc6da920:

    # m "\"What happened then?\""
    m "\"¿Qué pasó después?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:427
translate spanish a1s6_a906ceff:

    # a "\"Well, father used his power to shut down the networks along with banishing the triumvir and his family to {i}Ancoris{/i}.\""
    a "\"Bueno, padre utilizó su poder para cerrar las redes, además de desterrar al triunviro y a su familia a {i}Ancoris{/i}.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:428
translate spanish a1s6_4b3e3ce1:

    # "Amicus nods up at the sky where {i}Ancoris{/i} looms monolithically in its faded, chalky gray."
    "Amicus señala con un movimiento de cabeza el cielo, donde {i}Ancoris{/i} se alza como un monolito de un gris pálido, como de tiza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:429
translate spanish a1s6_97367a05:

    # a "\"It was an unpopular decision, but father felt it had to be done. Obviously it's left me a bit worried about kissing...and pursuing other men.\""
    a "\"Fue una decisión impopular, pero padre creía que era necesaria. Evidentemente, me ha dejado algo preocupado por besar...y por intentar salir con otros varones.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:430
translate spanish a1s6_e7757e5d:

    # "I squeeze his paw."
    "Le aprieto la zarpa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:431
translate spanish a1s6_6cdfe0e1:

    # m "\"Well, you don't have to worry about that with me, obviously. I don't know anyone here, and I'm trying to stay out of other people's business as much as possible.\""
    m "\"Bueno, conmigo no tienes que preocuparte por eso, evidentemente. No conozco a nadie aquí e intento mantenerme al margen de los asuntos de los demás tanto como puedo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:433
translate spanish a1s6_f27c8d9c:

    # a "\"I know.\""
    a "\"Lo sé.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:434
translate spanish a1s6_0cab938b:

    # "Amicus squeezes back."
    "Amicus me devuelve el apretón."

# game/a1s6.rpy:436
translate spanish a1s6_d2677040:

    # a "\"I'm still sorry though, I should have asked, or...not done it.\""
    a "\"Aun así, lo siento. Debería habértelo preguntado o... no haberlo hecho.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:437
translate spanish a1s6_5eee7f91:

    # m "\"You're fine.\""
    m "\"No pasa nada.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:438
translate spanish a1s6_4c07a1a9:

    # "Another stretch of silence, and I get the feeling that Amicus is waiting for an answer which he confirms with what he says next."
    "Pasa otro rato en silencio y tengo la impresión de que Amicus espera una respuesta, algo que confirma con lo que dice a continuación."

# game/a1s6.rpy:440
translate spanish a1s6_a58437d3:

    # a "\"So...if you're fine with it, did you want to...date me?\""
    a "\"Entonces... si te parece bien, ¿querrías... salir conmigo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:441
translate spanish a1s6_01836e48:

    # "Amicus says the foreign word very carefully, and for a moment the Lingua skips a beat in its steady translation, allowing him to speak the word unfiltered."
    "Amicus pronuncia la expresión extranjera con mucho cuidado y, por un momento, la Lingua se salta un paso de su traducción constante, permitiéndole decirla sin filtrar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:442
translate spanish a1s6_31eb523f:

    # "It's still his voice, but the heavy accent that comes through is surprising, even a little sexy."
    "Sigue siendo su voz, pero el fuerte acento que se oye resulta sorprendente, incluso un poco sexy."

# game/a1s6.rpy:443
translate spanish a1s6_591179fc:

    # "I know I should say no though, the red flags fluttering ominously around our precarious, even dangerous situation."
    "Sé que debería decir que no, con las señales de alarma ondeando ominosamente alrededor de nuestra precaria e incluso peligrosa situación."

# game/a1s6.rpy:444
translate spanish a1s6_80f1b8ae:

    # m "\"I'll...think about it over the next few days, then let you know.\""
    m "\"Lo... pensaré durante los próximos días y luego te lo diré.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:445
translate spanish a1s6_e65c3ebd:

    # "Amicus smiles a little."
    "Amicus sonríe un poco."

# game/a1s6.rpy:447
translate spanish a1s6_d9660094:

    # a "\"Okay.\""
    a "\"Vale.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:448
translate spanish a1s6_e5d25c7a:

    # m "\"But you need to be focusing on the trial, so no thinking about this while I'm deciding.\""
    m "\"Pero debes centrarte en la prueba, así que nada de pensar en esto mientras tomo una decisión.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:450
translate spanish a1s6_99851fb5:

    # a "\"Of course!\""
    a "\"¡Por supuesto!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:451
translate spanish a1s6_18e41726:

    # "I groan inwardly as I realize I've just added another distraction to the wolf's goal of becoming emperor."
    "Gimo para mis adentros al darme cuenta de que acabo de añadir otra distracción al objetivo del lobo de convertirse en emperador."

# game/a1s6.rpy:452
translate spanish a1s6_914a3804:

    # m "\"You promise this won't distract you?\""
    m "\"¿Prometes que esto no te distraerá?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:454
translate spanish a1s6_8d1f5b0c:

    # a "\"Definitely not!\""
    a "\"¡Por supuesto que no!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:455
translate spanish a1s6_c6b63358:

    # "I give the wolf a look of disbelief and he responds with a glare."
    "Miro al lobo con incredulidad y él responde con una mirada airada."

# game/a1s6.rpy:457
translate spanish a1s6_408a0e39:

    # a "\"[mc], I've wanted this my entire life. I know it might not have seemed like it earlier, but I'm taking this very, very seriously.\""
    a "\"[mc], llevo deseando esto toda mi vida. Sé que antes quizá no lo parecía, pero me lo estoy tomando muy, muy en serio.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:458
translate spanish a1s6_aec069e4:

    # m "\"And I won't be a distraction?\""
    m "\"¿Y yo no seré una distracción?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:460
translate spanish a1s6_ef7eca93:

    # a "\"Of course not, in fact I think it would be rather positive for me to know that you...return my feelings to some degree. It gives me even more confidence.\""
    a "\"Por supuesto que no. De hecho, creo que sería bastante positivo para mí saber que tú... correspondes a mis sentimientos en cierta medida. Me da aún más confianza.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:461
translate spanish a1s6_bc8ec571:

    # m "\"Oh God, no...\""
    m "\"Ay, Dios, no...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:463
translate spanish a1s6_4b87ac29:

    # a "\"Hey.\""
    a "\"Eh.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:464
translate spanish a1s6_042d6add:

    # "Amicus sets a paw on my shoulder and it looks like he wants to lean in and kiss me again...but he doesn't."
    "Amicus me pone una zarpa en el hombro y parece querer inclinarse para besarme otra vez... pero no lo hace."

# game/a1s6.rpy:465
translate spanish a1s6_879bb97d:

    # a "\"Thank you for understanding and for putting up with me. I have a good feeling about...well, everything now.\""
    a "\"Gracias por comprenderlo y por aguantarme. Ahora tengo un buen presentimiento sobre... bueno, sobre todo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:467
translate spanish a1s6_07b98246:

    # "I don't know how much I agree considering our situation is causing us so many problems, but I set my hand on his paw anyway."
    "No sé hasta qué punto estoy de acuerdo, teniendo en cuenta los muchos problemas que nos causa nuestra situación, pero de todos modos pongo mi mano sobre su zarpa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:468
translate spanish a1s6_910f899d:

    # m "\"Sure.\""
    m "\"Claro.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:472
translate spanish a1s6_026faffd:

    # "Our relationship after that conversation is...strange, to say the least."
    "Nuestra relación después de aquella conversación es... extraña, por decirlo suavemente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:473
translate spanish a1s6_6aafc7fe:

    # "While it felt meaningful at the time, I realize later that we didn't really get anywhere except once again admit to the feelings we'd been having over the past few weeks."
    "Aunque en aquel momento me pareció significativa, después me doy cuenta de que no avanzamos realmente, salvo por admitir una vez más los sentimientos que llevábamos teniendo en las últimas semanas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:474
translate spanish a1s6_7944cb56:

    # "Amicus is extra careful about touching me now, probably because he doesn't want me to misconstrue it for something more than it is."
    "Ahora Amicus tiene especial cuidado al tocarme, probablemente porque no quiere que interprete sus gestos como algo más de lo que son."

# game/a1s6.rpy:475
translate spanish a1s6_1a540000:

    # "At the same time, our conversations have become less casual and joking, more stiff and awkward."
    "Al mismo tiempo, nuestras conversaciones se han vuelto menos distendidas y bromistas, y más rígidas e incómodas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:476
translate spanish a1s6_5fbbfa50:

    # "I hate it."
    "Lo odio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:477
translate spanish a1s6_4a0abce1:

    # "In any other situation, I'd want to just sit down and talk my feelings out with the person...but Amicus is different."
    "En cualquier otra situación querría sentarme y hablar de mis sentimientos con esa persona... pero Amicus es diferente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:478
translate spanish a1s6_285613fb:

    # "First of all, he's an alien, and having the feelings that I do for an alien, a wolf alien at that, is weird."
    "Para empezar, es un extraterrestre, y sentir lo que siento por un extraterrestre, y además un lobo extraterrestre, es raro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:479
translate spanish a1s6_c29a880d:

    # "Secondly, this relationship, this closeness...it's just not important in the grand scheme of things."
    "En segundo lugar, esta relación, esta cercanía... simplemente no es importante dentro del conjunto de las cosas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:480
translate spanish a1s6_271987f9:

    # "We're currently doing something so illegal that, if it were to be found out, it could bring the entire empire to a stand-still...at least more than it already is."
    "Ahora mismo estamos haciendo algo tan ilegal que, si se descubriera, podría paralizar todo el imperio... al menos más de lo que ya está."

# game/a1s6.rpy:481
translate spanish a1s6_7ec783c5:

    # "So instead of playing out one of the cheesy, wolven romance dramas I've seen on Adastran television, maybe instead I should be focusing on how the hell I'm going to exist in this empire, especially if the second trial falls through."
    "Así que, en lugar de representar uno de esos cursis dramas románticos de lobos que he visto en la televisión de Adastra, quizá debería centrarme en cómo demonios voy a vivir en este imperio, especialmente si la segunda prueba sale mal."

# game/a1s6.rpy:482
translate spanish a1s6_bf0874e3:

    # "But..."
    "Pero..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:483
translate spanish a1s6_73543f56:

    # "Amicus wants a relationship with me, that much he's made clear."
    "Amicus quiere tener una relación conmigo; eso lo ha dejado claro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:484
translate spanish a1s6_baf2f0d1:

    # "I just wonder if it truly would help him like he says it will, or if he's just saying that so I'll give him what he wants."
    "Solo me pregunto si de verdad le ayudaría como dice, o si lo dice para que le dé lo que quiere."

# game/a1s6.rpy:485
translate spanish a1s6_1436494c:

    # "I don't doubt that the wolf likes me...maybe even more than that, but we've only known each other for about a month."
    "No dudo que le gusto al lobo... quizá incluso más que eso, pero solo nos conocemos desde hace alrededor de un mes."

# game/a1s6.rpy:486
translate spanish a1s6_dbb5c5e5:

    # "Do we really even know anything about each other?"
    "¿De verdad sabemos algo siquiera el uno del otro?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:487
translate spanish a1s6_ed03d88d:

    # "Despite all of this, and after a few days of thinking about it, I start to warm up to the idea."
    "A pesar de todo, y después de pensarlo durante unos días, la idea empieza a gustarme."

# game/a1s6.rpy:488
translate spanish a1s6_71deefe7:

    # "We both know it'll be short, an \"innocent fling\" like I'd thought of it earlier."
    "Ambos sabemos que será breve, un \"devaneo inocente\", como lo había considerado antes."

# game/a1s6.rpy:489
translate spanish a1s6_1c1b7d1c:

    # "I could be leaving for Earth any time in the next month, but..."
    "Podría partir hacia la Tierra en cualquier momento del próximo mes, pero..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:490
translate spanish a1s6_37025632:

    # "I can't deny that I really like him too."
    "No puedo negar que él también me gusta mucho."

# game/a1s6.rpy:491
translate spanish a1s6_0cd01972:

    # "An innocent fling."
    "Una aventura inocente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:492
translate spanish a1s6_2c3adb65:

    # "The more I say that in my head, the better it sounds."
    "Cuanto más me lo repito mentalmente, mejor suena."

# game/a1s6.rpy:493
translate spanish a1s6_c706f54d:

    # "Despite everything, knowing that I could have a relationship with an alien, the son of an emperor...actually, someone who will likely become the emperor...that's kinda cool."
    "A pesar de todo, saber que podría tener una relación con un extraterrestre, el hijo de un emperador... en realidad, alguien que probablemente se convertirá en emperador... es bastante genial."

# game/a1s6.rpy:494
translate spanish a1s6_c5ca5916:

    # "Besides, he did say it would help him with his confidence for the trial."
    "Además, dijo que le ayudaría a tener confianza para la prueba."

# game/a1s6.rpy:495
translate spanish a1s6_9b53820e:

    # "And finally, I'm tired of this awkwardness between us."
    "Y, por último, estoy cansado de esta incomodidad entre nosotros."

# game/a1s6.rpy:496
translate spanish a1s6_9d513c18:

    # "Amicus is my friend, and I want to be able to talk normally with him again."
    "Amicus es mi amigo y quiero poder volver a hablar con él con normalidad."

# game/a1s6.rpy:497
translate spanish a1s6_8cb14575:

    # "I'm pretty sure making things official will clear everything up."
    "Estoy bastante seguro de que hacer oficial lo nuestro lo aclarará todo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:499
translate spanish a1s6_5bc77da6:

    # "I just have to go about doing it the right way...."
    "Solo tengo que hacerlo de la manera adecuada...."

# game/a1s6.rpy:503
translate spanish a1s6_f626817f:

    # "The day before the trial, Amicus shoos me and Alex out into the gardens."
    "El día antes de la prueba, Amicus nos manda a Alex y a mí a los jardines."

# game/a1s6.rpy:504
translate spanish a1s6_aec368b1:

    # "It's strange, but he tells us that they need to be tended to considering that the camera drones are going to sweep over the grounds for an opening shot before the second trial begins."
    "Es extraño, pero nos dice que hay que cuidarlos, puesto que los drones con cámara recorrerán los terrenos para una toma de apertura antes de que comience la segunda prueba."

# game/a1s6.rpy:505
translate spanish a1s6_9d5a2334:

    # "It's the first time he's ever really asked me to do a task, and when I point that out to him, he says that he also needs time alone to practice his speech."
    "Es la primera vez que me pide realmente que haga una tarea y, cuando se lo señalo, dice que también necesita tiempo a solas para practicar su discurso."

# game/a1s6.rpy:506
translate spanish a1s6_58b03902:

    # "That makes sense, but it's still a little odd."
    "Tiene sentido, pero aun así es un poco raro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:507
translate spanish a1s6_cab39af7:

    # "Alex and I stand in the gardens, picking at the weeds just like I had on my first day at the palace."
    "Alex y yo estamos en los jardines, arrancando malas hierbas igual que hice en mi primer día en el palacio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:508
translate spanish a1s6_46a8e7b8:

    # "It's hard to believe a month's gone by, even with the nineteen hour days."
    "Cuesta creer que haya pasado un mes, incluso con los días de diecinueve horas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:509
translate spanish a1s6_12f1477f:

    # "I guess it's been about three weeks in Earth time."
    "Supongo que han sido unas tres semanas terrestres."

# game/a1s6.rpy:510
translate spanish a1s6_dbe614e9:

    # "I get to work pulling up the small white flowers, the ones that seem to grow in every crevice of the garden."
    "Me pongo a arrancar las pequeñas flores blancas, esas que parecen crecer en cada grieta del jardín."

# game/a1s6.rpy:511
translate spanish a1s6_1fc9980c:

    # m "\"You'd think the drones would be smart enough to take care of the weeds themselves.\""
    m "\"Uno pensaría que los drones serían lo bastante inteligentes para encargarse ellos mismos de las malas hierbas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:513
translate spanish a1s6_bc7092f3:

    # al "\"Well, they don't have appendages to pull with. All they could really do is use their high-powered lasers, but that risks starting fires.\""
    al "\"Bueno, no tienen apéndices con los que arrancarlas. Lo único que podrían hacer sería usar sus láseres de gran potencia, pero eso conlleva el riesgo de provocar incendios.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:514
translate spanish a1s6_fdf10af1:

    # m "\"The drones have lasers?\""
    m "\"¿Los drones tienen láseres?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:516
translate spanish a1s6_b90d68c5:

    # al "\"Oh yes, they need some form of a defense mechanism.\""
    al "\"Oh, sí, necesitan algún tipo de mecanismo de defensa.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:517
translate spanish a1s6_887e49fb:

    # m "\"Huh...\""
    m "\"Ah...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:519
translate spanish a1s6_129bbb13:

    # al "\"I mean, it's not like they'd ever use it on you. Even if they did, it's not enough to kill you, at least not quickly. Just leaves nasty burns.\""
    al "\"Bueno, no es que fueran a usarlos contra ti. Incluso si lo hicieran, no bastarían para matarte, al menos no rápidamente. Solo dejan quemaduras horribles.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:520
translate spanish a1s6_d985ab4e:

    # "I find myself continuing to glance up at an Adastran spider sitting motionlessly on the wall of the palace."
    "Sigo echando miradas hacia una araña de Adastra que permanece inmóvil en la pared del palacio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:521
translate spanish a1s6_f1c804af:

    # m "\"Wish they'd use them on those hideous things.\""
    m "\"Ojalá los usaran contra esas cosas horribles.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:522
translate spanish a1s6_d68ebc49:

    # "It takes Alex a moment to see what I'm looking at."
    "Alex tarda un momento en ver lo que estoy mirando."

# game/a1s6.rpy:524
translate spanish a1s6_9998f481:

    # al "\"Oh, [mc], you know those are important for the—\""
    al "\"Oh, [mc], sabes que son importantes para el—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:525
translate spanish a1s6_c7379c40:

    # m "\"—Ecosystem, yeah, I know. Doesn't make them any less disgusting. Imagine one of those things biting you.\""
    m "\"—Ecosistema, sí, ya lo sé. Eso no las hace menos asquerosas. Imagínate que una de esas cosas te muerde.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:527
translate spanish a1s6_8d86e210:

    # al "\"Indeed, though honestly I've been vaccinated so many times after coming to Adastra that sharp, pointy things don't scare me so much anymore.\""
    al "\"Desde luego, aunque la verdad es que me han vacunado tantas veces desde que vine a Adastra que las cosas afiladas y puntiagudas ya no me dan tanto miedo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:528
translate spanish a1s6_06461156:

    # "We work quietly for a few more minutes, Alex lazily humming as I try to think of a way to bring something up that I've wanted to talk about with the cat."
    "Seguimos trabajando en silencio durante unos minutos más; Alex tararea con desgana mientras intento encontrar una manera de sacar un tema del que quería hablar con el gato."

# game/a1s6.rpy:529
translate spanish a1s6_cc7caf8c:

    # m "\"Soo...\""
    m "\"Bueeno...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:531
translate spanish a1s6_6a14791d:

    # al "\"So?\""
    al "\"¿Bueno?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:532
translate spanish a1s6_089992ea:

    # "I watch as Alex's paws work fast, plucking the weeds with speed and precision."
    "Observo cómo las zarpas de Alex trabajan deprisa, arrancando las malas hierbas con rapidez y precisión."

# game/a1s6.rpy:533
translate spanish a1s6_248037af:

    # m "\"What's your relationship with Cassius like?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo es tu relación con Cassius?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:535
translate spanish a1s6_51494e54:

    # "I see Alex's paws freeze for a moment, then quickly return to their work, the dirty pile of weeds next to him growing larger and larger on the marble floor."
    "Veo que las zarpas de Alex se quedan inmóviles por un momento y luego vuelven rápidamente al trabajo; el sucio montón de hierbas que tiene al lado crece cada vez más sobre el suelo de mármol."

# game/a1s6.rpy:537
translate spanish a1s6_fb01ca70:

    # al "\"Our relationship? You already know that, [mc]. I'm his pet! Just like you are Amicus's pet.\""
    al "\"¿Nuestra relación? Ya lo sabes, [mc]. ¡Soy su mascota! Igual que tú eres la mascota de Amicus.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:539
translate spanish a1s6_513a3f23:

    # "He smiles at me."
    "Me sonríe."

# game/a1s6.rpy:540
translate spanish a1s6_210cd0ce:

    # "At this point, I decide to stop letting the cat play his little game with me."
    "En ese momento decido dejar de permitir que el gato siga con su jueguecito conmigo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:541
translate spanish a1s6_82f3bc38:

    # "I give him a look that says \"oh, come on\" and I see his ears fall a bit."
    "Le lanzo una mirada que dice \"venga, por favor\" y veo que baja un poco las orejas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:543
translate spanish a1s6_07682022:

    # al "\"What?\""
    al "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:544
translate spanish a1s6_742fd088:

    # m "\"You know exactly what. I think it's pretty obvious the two of you are...I dunno, something more.\""
    m "\"Sabes perfectamente a qué me refiero. Creo que es bastante evidente que vosotros dos sois... no sé, algo más.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:545
translate spanish a1s6_d09b4171:

    # "This is the first time I've called the cat out on his polite-pet-facade, and I see that it's thrown him off a bit."
    "Es la primera vez que le echo en cara al gato su fachada de mascota educada y veo que lo he descolocado un poco."

# game/a1s6.rpy:546
translate spanish a1s6_4abd8564:

    # "His ears are down and he's staring hard at his paws, pushing through the weeds, though he's no longer plucking them."
    "Tiene las orejas bajas y mira fijamente sus zarpas, que apartan las hierbas aunque ya no las arrancan."

# game/a1s6.rpy:547
translate spanish a1s6_04da5387:

    # al "\"That's...such a forward question, [mc].\""
    al "\"Esa... es una pregunta muy directa, [mc].\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:548
translate spanish a1s6_7c030a2a:

    # "I wonder if his demeanor just has to do with his cat modesty, or if there are actual laws against pet-master relationships."
    "Me pregunto si su actitud se debe simplemente a su modestia felina o si existen leyes contra las relaciones entre mascotas y amos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:549
translate spanish a1s6_d2f94f43:

    # m "\"Come on, we're friends...besides, I want some advice.\""
    m "\"Venga, somos amigos... Además, quiero un consejo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:550
translate spanish a1s6_7718cb9c:

    # "Now his ears perk up a little bit."
    "Ahora levanta un poco las orejas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:552
translate spanish a1s6_79bc60eb:

    # al "\"Oh? With what?\""
    al "\"¿Ah, sí? ¿Sobre qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:553
translate spanish a1s6_fafbeb8d:

    # m "\"Well, first I wanna know if...you know, something's going on between you and Cassius, then I'll know if you can answer.\""
    m "\"Bueno, primero quiero saber si... ya sabes, si hay algo entre Cassius y tú. Así sabré si puedes responderme.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:554
translate spanish a1s6_a0d17728:

    # "Alex sighs huffily and sits back on his rear, looking a bit childish with his legs and feet splayed out in front of himself."
    "Alex suspira con fastidio y se sienta sobre el trasero, con un aspecto un poco infantil y las piernas y los pies abiertos delante de él."

# game/a1s6.rpy:556
translate spanish a1s6_dc99c3a9:

    # al "\"I don't know why it matters.\""
    al "\"No sé por qué importa.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:557
translate spanish a1s6_c77d898a:

    # m "\"Well, I don't know how things are on Omorfa, but where I'm from, friends talk about their relationships with each other. It's actually strange NOT to tell your friend about who you're in a relationship with.\""
    m "\"Bueno, no sé cómo serán las cosas en Omorfa, pero de donde yo vengo, los amigos hablan entre sí de sus relaciones. De hecho, es raro NO contarle a un amigo con quién tienes una relación.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:558
translate spanish a1s6_33eba1a4:

    # "Though his ears are folded down, I can see how red they are"
    "Aunque tiene las orejas plegadas, puedo ver lo rojas que están"

# game/a1s6.rpy:560
translate spanish a1s6_40108085:

    # al "\"We're...not in an official relationship. But there are...feelings between us, yes.\""
    al "\"No... tenemos una relación oficial. Pero hay... sentimientos entre nosotros, sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:561
translate spanish a1s6_0b4eb0fa_1:

    # m "\"Really?\""
    m "\"¿De verdad?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:562
translate spanish a1s6_8355aed4:

    # "Alex snaps his gaze to mine."
    "Alex dirige de golpe su mirada a la mía."

# game/a1s6.rpy:564
translate spanish a1s6_33aebe61:

    # al "\"Why do you sound so surprised?\""
    al "\"¿Por qué pareces tan sorprendido?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:565
translate spanish a1s6_a9c79b6f:

    # "I'm not surprised just...fascinated."
    "No estoy sorprendido, solo... fascinado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:566
translate spanish a1s6_99cc6bb2:

    # m "\"I'm not! You two are just really...different.\""
    m "\"¡No lo estoy! Es que sois tan... diferentes.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:568
translate spanish a1s6_4310fe89:

    # al "\"How so?\""
    al "\"¿Cómo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:569
translate spanish a1s6_840cb9f6:

    # m "\"I mean, do I have to explain it?\""
    m "\"Quiero decir, ¿tengo que explicarlo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:570
translate spanish a1s6_8ea94acb:

    # "Alex is quiet."
    "Alex guarda silencio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:571
translate spanish a1s6_f596d547:

    # m "\"Well, you're so reserved and quiet and he's so...\""
    m "\"Bueno, tú eres tan reservado y callado, y él es tan...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:572
translate spanish a1s6_1c3e1e53:

    # "Now that I know Alex actually likes Cassius, I don't wanna be too offensive."
    "Ahora que sé que a Alex realmente le gusta Cassius, no quiero ser demasiado ofensivo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:573
translate spanish a1s6_0ed720a8:

    # m "\"...Cassius.\""
    m "\"...Cassius.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:574
translate spanish a1s6_ab09fa2f:

    # "Alex sighs."
    "Alex suspira."

# game/a1s6.rpy:575
translate spanish a1s6_510ccf9e:

    # al "\"Yes, Cassius is very {i}Cassius{/i}, but there's a lot more to him than what he puts out in public.\""
    al "\"Sí, Cassius es muy {i}Cassius{/i}, pero es mucho más de lo que muestra en público.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:576
translate spanish a1s6_e5b57225:

    # m "\"So...you like him?\""
    m "\"Entonces... ¿te gusta?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:577
translate spanish a1s6_0f53f4b3:

    # al "\"Parts of him, yes.\""
    al "\"Algunas partes de él, sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:578
translate spanish a1s6_45a5c501:

    # "Alex has lowered his voice to the point where I almost can't hear him, so I do the same."
    "Alex ha bajado la voz hasta el punto de que casi no puedo oírlo, así que hago lo mismo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:579
translate spanish a1s6_c488276d:

    # m "\"So are you in like, a relationship? I don't know what they're called on Adastra.\""
    m "\"Entonces, ¿tenéis algo así como una relación? No sé cómo se llaman en Adastra.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:580
translate spanish a1s6_1cce24ff:

    # "Alex bristles."
    "Alex se eriza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:582
translate spanish a1s6_854a206d:

    # al "\"Well, It is simply called a relationship. The only official status is marriage, but that's only between males and females.\""
    al "\"Bueno, se llama simplemente relación. El único estado oficial es el matrimonio, pero eso solo existe entre machos y hembras.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:583
translate spanish a1s6_b3e52829:

    # m "\"What about between males?\""
    m "\"¿Y entre machos?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:585
translate spanish a1s6_289dc334:

    # al "\"There is none. Why are you so curious?\""
    al "\"No existe ninguno. ¿Por qué tienes tanta curiosidad?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:586
translate spanish a1s6_6b095d94:

    # "Alex looks at me carefully, eyes narrowed."
    "Alex me observa con atención, con los ojos entrecerrados."

# game/a1s6.rpy:587
translate spanish a1s6_8619f2c6:

    # "I shrug."
    "Me encojo de hombros."

# game/a1s6.rpy:588
translate spanish a1s6_226b3843:

    # m "\"Just wondering. I like to learn about the culture I'm in.\""
    m "\"Solo me lo preguntaba. Me gusta aprender sobre la cultura en la que estoy.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:590
translate spanish a1s6_6a040d90:

    # al "\"I see...are you interested in Amicus?\""
    al "\"Ya veo... ¿Te interesa Amicus?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:591
translate spanish a1s6_12e19aad:

    # "Now it's my turn to blush."
    "Ahora me toca a mí sonrojarme."

# game/a1s6.rpy:592
translate spanish a1s6_74ff3f5f:

    # m "\"I—no.\""
    m "\"Yo—no.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:594
translate spanish a1s6_8daacd9f:

    # al "\"[mc], you can tell me. I thought we were friends?\""
    al "\"[mc], puedes contármelo. ¿No éramos amigos?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:595
translate spanish a1s6_5fd7cf77:

    # "I get the feeling that Alex is a lot better than me at these \"games\"."
    "Tengo la impresión de que Alex es mucho mejor que yo en estos \"juegos\"."

# game/a1s6.rpy:596
translate spanish a1s6_f5e38064:

    # m "\"I...I don't know honestly, but I guess I was wondering how I'd go about it if I decided to...\""
    m "\"Yo... no lo sé, la verdad, pero supongo que me preguntaba cómo hacerlo si decidiera...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:598
translate spanish a1s6_c96df9c0:

    # al "\"Awww, that's adorable!\""
    al "\"¡Ayyy, qué adorable!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:599
translate spanish a1s6_34f5e986:

    # "All I can do in response is blush a deeper shade of red."
    "Solo puedo responder sonrojándome aún más."

# game/a1s6.rpy:601
translate spanish a1s6_14017022:

    # al "\"So you're asking how to tell a wolf that you're interested?\""
    al "\"Entonces, ¿preguntas cómo decirle a un lobo que te interesa?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:602
translate spanish a1s6_6bff4e6b:

    # m "\"...Yeah.\""
    m "\"...Sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:603
translate spanish a1s6_2c1f1c1f:

    # al "\"Well, between males, it usually happens naturally, without saying so. If you haven't noticed, there's a stigma against same-sex relationships on Adastra.\""
    al "\"Bueno, entre machos suele suceder de manera natural, sin decirlo. Por si no te has dado cuenta, en Adastra hay un estigma contra las relaciones entre personas del mismo sexo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:605
translate spanish a1s6_cbf024fd:

    # al "\"Leaving the status of a relationship unsaid makes it less likely that you'll be found out.\""
    al "\"Dejar sin decir qué tipo de relación tenéis reduce las posibilidades de que os descubran.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:606
translate spanish a1s6_a3506f66:

    # "I think for a moment."
    "Pienso un momento."

# game/a1s6.rpy:607
translate spanish a1s6_cad3097c:

    # "Amicus seemed to want me to make the relationship \"official\"."
    "Amicus parecía querer que yo hiciera \"oficial\" la relación."

# game/a1s6.rpy:608
translate spanish a1s6_5c605d27:

    # "I guess he's just going by my standards, then."
    "Supongo que entonces solo está siguiendo mis criterios."

# game/a1s6.rpy:609
translate spanish a1s6_82379599:

    # "He probably wants me to ask him to date me, Earth-style."
    "Probablemente quiere que le pida que salga conmigo, al estilo terrestre."

# game/a1s6.rpy:610
translate spanish a1s6_835dac22:

    # "Alex goes back to plucking some of the weeds."
    "Alex vuelve a arrancar algunas malas hierbas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:612
translate spanish a1s6_af883914:

    # al "\"However, I feel that things are changing, though very slowly. Honestly, someone like Amicus becoming emperor would be really something.\""
    al "\"Sin embargo, siento que las cosas están cambiando, aunque muy despacio. Sinceramente, que alguien como Amicus se convirtiera en emperador sería algo extraordinario.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:613
translate spanish a1s6_28505312:

    # "I'm about to ask Alex how prominent the rumors are about Amicus when I suddenly hear footsteps."
    "Estoy a punto de preguntarle a Alex cuánto se han extendido los rumores sobre Amicus cuando oigo de pronto unos pasos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:614
translate spanish a1s6_2e4800b6:

    # "I look up, half-expecting to see the wolf, but instead..."
    "Levanto la mirada, casi esperando ver al lobo, pero en su lugar..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:617
translate spanish a1s6_7d71a2ab:

    # "Cato simply stares at us, his paws behind his back as usual."
    "Cato se limita a mirarnos, con las zarpas detrás de la espalda, como de costumbre."

# game/a1s6.rpy:618
translate spanish a1s6_e6182cec:

    # "A moment of silence goes by before Alex suddenly stumbles to his feet, paws clasped in front of himself before bowing low."
    "Pasa un momento de silencio antes de que Alex se ponga de pie de repente y con torpeza, junte las zarpas delante de sí y haga una profunda reverencia."

# game/a1s6.rpy:620
translate spanish a1s6_99148e6b:

    # "I quickly follow suit, a few seconds behind the cat."
    "Lo imito rápidamente, unos segundos después que el gato."

# game/a1s6.rpy:621
translate spanish a1s6_705b99aa:

    # "As I bow, I notice how dirty my robe is at the knees."
    "Al inclinarme, noto lo sucia que tengo la túnica en las rodillas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:622
translate spanish a1s6_1bdff6e0:

    # "Alex remains bowed so I do the same, listening as Cato's footsteps come closer."
    "Alex permanece inclinado, así que hago lo mismo, escuchando cómo se acercan los pasos de Cato."

# game/a1s6.rpy:623
translate spanish a1s6_58654c26:

    # "He stops a few feet away, and I can see his worn, blunt claws at the top of my vision."
    "Se detiene a unos pocos pies de distancia y puedo ver sus garras gastadas y romas en la parte superior de mi campo de visión."

# game/a1s6.rpy:624
translate spanish a1s6_33a6f95a:

    # "He stands there for a very long time, not saying anything, forcing me and Alex to remain stooped."
    "Se queda ahí durante mucho tiempo sin decir nada, obligándonos a Alex y a mí a seguir inclinados."

# game/a1s6.rpy:625
translate spanish a1s6_f8bc8e40:

    # "As my back starts to ache, I realize that he must be doing this on purpose."
    "Cuando empieza a dolerme la espalda, me doy cuenta de que debe de estar haciéndolo a propósito."

# game/a1s6.rpy:626
translate spanish a1s6_44da688f:

    # "Are we in trouble for something?"
    "¿Nos hemos metido en problemas por algo?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:627
translate spanish a1s6_ab5ddbc4:

    # "Finally he speaks, and I almost jump."
    "Por fin habla y casi doy un salto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:628
translate spanish a1s6_f8e53764:

    # ca "\"Alexios, [mc], how are you this afternoon?\""
    ca "\"Alexios, [mc], ¿cómo estáis esta tarde?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:629
translate spanish a1s6_5763a621:

    # "Alex straightens up and I do the same, stifling my groan of relief."
    "Alex se endereza y hago lo mismo, ahogando mi gemido de alivio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:630
translate spanish a1s6_a4855f33:

    # "If Alex is sore, he's not showing it at all as he fixes a smile on his face."
    "Si a Alex le duele algo, no lo demuestra en absoluto mientras se dibuja una sonrisa en la cara."

# game/a1s6.rpy:632
translate spanish a1s6_6ab04d85:

    # al "\"Wonderful, Your Imperial Majesty. I hope the same is for you?\""
    al "\"Maravillosamente, Su Majestad Imperial. Espero que a usted también le vaya bien, ¿no es así?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:633
translate spanish a1s6_400f735b:

    # "I open my mouth, trying to think of something to say, though Alex didn't leave me much room to do so."
    "Abro la boca, intentando pensar en algo que decir, aunque Alex no me ha dejado mucho espacio para hacerlo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:634
translate spanish a1s6_26fe5207:

    # "That doesn't seem to matter though, as Cato starts speaking, reminding me that I'm still supposed to be a near-mute primitive."
    "Pero eso no parece importar, porque Cato empieza a hablar, recordándome que todavía se supone que soy un primitivo casi mudo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:636
translate spanish a1s6_1f30b2fd:

    # ca "\"Sadly no, Alexios. I was just in the city today, and I was hearing some unfortunate rumors amongst the officials.\""
    ca "\"Por desgracia, no, Alexios. Hoy he estado en la ciudad y he oído unos rumores desafortunados entre los funcionarios.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:637
translate spanish a1s6_fa5b4290:

    # "Another long pause."
    "Otra larga pausa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:639
translate spanish a1s6_f2c8d145:

    # al "\"O-oh?\""
    al "\"¿A-ah, sí?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:641
translate spanish a1s6_bc21ceff:

    # "The corner of Cato's mouth twitches and while I usually have a hard time knowing what the old wolf is thinking, I can tell that right now he's not happy."
    "La comisura de la boca de Cato se mueve y, aunque normalmente me cuesta saber qué piensa el viejo lobo, ahora puedo ver que no está contento."

# game/a1s6.rpy:642
translate spanish a1s6_4271e1a2:

    # ca "\"Indeed. Rumors about Cassius and his intentions involving the Triumvirates if he becomes emperor.\""
    ca "\"En efecto. Rumores sobre Cassius y sus intenciones respecto a los triunviros si se convierte en emperador.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:643
translate spanish a1s6_0106de1d:

    # "It takes me a moment to know what they're talking about, then I remember..."
    "Tardo un momento en entender de qué están hablando y luego recuerdo..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:645
translate spanish a1s6_595a95b6:

    # al "\"The Triumvirates? I wonder why?\""
    al "\"¿Los triunviros? Me pregunto por qué.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:646
translate spanish a1s6_1f4ef8b1:

    # "Alex puts on a very innocent, confused look, even though I know that he knows what this is about."
    "Alex adopta una expresión muy inocente y confusa, aunque sé que entiende de qué se trata."

# game/a1s6.rpy:647
translate spanish a1s6_20723980:

    # ca "\"I wonder as well, which is why I'm curious to know if either of you have heard the rumor, or possibly the source of the rumor?\""
    ca "\"Yo también me lo pregunto; por eso tengo curiosidad por saber si alguno ha oído el rumor o quizá conoce su origen.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:648
translate spanish a1s6_889522ec:

    # "Immediately, I feel sweat starting to break out on my forehead, and I'm glad that I'm already sweating from the heat."
    "De inmediato siento que empieza a brotarme sudor en la frente y me alegra estar sudando ya por el calor."

# game/a1s6.rpy:650
translate spanish a1s6_7ffe344a:

    # al "\"I am sorry to say that I do not know, Your Imperial Majesty.\""
    al "\"Lamento decir que no lo sé, vuestra majestad imperial.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:651
translate spanish a1s6_70dd9eb5:

    # "Another moment of silence goes by, and that's when I notice that Cato's waiting for me to answer."
    "Pasa otro momento de silencio y entonces noto que Cato espera mi respuesta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:652
translate spanish a1s6_5f753372:

    # "I choke on my words for a moment, adjusting my brain to \"dumb ape\" mode."
    "Las palabras se me atascan un momento mientras ajusto el cerebro al modo de \"simio tonto\"."

# game/a1s6.rpy:653
translate spanish a1s6_dd312eeb:

    # m "\"Uhhhh...what is trimvirites?\""
    m "\"Ehhh... ¿qué es trinviros?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:654
translate spanish a1s6_18c391de:

    # "Cato's mouth twitches again."
    "La boca de Cato vuelve a contraerse."

# game/a1s6.rpy:655
translate spanish a1s6_04fd830c:

    # ca "\"Anyway, I'm on my way to Cassius's room to let him know the news. Please accompany me, Alexios.\""
    ca "\"En fin, voy a la habitación de Cassius para darle la noticia. Acompáñame, Alexios, por favor.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:657
translate spanish a1s6_4462d8b9:

    # al "\"Yes, Emperor.\""
    al "\"Sí, emperador.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:658
translate spanish a1s6_6abe3801:

    # "Alex quickly hops to attention as Cato turns with a twirl of his robes, heading back up the path as Alex quickly follows."
    "Alex se pone rápidamente en posición de atención; Cato se vuelve con un giro de la túnica y sube de nuevo por el sendero, seguido de cerca por Alex."

# game/a1s6.rpy:662
translate spanish a1s6_b855350b:

    # "I'm left to stand there alone for a moment, watching the two of them disappear amongst the bushes."
    "Me quedo solo un momento y observo cómo los dos desaparecen entre los arbustos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:663
translate spanish a1s6_1fa5371b:

    # "So...someone had told some of the officials about Cassius's plans to eliminate the triumvirates."
    "Así que...alguien había contado a algunos funcionarios los planes de Cassius para eliminar los triunviratos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:664
translate spanish a1s6_1eecac80:

    # "Despite Alex's innocent act, I assume it had to be him."
    "Pese a la inocencia que finge Alex, supongo que tuvo que ser él."

# game/a1s6.rpy:665
translate spanish a1s6_1ee1e16c:

    # "Either that, or it was Virginia."
    "O eso, o fue Virginia."

# game/a1s6.rpy:666
translate spanish a1s6_48ffb1c5:

    # "I wonder if Cato is already suspicions about Alex and, if that's the case, if it could all come back to me."
    "Me pregunto si Cato ya sospecha de Alex y, en ese caso, si todo podría acabar señalándome a mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:667
translate spanish a1s6_05fb68ce:

    # "I hope not."
    "Espero que no."

# game/a1s6.rpy:668
translate spanish a1s6_dc02440c:

    # "The idea of playing politics amongst these passive-aggressive wolves is not at all appealing."
    "La idea de jugar a la política entre estos lobos pasivo-agresivos no me atrae en absoluto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:670
translate spanish a1s6_54d4eefe:

    # "I spend a few more hours weeding the gardens on my own, knowing that I won't be able to make much progress alone."
    "Paso unas horas más quitando malas hierbas en los jardines por mi cuenta, sabiendo que no podré avanzar mucho solo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:671
translate spanish a1s6_1bf38d7f:

    # "After a while, I meander around the gardens a bit, wanting to go back inside, but not really wanting to bother Amicus while he studies."
    "Al cabo de un rato, deambulo un poco por los jardines; quiero volver dentro, pero no me apetece molestar a Amicus mientras estudia."

# game/a1s6.rpy:672
translate spanish a1s6_f23d4fe0:

    # "While I'm doing that though, I think more and more about what Alex and I had been talking about."
    "Mientras lo hago, pienso cada vez más en lo que Alex y yo hemos hablado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:673
translate spanish a1s6_04a61c81:

    # "Should I just confess my feelings to Amicus, and close the awkward gap between us?"
    "¿Debería confesarle mis sentimientos a Amicus y cerrar la incómoda distancia entre nosotros?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:674
translate spanish a1s6_05993ee6:

    # "I know it's weighing on his mind."
    "Sé que le preocupa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:675
translate spanish a1s6_dcf31dac:

    # "Maybe asking him out will give him that boost that he needs to win?"
    "¿Quizá proponerle que salgamos le dé el impulso que necesita para ganar?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:676
translate spanish a1s6_166428b2:

    # "Maybe I'm just trying to convince myself, but I realize that it is something that I want to do."
    "Quizá solo intente convencerme, pero comprendo que es algo que quiero hacer."

# game/a1s6.rpy:677
translate spanish a1s6_35ae1ce9:

    # "And if I'm going to do it, it's probably best to do it before the trial, to set his mind at ease."
    "Y, si voy a hacerlo, probablemente sea mejor antes de la prueba, para tranquilizarlo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:678
translate spanish a1s6_91b227ef:

    # "Carefully, I pick a few flowers from the gardens, not making the giant bouquet that Amicus had made for his own proposal, but enough to look nice, at least in my opinion."
    "Recojo cuidadosamente unas flores del jardín; no hago el enorme ramo que hizo Amicus para su propuesta, pero sí uno lo bastante bonito, al menos en mi opinión."

# game/a1s6.rpy:680
translate spanish a1s6_1f8853fb:

    # "As I walk to the the wolf's room, I have enough time to second-guess myself."
    "Mientras camino a la habitación del lobo, tengo tiempo suficiente para empezar a dudar de mí mismo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:681
translate spanish a1s6_6e21b2e7:

    # "Maybe this isn't such a good idea..."
    "Quizá no sea tan buena idea..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:682
translate spanish a1s6_d8f9e2b1:

    # "My heart is hammering in my chest as I approach the wolf's door, and I'm sure my face is bright red."
    "El corazón me martillea en el pecho al acercarme a la puerta del lobo y estoy seguro de tener la cara roja."

# game/a1s6.rpy:684
translate spanish a1s6_85dc99b7:

    # "I try to keep my breathing under control as I stand in front of the door."
    "Intento controlar la respiración mientras estoy ante la puerta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:685
translate spanish a1s6_f162fa90:

    # "What should I say?"
    "¿Qué debería decir?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:686
translate spanish a1s6_c9cc48c6:

    # "Maybe just imitate what the wolf did back when he asked me out?"
    "¿Quizá imitar lo que hizo el lobo cuando me propuso salir?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:687
translate spanish a1s6_579a87f5:

    # "Yeah, that'll be funny and cute, right?"
    "Sí, será gracioso y tierno, ¿verdad?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:688
translate spanish a1s6_29c732e7:

    # "As I start to feel myself getting cold feet, I just reach up to the panel, pressing it, deciding to just throw myself into this."
    "Cuando empiezo a acobardarme, simplemente alzo la mano hacia el panel y lo aprieto, decidiendo lanzarme de una vez."

# game/a1s6.rpy:692
translate spanish a1s6_f7a38885:

    # "The scene that I come upon is probably the last one I would have ever expected."
    "La escena que encuentro es probablemente la última que habría esperado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:693
translate spanish a1s6_997a1e4a:

    # "At first, I think the two of them are fighting."
    "Al principio creo que los dos están peleando."

# game/a1s6.rpy:694
translate spanish a1s6_786da5f1:

    # "Neferu and Amicus obviously have some kind of tension going on between them, so seeing the jackal splayed out on the bed while Amicus growled and snarled above him, pinning him down..."
    "Está claro que hay alguna tensión entre Neferu y Amicus, así que ver al chacal despatarrado en la cama mientras Amicus gruñe sobre él, inmovilizándolo..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:695
translate spanish a1s6_818bb412:

    # "...well, a fight is all that would come to my mind."
    "... bueno, solo me hace pensar en una pelea."

# game/a1s6.rpy:696
translate spanish a1s6_b73d0e78:

    # "But, after a few more seconds of staring open-mouthed at the scene in front of me, I slowly realize what's actually happening."
    "Pero, tras unos segundos más mirando con la boca abierta la escena ante mí, empiezo a comprender lo que realmente ocurre."

# game/a1s6.rpy:697
translate spanish a1s6_b34360ca:

    # "While Amicus might be snarling, Neferu is letting out grunts and groans that are clearly full of pleasure"
    "Puede que Amicus esté gruñendo, pero Neferu emite gruñidos y gemidos claramente llenos de placer."

# game/a1s6.rpy:698
translate spanish a1s6_bb7c9fe7:

    # "His face and body say it all too, the jackal writhing and twisting under the wolf, pawing at him as he says words that don't translate through the Lingua."
    "Su cara y su cuerpo también lo dicen todo: el chacal se retuerce bajo el lobo, lo toca con las patas y dice palabras que la Lingua no traduce."

# game/a1s6.rpy:699
translate spanish a1s6_3e96d2f7:

    # "If that isn't enough to tell me exactly what's going on, then the jackal's slick, pink cock bouncing against his tightened abs is."
    "Si eso no basta para decirme exactamente qué pasa, sí basta el pene rosa y húmedo del chacal rebotando contra sus abdominales tensos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:700
translate spanish a1s6_fe88a4a3:

    # "I guess the sounds they're making covered up the sound of the door opening, because neither of them look up."
    "Supongo que sus sonidos taparon el de la puerta al abrirse, porque ninguno levanta la mirada."

# game/a1s6.rpy:701
translate spanish a1s6_11b3c0ac:

    # "Instead, they both continue to go at it while I stare in shock."
    "En cambio, siguen entregados a ello mientras los miro atónito."

# game/a1s6.rpy:702
translate spanish a1s6_77c20b8f:

    # "A part of me doesn't want to make any sudden movements so as not to attract their attention while the other part of me just stares in fascination, never having seen anything like this before."
    "Una parte de mí no quiere hacer movimientos repentinos para no llamar su atención; la otra se limita a mirar fascinada, porque nunca ha visto algo así."

# game/a1s6.rpy:703
translate spanish a1s6_20dabe5f:

    # "A few times, Neferu tries to reach up and touch Amicus's face and each time the wolf bats it away, or pins the paw down."
    "Varias veces, Neferu intenta levantar la pata para tocar la cara de Amicus; cada vez, el lobo se la aparta de un golpe o la inmoviliza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:704
translate spanish a1s6_cb2d181d:

    # "Amicus seems irritated almost, like he's more annoyed about the situation than anything else."
    "Amicus casi parece irritado, como si la situación sobre todo le molestara."

# game/a1s6.rpy:705
translate spanish a1s6_d3b470d8:

    # "Neferu is practically the opposite, somehow maintaining that trademark smirk of his while this is all going down."
    "Neferu es prácticamente lo contrario; de alguna manera mantiene su característica sonrisa burlona mientras ocurre todo esto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:708
translate spanish a1s6_72a280f6:

    # "And then, of all the moments for me to walk in on their little session, they seem to reach their peak."
    "Y entonces, de todos los momentos en los que podía irrumpir en su pequeña sesión, parecen alcanzar el clímax justo ahora."

# game/a1s6.rpy:709
translate spanish a1s6_22cb7a32:

    # "Neferu lets out a series of short moans, a strange sound coming from someone as refined and reserved as he is."
    "Neferu deja escapar una serie de gemidos cortos, un sonido extraño en alguien tan refinado y reservado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:710
translate spanish a1s6_e47d1392:

    # "I can see the results as it splatters against his torso and muzzle, his hips jerking frantically as his face morphs into a look of strained pleasure."
    "Veo el resultado salpicarle el torso y el hocico; sus caderas se sacuden frenéticamente mientras su cara adopta una expresión de placer tenso."

# game/a1s6.rpy:711
translate spanish a1s6_3bce09c6:

    # "Meanwhile, Amicus's moan is long and deep as he thrusts harder into the jackal, freezing up before practically melting over the other canine."
    "Mientras tanto, el gemido de Amicus es largo y profundo; embiste al chacal con más fuerza, se queda inmóvil y después prácticamente se derrite sobre el otro cánido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:712
translate spanish a1s6_4fc04d43:

    # "His expression is a lot more goofy, and despite myself, I find myself thinking that this is exactly how I'd imagine his orgasm face."
    "Su expresión es mucho más bobalicona y, a mi pesar, pienso que así es exactamente como imaginaría su cara durante un orgasmo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:713
translate spanish a1s6_8eb02432:

    # "I just sort of take this all in, still trying to understand what the hell is going on."
    "Simplemente asimilo todo esto, todavía intentando comprender qué demonios ocurre."

# game/a1s6.rpy:714
translate spanish a1s6_915991ff:

    # "I mean, I know what's going on, but I don't know why."
    "Es decir, sé qué ocurre, pero no sé por qué."

# game/a1s6.rpy:715
translate spanish a1s6_6f4563b8:

    # "There's a certain amount of horror that goes with my reaction, as if I'd just walked in on my parents doing it."
    "Mi reacción tiene cierto horror, como si acabara de encontrar a mis padres haciéndolo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:716
translate spanish a1s6_d1634775:

    # "I guess I'm at least glad that I'm seeing it at this angle, which means I can't see what's going going on under Neferu's hips."
    "Supongo que al menos me alegra verlo desde este ángulo, que me impide ver lo que ocurre bajo las caderas de Neferu."

# game/a1s6.rpy:717
translate spanish a1s6_4f7481a2:

    # "I realize then that I need to get the hell out before they see me."
    "Entonces comprendo que tengo que salir de aquí antes de que me vean."

# game/a1s6.rpy:718
translate spanish a1s6_8d7b6f14:

    # "As they both gasp in their sticky mess, I slowly start to back out, but that's when the door automatically closes behind me."
    "Mientras los dos jadean entre su pegajoso desastre, empiezo a retroceder despacio, pero entonces la puerta se cierra automáticamente detrás de mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:720
translate spanish a1s6_3a694796:

    # "Now that things are quiet, nothing covers up that sound, and Neferu and Amicus look up at me as one."
    "Ahora que todo está tranquilo, nada tapa ese sonido y Neferu y Amicus levantan la mirada hacia mí a la vez."

# game/a1s6.rpy:722
translate spanish a1s6_7da0e4e5:

    # "I stand there, feeling as if I'm in a dream as they both stare at me."
    "Me quedo allí, sintiéndome como en un sueño mientras los dos me miran."

# game/a1s6.rpy:723
translate spanish a1s6_9741745f:

    # "I must look like an idiot; my robe dirty from the gardens, flowers dangling from my right hand, my mouth hanging open in fascinated horror."
    "Debo de parecer un idiota: la túnica sucia del jardín, las flores colgando de mi mano derecha y la boca abierta entre fascinación y horror."

# game/a1s6.rpy:724
translate spanish a1s6_8d7f409e:

    # "Amicus looks most shocked of all though, and I can see a million thoughts running through his head, clearly not having wanted me to see this."
    "Pero Amicus parece el más sorprendido; veo millones de pensamientos cruzarle la cabeza, claramente sin haber querido que yo viera esto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:725
translate spanish a1s6_2f54482c:

    # "His reasons for sending me and Alex out to do menial yard work is very clear now."
    "Ahora está muy claro por qué nos envió a Alex y a mí a hacer trabajo rutinario en los jardines."

# game/a1s6.rpy:726
translate spanish a1s6_565d74c2:

    # "Neferu, for his part, isn't wearing his usual, suave smirk."
    "Neferu, por su parte, no luce su habitual sonrisa elegante."

# game/a1s6.rpy:727
translate spanish a1s6_51a68e6d:

    # "Instead, it's surprised and maybe even a little guilty, like not even he wanted me to see this."
    "En cambio, está sorprendido y quizá hasta un poco culpable, como si ni siquiera él hubiera querido que yo lo viera."

# game/a1s6.rpy:728
translate spanish a1s6_7effd1ff:

    # "I open my mouth."
    "Abro la boca."

# game/a1s6.rpy:729
translate spanish a1s6_9046708a:

    # m "\"I—\""
    m "\"Yo...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:730
translate spanish a1s6_478abab4:

    # "But then any will to smooth over the situation somehow, make a joke of it even, leaves me."
    "Pero entonces pierdo cualquier voluntad de suavizar la situación de algún modo, incluso de bromear sobre ella."

# game/a1s6.rpy:731
translate spanish a1s6_e23fad40:

    # "With both their eyes on me, I turn and almost run into the door, having to drop the flowers on the ground to press the panel."
    "Con los ojos de ambos sobre mí, me vuelvo y casi choco contra la puerta; tengo que dejar caer las flores para apretar el panel."

# game/a1s6.rpy:732
translate spanish a1s6_7102c223:

    # "Somehow, I feel even worse than I had when I'd left the throne room in disgrace after the dance."
    "De alguna manera me siento aún peor que cuando salí humillado del salón del trono tras el baile."

# game/a1s6.rpy:734
translate spanish a1s6_732dc1ae:

    # "The door slides open and the next thing I know, I'm jogging out into the hall."
    "La puerta se abre deslizándose y lo siguiente que hago es correr por el pasillo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:735
translate spanish a1s6_ccb476b9:

    # "As I do, I hear Amicus struggling for words."
    "Al hacerlo, oigo a Amicus esforzarse por encontrar palabras."

# game/a1s6.rpy:736
translate spanish a1s6_dc58f367:

    # a "\"[mc], w-wait!\""
    a "\"[mc], ¡e-espera!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:737
translate spanish a1s6_7e20f4f3:

    # "There's some rustling sounds, followed by a yelp from Neferu before the door slides shut and the only sounds are my echoing footsteps."
    "Se oyen unos crujidos de tela, seguidos de un quejido de Neferu; después se cierra la puerta y solo quedan mis pasos resonantes."

# game/a1s6.rpy:740
translate spanish a1s6_4a1ec749:

    # "I'm not sure where I'm going, I just know that I need to get as far as I can from that...{i}situation{/i}."
    "No sé muy bien adónde voy; solo sé que necesito alejarme todo lo posible de aquella...{i}situación{/i}."

# game/a1s6.rpy:741
translate spanish a1s6_be07158e:

    # "What I just saw is only now sinking in, and so is the hurt."
    "Solo ahora empiezo a asimilar lo que vi y también el dolor."

# game/a1s6.rpy:742
translate spanish a1s6_8ae1a176:

    # "What the fuck?"
    "¿Qué coño?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:743
translate spanish a1s6_cec2b5a8:

    # "That fucking wolf tells me he's in love with me...or at least interested in me, and the next thing I know he's fucking that jackal?"
    "¿Ese puto lobo me dice que está enamorado de mí... o al menos interesado en mí, y lo siguiente que sé es que se está follando a ese chacal?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:744
translate spanish a1s6_caf62aaf:

    # "What the FUCK!?"
    "¿¡QUÉ COÑO!?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:745
translate spanish a1s6_6daaba99:

    # "I guess I'm more angry than hurt."
    "Supongo que estoy más enfadado que dolido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:746
translate spanish a1s6_89abbe39:

    # "I must have looked like such an idiot standing there while one of them was getting railed."
    "Debo de haber parecido un idiota ahí de pie mientras se follaban a uno de ellos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:747
translate spanish a1s6_e27c8b0e:

    # "And to walk in on THAT moment."
    "Y entrar justo en ESE momento."

# game/a1s6.rpy:748
translate spanish a1s6_ef20c3ef:

    # "Neferu had been so clearly into it, and Amicus looked so mean and aggressive."
    "Neferu estaba claramente entregado y Amicus parecía tan duro y agresivo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:749
translate spanish a1s6_38b77c94:

    # "The whole thing was just awful."
    "Todo fue horrible."

# game/a1s6.rpy:750
translate spanish a1s6_1dc8190a:

    # "Well...awful to walk in on unexpectedly."
    "Bueno... horrible de encontrar sin esperarlo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:751
translate spanish a1s6_16f03285:

    # "In another context..."
    "En otro contexto..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:752
translate spanish a1s6_c238bbc5:

    # "My vision blurs for a moment, but I refuse to let myself cry over something that wasn't even going to be serious."
    "Se me nubla la vista un momento, pero me niego a llorar por algo que ni siquiera iba a ser serio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:753
translate spanish a1s6_bb24307a:

    # "I was going to offer Amicus that stupid \"fling\", and that was it."
    "Iba a ofrecerle a Amicus aquella estúpida \"aventura\", y eso era todo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:754
translate spanish a1s6_4b9e468a:

    # "He wasn't obligated to have eyes only for me."
    "No estaba obligado a tener ojos solo para mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:755
translate spanish a1s6_59b1cab1:

    # "In fact, I KNEW he was into Neferu, we'd already discussed it."
    "De hecho, SABÍA que le atraía Neferu; ya lo habíamos hablado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:756
translate spanish a1s6_a2f41661:

    # "So this is fine, this was expected."
    "Así que está bien; era de esperar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:757
translate spanish a1s6_daddeae8:

    # "Actually, I wasn't even expecting anything."
    "En realidad, ni siquiera esperaba nada."

# game/a1s6.rpy:758
translate spanish a1s6_10705cca:

    # "No, the reason I'm so embarrassed and feel like shit right now is because I walked in on two alien dogs butt-fucking."
    "No, estoy tan avergonzado y me siento como una mierda porque entré y vi a dos perros alienígenas follándose por el culo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:759
translate spanish a1s6_4bc7e7e4:

    # "That was weird and messed up, and I just need to collect my thoughts for a moment..."
    "Fue extraño y perturbador; solo necesito ordenar mis pensamientos un momento..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:760
translate spanish a1s6_438a3d47:

    # "That's when I realize that I don't really know where I am in the palace."
    "Entonces me doy cuenta de que no sé exactamente dónde estoy dentro del palacio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:761
translate spanish a1s6_4355bcaf:

    # "Most of the hallways look the same, and this one is no exception, though I know I'm deeper in than I've been before."
    "La mayoría de los pasillos se parecen y este no es una excepción, aunque sé que estoy más adentro que antes."

# game/a1s6.rpy:762
translate spanish a1s6_27b7f10b:

    # a "\"[mc]!\""
    a "\"¡[mc]!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:763
translate spanish a1s6_12b16b0f:

    # "Amicus's footsteps pound against the floor behind me."
    "Los pasos de Amicus golpean el suelo detrás de mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:765
translate spanish a1s6_5c4699cf:

    # "I don't know how far away he is considering the echoing halls can be deceptive, but I immediately take a right through a particularly large set of double doors."
    "No sé a qué distancia está, ya que el eco de los pasillos puede engañar, pero enseguida giro a la derecha y cruzo unas puertas dobles especialmente grandes."

# game/a1s6.rpy:770
translate spanish a1s6_dd8191b9:

    # "The room I walk into is full of smells, good ones, like a garden."
    "La habitación en la que entro está llena de olores agradables, como un jardín."

# game/a1s6.rpy:771
translate spanish a1s6_d7a65232:

    # "The air is cool and fresh even as afternoon light pours in from an opening in the ceiling."
    "El aire es fresco y limpio, aunque la luz de la tarde entra por una abertura en el techo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:772
translate spanish a1s6_ebe1bf36:

    # "All the while, there's the sound of a soft trickling of water from a small fountain in the center of the room."
    "Mientras tanto, se oye el suave murmullo del agua de una pequeña fuente en el centro de la sala."

# game/a1s6.rpy:773
translate spanish a1s6_f75b274f:

    # "I stand there for a moment, eyes scanning for anyone else that might be here."
    "Me quedo allí un momento y busco con la mirada a alguien que pueda estar aquí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:774
translate spanish a1s6_be66ccfb:

    # "When I don't see anyone, I move closer to the center of the room, looking around at the flowers and plants as I try to calm my hammering heart."
    "Cuando no veo a nadie, me acerco al centro de la sala y miro las flores y plantas mientras intento calmar mi corazón acelerado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:775
translate spanish a1s6_1cbaf26b:

    # "I know Amicus is probably going to find me soon, all he has to do is ask Com."
    "Sé que Amicus probablemente me encuentre pronto; solo tiene que preguntarle a Com."

# game/a1s6.rpy:776
translate spanish a1s6_258b7ab6:

    # "So I fold my arms, trying to look casual, realizing now that it would have just been better for me to hang out in the hall, maybe laugh when Amicus came out."
    "Así que cruzo los brazos e intento parecer tranquilo; ahora comprendo que habría sido mejor quedarme en el pasillo y quizá reír cuando Amicus saliera."

# game/a1s6.rpy:777
translate spanish a1s6_277964ae:

    # "I'd have made a joke and acted like it wasn't a big deal...but it's way too late for that now."
    "Habría hecho una broma y fingido que no era para tanto... pero ahora es demasiado tarde."

# game/a1s6.rpy:778
translate spanish a1s6_7661bbb2:

    # "Sure enough, the door slides open and Amicus stumbles in in his underwear, his fur completely mussed up, chest heaving for breath."
    "Como esperaba, la puerta se abre y Amicus entra tambaleándose en ropa interior, con el pelo completamente revuelto y el pecho agitado por la falta de aire."

# game/a1s6.rpy:780
translate spanish a1s6_4b8785d6:

    # a "\"[mc], I—I need to talk...about...\""
    a "\"[mc], yo... necesito hablar... de...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:782
translate spanish a1s6_933f9502:

    # "He doubles over, paws on his knees as he gasps in his air."
    "Se dobla con las patas en las rodillas mientras intenta recuperar el aire."

# game/a1s6.rpy:783
translate spanish a1s6_e86412c6:

    # "I cringe as I see my flowers clutched in one of his paws."
    "Hago una mueca al ver mis flores apretadas en una de sus patas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:784
translate spanish a1s6_ed4cae1c:

    # "But I still try to look casual, keeping my arms folded."
    "Pero sigo intentando parecer tranquilo, con los brazos cruzados."

# game/a1s6.rpy:785
translate spanish a1s6_df8ec4bc:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:786
translate spanish a1s6_c5335163:

    # a "\"About...what you just saw.\""
    a "\"De... lo que acabas de ver.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:787
translate spanish a1s6_45c1f55f:

    # m "\"Don't worry about it.\""
    m "\"No te preocupes por eso.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:788
translate spanish a1s6_a13cf2aa:

    # "I shrug before busying myself with brushing off my robes so they don't look so dirty."
    "Me encojo de hombros y después me ocupo de sacudir la túnica para que no parezca tan sucia."

# game/a1s6.rpy:789
translate spanish a1s6_86a714a8:

    # a "\"No, I want to explain what...what happened.\""
    a "\"No, quiero explicar qué... qué pasó.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:790
translate spanish a1s6_883a3745:

    # m "\"You don't need to explain it. It's none of my business.\""
    m "\"No tienes que explicarlo. No es asunto mío.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:791
translate spanish a1s6_75bf4905:

    # a "\"Well, it is.\""
    a "\"Bueno, sí lo es.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:792
translate spanish a1s6_b517b6c3:

    # m "\"It's definitely not!\""
    m "\"¡Desde luego que no!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:794
translate spanish a1s6_32513967:

    # "I snap at the wolf."
    "Le respondo bruscamente al lobo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:795
translate spanish a1s6_6f094e1b:

    # m "\"Who you fuck is none of my business! That's all up to you. Don't let me tell you who you can and can't be with.\""
    m "\"¡Con quién follas no es asunto mío! Eso depende de ti. No dejes que yo te diga con quién puedes estar y con quién no.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:797
translate spanish a1s6_9025a899:

    # "Amicus frowns deeply at me."
    "Amicus me mira con el ceño muy fruncido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:798
translate spanish a1s6_3c8805f7:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:799
translate spanish a1s6_d9282d11:

    # m "\"You heard me. I don't wanna hear about it. I'm not here for this shit anyway.\""
    m "\"Me has oído. No quiero escucharlo. Ni siquiera estoy aquí para esta mierda.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:800
translate spanish a1s6_fafeac4b:

    # a "\"Here for what?\""
    a "\"¿Aquí para qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:801
translate spanish a1s6_0f70f97c:

    # m "\"For—\""
    m "\"Para—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:802
translate spanish a1s6_ff5fcb8a:

    # "I throw my hands up in frustration."
    "Levanto las manos, frustrado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:803
translate spanish a1s6_9cc7ce57:

    # m "\"What just happened. For sex, or love, or whatever the hell it is you guys do. Whatever it is you told me you wanted on the island.\""
    m "\"Para lo que acaba de pasar. Para sexo, amor o lo que demonios hagáis. Para lo que me dijiste que querías en la isla.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:804
translate spanish a1s6_965fa014:

    # "I point at the flowers in his paw."
    "Señalo las flores de su pata."

# game/a1s6.rpy:805
translate spanish a1s6_0e00e31f:

    # m "\"I'm just trying to get home.\""
    m "\"Solo intento volver a casa.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:806
translate spanish a1s6_aa1d743f:

    # "I feel my eyes threatening to water up again, and I stubbornly swallow that down right quick."
    "Siento que los ojos amenazan con humedecerse otra vez y reprimo tercamente la emoción de inmediato."

# game/a1s6.rpy:808
translate spanish a1s6_08cc00b8:

    # a "\"No! That's not what that was! {i}Please{/i}, let me explain.\""
    a "\"¡No! ¡Eso no era lo que estaba pasando! {i}Por favor{/i}, déjame explicarlo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:809
translate spanish a1s6_6a20a80d:

    # "I shake my head."
    "Niego con la cabeza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:810
translate spanish a1s6_80c1d63a:

    # m "\"You guys have sex, it's not a big deal, I get it. Humans can be like that too.\""
    m "\"Tenéis sexo, no es para tanto, lo entiendo. Los humanos también pueden ser así.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:811
translate spanish a1s6_335fed4d:

    # "Amicus takes a step forward, but I take one back."
    "Amicus da un paso adelante, pero yo doy uno atrás."

# game/a1s6.rpy:812
translate spanish a1s6_737b093d:

    # m "\"I guess it's just a little fucked up that you confessed your feelings two days ago, and then suddenly you're just fucking another guy.\""
    m "\"Supongo que es un poco jodido que confesaras tus sentimientos hace dos días y ahora de repente te estés follando a otro.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:813
translate spanish a1s6_37ed35b3:

    # "This is all so ridiculous."
    "Todo esto es tan ridículo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:814
translate spanish a1s6_889094be:

    # "Not only the situation I'm in, but the fact that I feel so hurt by the wolf, even though nothing has really happened between us except an alcohol-fueled kiss."
    "No solo mi situación, sino sentirme tan dolido por el lobo aunque no haya ocurrido nada entre nosotros, salvo un beso impulsado por el alcohol."

# game/a1s6.rpy:815
translate spanish a1s6_78c61f5c:

    # "Amicus takes another step forward, his paws up, staring wide-eyed at me."
    "Amicus da otro paso adelante, con las patas levantadas y mirándome con los ojos muy abiertos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:816
translate spanish a1s6_809a142c:

    # a "\"That's not what happened, and if you'll let me explain...\""
    a "\"Eso no es lo que pasó; si me dejas explicarlo...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:817
translate spanish a1s6_f55b408e:

    # m "\"Then what did I just see?\""
    m "\"¿Entonces qué acabo de ver?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:818
translate spanish a1s6_82d7b300:

    # a "\"What you saw...it was...more of a transaction than anything.\""
    a "\"Lo que viste... fue... más bien una transacción.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:819
translate spanish a1s6_60db651e:

    # m "\"What, of cum?\""
    m "\"¿De qué, de semen?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:820
translate spanish a1s6_916f225e:

    # "Amicus chokes in surprise."
    "Amicus se atraganta, sorprendido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:822
translate spanish a1s6_890c1f15:

    # a "\"Well...yes, I guess, but I made a deal with the Khemian.\""
    a "\"Bueno...sí, supongo, pero hice un trato con el Khemiano.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:823
translate spanish a1s6_e5edecfb:

    # m "\"What deal?\""
    m "\"¿Qué trato?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:825
translate spanish a1s6_cb639cb4:

    # a "\"Well, I'm sure you remember our problems with Cassius?\""
    a "\"Bueno, seguro que recuerdas nuestros problemas con Cassius.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:826
translate spanish a1s6_0f6cb2ba:

    # m "\"About him wanting to murder me?\""
    m "\"¿Lo de que quiere matarme?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:827
translate spanish a1s6_b79cea14:

    # a "\"Yes, that problem.\""
    a "\"Sí, ese problema.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:828
translate spanish a1s6_43c58380:

    # m "\"What about it?\""
    m "\"¿Qué pasa con eso?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:829
translate spanish a1s6_a315656e:

    # a "\"Well, I did say it wasn't something you should worry about, but like I also said, I'm taking all precautions.\""
    a "\"Bueno, dije que no debías preocuparte, pero, como también dije, estoy tomando todas las precauciones.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:830
translate spanish a1s6_9b78ca0f:

    # m "\"Yeah?\""
    m "\"¿Sí?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:831
translate spanish a1s6_df013a0b:

    # a "\"Yes. So...\""
    a "\"Sí. Entonces...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:832
translate spanish a1s6_3b4f9b88:

    # "The wolf pauses."
    "El lobo se detiene."

# game/a1s6.rpy:833
translate spanish a1s6_df8ec4bc_1:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:835
translate spanish a1s6_994d7526:

    # a "\"I realize now that I should have consulted you on this, but it was my only immediate option...\""
    a "\"Ahora comprendo que debería habértelo consultado, pero era mi única opción inmediata...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:836
translate spanish a1s6_f72c76f6:

    # m "\"What option?\""
    m "\"¿Qué opción?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:837
translate spanish a1s6_5fcd3352:

    # a "\"Well, while Cassius might be willing to execute MY pet, he wouldn't dare touch the pet of a Khemian.\""
    a "\"Bueno, aunque Cassius pudiera estar dispuesto a ejecutar a MI mascota, no se atrevería a tocar la mascota de un Khemiano.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:838
translate spanish a1s6_df8ec4bc_2:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:839
translate spanish a1s6_f7ff6a29:

    # "The wolf rubs behind his neck with one paw and speaks very quickly."
    "El lobo se frota la nuca con una pata y habla muy deprisa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:840
translate spanish a1s6_5168e1a9:

    # a "\"If I were to lose the second trial, I made it so that your ownership would transfer to Neferu. You'd become his pet.\""
    a "\"Si perdiera la segunda prueba, he dispuesto que tu propiedad pase a Neferu. Te convertirías en su mascota.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:841
translate spanish a1s6_f1edb6ac:

    # "I stare at the wolf."
    "Miro fijamente al lobo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:842
translate spanish a1s6_594f9a8f:

    # a "\"This would ensure that Cassius would not dare come after you. If he did, it might upset the very delicate relations we have with the Khemians.\""
    a "\"Eso garantizaría que Cassius no se atreviera a ir a por ti. Si lo hiciera, podría perjudicar las delicadísimas relaciones que tenemos con los Khemianos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:843
translate spanish a1s6_3b13c900:

    # "A moment of silence passes."
    "Pasa un momento de silencio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:844
translate spanish a1s6_c0e87107:

    # m "\"So I'd become Neferu's pet?\""
    m "\"¿Entonces me convertiría en la mascota de Neferu?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:846
translate spanish a1s6_d99a54ae:

    # a "\"If I somehow lose the trial, yes.\""
    a "\"Si de alguna manera pierdo la prueba, sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:847
translate spanish a1s6_f1edb6ac_1:

    # "I stare at the wolf."
    "Miro fijamente al lobo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:848
translate spanish a1s6_13629e33:

    # a "\"Are you okay with that?\""
    a "\"¿Te parece bien eso?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:849
translate spanish a1s6_6ae30550:

    # m "\"Amicus...\""
    m "\"Amicus...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:850
translate spanish a1s6_bef6471c:

    # "Again with him doing things without even telling me."
    "Otra vez hace cosas sin siquiera decírmelo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:851
translate spanish a1s6_0139701c:

    # "No conversation, no warning...no consideration."
    "Sin conversación, sin advertencia... sin consideración."

# game/a1s6.rpy:852
translate spanish a1s6_cd4e90da:

    # "After all this time, he still doesn't see me as an equal."
    "Después de todo este tiempo, todavía no me ve como un igual."

# game/a1s6.rpy:853
translate spanish a1s6_b0addcd8:

    # "Amicus sees my expression change and quickly jumps in again."
    "Amicus ve cambiar mi expresión y vuelve a intervenir rápidamente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:854
translate spanish a1s6_f98f2776:

    # a "\"It's the best alternative, mainly because the Khemians likely use their own stretch. Neferu would be able to get you home if he had to.\""
    a "\"Es la mejor alternativa, principalmente porque los Khemianos probablemente usan su propia Propulsión. Neferu podría llevarte a casa si tuviera que hacerlo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:855
translate spanish a1s6_561c9e5e:

    # m "\"So to pay him...\""
    m "\"Entonces, para pagarle...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:857
translate spanish a1s6_d12246f2:

    # a "\"He wanted sex and ONLY seemed interested in that, yes. Trust me, I took no emotional pleasure in it.\""
    a "\"Quería sexo y parecía interesado SOLO en eso, sí. Créeme, no obtuve ningún placer emocional.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:858
translate spanish a1s6_4f30fff8:

    # "I'm quiet."
    "Me quedo callado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:860
translate spanish a1s6_3c669092:

    # a "\"Don't worry though, I made sure the contract we agreed to ensures that you will not have to be involved in anything like that. In fact, you'd almost be treated like a Pharaoh.\""
    a "\"Pero no te preocupes; me aseguré de que el contrato que acordamos garantizara que no tendrás que participar en nada parecido. De hecho, casi te tratarían como a un faraón.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:862
translate spanish a1s6_6cb81a69:

    # "Amicus grins proudly."
    "Amicus sonríe orgulloso."

# game/a1s6.rpy:863
translate spanish a1s6_6b57aaf5:

    # "I stare at the wolf for a while, suddenly feeling numb."
    "Miro al lobo un rato y de pronto me siento insensible."

# game/a1s6.rpy:865
translate spanish a1s6_51b33145:

    # a "\"Are you feeling better?\""
    a "\"¿Te sientes mejor?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:866
translate spanish a1s6_59505a56:

    # "His voice takes on a serious tone as he reaches out and pushes a thumb pad across my cheek."
    "Su voz adquiere un tono serio mientras extiende la pata y me pasa la almohadilla del pulgar por la mejilla."

# game/a1s6.rpy:867
translate spanish a1s6_8b3d795c:

    # "The action is intimate, and I turn my head away."
    "El gesto es íntimo y vuelvo la cabeza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:868
translate spanish a1s6_0f5a83e4:

    # "We stand awkwardly for a moment, then Amicus holds up the flowers."
    "Permanecemos incómodos un momento; después Amicus levanta las flores."

# game/a1s6.rpy:870
translate spanish a1s6_0904837e:

    # a "\"Er...you dropped these.\""
    a "\"Eh... se te cayeron.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:871
translate spanish a1s6_6a20a80d_1:

    # "I shake my head."
    "Niego con la cabeza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:872
translate spanish a1s6_d796486e:

    # m "\"They were for you.\""
    m "\"Eran para ti.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:874
translate spanish a1s6_bddb760d:

    # "Amicus winces."
    "Amicus hace una mueca."

# game/a1s6.rpy:875
translate spanish a1s6_5be9a28d:

    # a "\"I thought so...were you going to ask me...\""
    a "\"Eso pensaba... ¿ibas a preguntarme...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:876
translate spanish a1s6_22ab2662:

    # "I feel my face getting hot."
    "Siento que me arde la cara."

# game/a1s6.rpy:877
translate spanish a1s6_d4453130:

    # m "\"Yeah, but now—\""
    m "\"Sí, pero ahora—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:878
translate spanish a1s6_a06dc969:

    # "I'm suddenly enveloped in a very tight hug."
    "De pronto me envuelve un abrazo muy fuerte."

# game/a1s6.rpy:879
translate spanish a1s6_fdf03a0d:

    # a "\"Gods, that was the absolute worst moment for you to walk in. I'm sorry.\""
    a "\"Dioses, era el peor momento posible para entrar. Lo siento.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:880
translate spanish a1s6_e1ef4f1c:

    # "I stand there limp, just letting the wolf hug me."
    "Me quedo allí sin fuerzas, dejando que el lobo me abrace."

# game/a1s6.rpy:881
translate spanish a1s6_ea038ed7:

    # "Finally, Amicus steps back, holding the slightly-wilting flowers as he stares at them."
    "Por fin Amicus retrocede, sosteniendo las flores algo marchitas mientras las mira."

# game/a1s6.rpy:883
translate spanish a1s6_98a59e7f:

    # a "\"I hope after...that...you're still considering?\""
    a "\"Espero que después de... eso... todavía lo estés considerando.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:885
translate spanish a1s6_3dac6c76:

    # "I sigh and shake my head to which Amicus's ears fall."
    "Suspiro y niego con la cabeza; las orejas de Amicus caen."

# game/a1s6.rpy:886
translate spanish a1s6_135f0e70:

    # m "\"I'm just a stupid primate to you, aren't I?\""
    m "\"Para ti solo soy un primate estúpido, ¿no?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:888
translate spanish a1s6_3c8805f7_1:

    # a "\"What?\""
    a "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:889
translate spanish a1s6_16172c86:

    # m "\"I told you before to just {i}talk{/i} to me if you're planning something that involves me...why couldn't you have at least given me a warning? Especially for something like {i}this{/i}.\""
    m "\"Ya te dije que simplemente {i}hablaras{/i} conmigo si planeabas algo que me involucrara...¿por qué no pudiste al menos avisarme? Sobre todo con algo como {i}esto{/i}.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:890
translate spanish a1s6_8cb847f1:

    # a "\"I—I...\""
    a "\"Yo—yo...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:891
translate spanish a1s6_fd1a14ca:

    # m "\"You what?\""
    m "\"¿Tú qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:892
translate spanish a1s6_3adabcb3:

    # a "\"It was sudden and...I thought the idea might hurt you after what happened on the island.\""
    a "\"Fue repentino y... pensé que la idea podría hacerte daño después de lo ocurrido en la isla.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:893
translate spanish a1s6_2b42bb82:

    # m "\"No shit. So you went behind my back? I know sometimes you don't...well, you don't even think, but you {i}knew{/i} this would hurt?\""
    m "\"No me digas. ¿Así que actuaste a mis espaldas? Sé que a veces no...bueno, ni siquiera piensas, pero ¿{i}sabías{/i} que esto me haría daño?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:894
translate spanish a1s6_b983c30a:

    # a "\"No! I've been so busy! Not to mention negotiating these things is complicated. I'm just trying to do what's best for you.\""
    a "\"¡No! ¡He estado muy ocupado! Además, negociar estas cosas es complicado. Solo intento hacer lo mejor para ti.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:895
translate spanish a1s6_4925ff7c:

    # m "\"Without really thinking about me, or how I might feel about any of this.\""
    m "\"Sin pensar de verdad en mí ni en cómo puedo sentirme respecto a todo esto.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:899
translate spanish a1s6_25367e14:

    # a "\"I'm always thinking about you! Every damn hour of the day, and this is on top of the trials! Believe it or not, [mc], I'm stretched a bit thin, and it would be helpful if you could work with me—\""
    a "\"¡Siempre pienso en ti! ¡Cada maldita hora del día, y además tengo las pruebas! Aunque no lo creas, [mc], estoy algo desbordado y me ayudaría que colaboraras conmigo—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:900
translate spanish a1s6_4e2ba5d0:

    # m "\"Work with you how? Let you manipulate me into becoming your boyfriend, then watch you fuck another guy so I can become HIS slave instead? I've been pretending, but now it could actually become official!\""
    m "\"¿Colaborar contigo cómo? ¿Dejar que me manipules para ser tu novio y después verte follar con otro para convertirme en SU esclavo? ¡He estado fingiendo, pero ahora podría hacerse oficial de verdad!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:902
translate spanish a1s6_641a0aa1:

    # "I can't stop the words from spilling out of my mouth, wanting to hurt the wolf just as much as he hurt me."
    "No puedo impedir que las palabras salgan; quiero herir al lobo tanto como él me hirió a mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:903
translate spanish a1s6_238573c8:

    # a "\"Manipu—\""
    a "\"Manipu—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:904
translate spanish a1s6_30ffd6ec:

    # "The wolf stares at me."
    "El lobo me mira fijamente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:905
translate spanish a1s6_2ea4205a:

    # "Then, Amicus's hackles rise, but instead of instilling any sort of fear in me like it normally would, I feel satisfaction."
    "Entonces se le eriza el pelo a Amicus, pero, en lugar de causarme miedo como normalmente, siento satisfacción."

# game/a1s6.rpy:907
translate spanish a1s6_35ba2bfa:

    # a "\"[mc], I will not have you accusing me of such a thing. I was more honest with you on the island than I have been with anyone in YEARS.\""
    a "\"[mc], no permitiré que me acuses de eso. En la isla fui más sincero contigo de lo que he sido con nadie en AÑOS.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:908
translate spanish a1s6_16bb71f6:

    # m "\"But not about what just happened with Neferu.\""
    m "\"Pero no sobre lo que acaba de pasar con Neferu.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:909
translate spanish a1s6_2b6a3abf:

    # a "\"What, you think I owe you celibacy? We're not 'dating', and you refuse to do {i}anything{/i} with me! It may come as a surprise to you, but even in times like these, I have needs.\""
    a "\"¿Qué, crees que te debo celibato? No estamos 'saliendo' y te niegas a hacer {i}nada{/i} conmigo. Quizá te sorprenda, pero incluso en momentos como estos tengo necesidades.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:910
translate spanish a1s6_b5976a22:

    # m "\"So you did want it.\""
    m "\"Entonces sí lo querías.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:911
translate spanish a1s6_280466dd:

    # "Amicus looks about ready to explode and, for a moment, he just stands there in silence, practically shaking."
    "Amicus parece a punto de estallar; se queda de pie en silencio un momento, prácticamente temblando."

# game/a1s6.rpy:912
translate spanish a1s6_21c0602f:

    # "He opens his mouth, and instead of the shouting I expect, it's almost a whisper."
    "Abre la boca y, en lugar del grito que espero, casi susurra."

# game/a1s6.rpy:913
translate spanish a1s6_6948f7a2:

    # a "\"I may not know how these things work on Earth, but YOU know how they work on Adastra. You said yourself that these matters are casual. What happened with the jackal means nothing to me. You mean so {i}much{/i} to me, which is why I did it to keep you safe!\""
    a "\"Puede que no sepa cómo funcionan estas cosas en la Tierra, pero TÚ sabes cómo funcionan en Adastra. Tú mismo dijiste que estos asuntos son casuales. Lo que pasó con el chacal no significa nada para mí. ¡Tú significas {i}mucho{/i} para mí, y por eso lo hice: para mantenerte a salvo!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:914
translate spanish a1s6_6a20a80d_2:

    # "I shake my head."
    "Niego con la cabeza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:915
translate spanish a1s6_184015de:

    # "While seeing what happened in the bedroom hurt, it's really only the tip of the iceberg with what's wrong with all of this."
    "Aunque ver lo ocurrido en el dormitorio me dolió, solo es la punta del iceberg de todo lo que está mal aquí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:916
translate spanish a1s6_bcdee97c:

    # m "\"If you actually cared about me, you'd care about what I want. You keep telling me how smart I am, but here we are again with you doing stuff without any of my input because you think I'm too stupid to understand.\""
    m "\"Si de verdad te importara, te importaría lo que quiero. No dejas de decirme lo inteligente que soy, pero aquí estamos otra vez, contigo haciendo cosas sin contar conmigo porque crees que soy demasiado tonto para entenderlas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:918
translate spanish a1s6_92142fb6:

    # a "\"No—\""
    a "\"No—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:919
translate spanish a1s6_1ec048e5:

    # m "\"You know, you wolves are all the same. We're all just stupid barbarians to you. You don't treat me as an equal, you look down on me, and why the fuck would I want to be with someone like that?\""
    m "\"Sabes, todos los lobos sois iguales. Para vosotros solo somos bárbaros estúpidos. No me tratas como a un igual; me miras por encima del hombro. ¿Por qué coño querría estar con alguien así?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:921
translate spanish a1s6_9025a3e7:

    # a "\"That is not even—\""
    a "\"Eso ni siquiera—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:922
translate spanish a1s6_ca39cecd:

    # m "\"Just win your stupid trial and send me home. If you don't, just blast my stupid ape-ass off into space. I don't wanna be here anymore.\""
    m "\"Gana tu estúpida prueba y mándame a casa. Si no, lanza mi estúpido culo de simio al espacio. Ya no quiero estar aquí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:924
translate spanish a1s6_47138e21:

    # "I turn, heading for the door."
    "Me vuelvo y me dirijo a la puerta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:925
translate spanish a1s6_aaf3eecf:

    # a "\"Wait, {i}Please{/i}—\""
    a "\"Espera, {i}por favor{/i}—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:926
translate spanish a1s6_87ce954d:

    # "Whatever he was going to say suddenly cuts off as I hear a loud thud."
    "Lo que iba a decir se interrumpe de repente y oigo un fuerte golpe."

# game/a1s6.rpy:928
translate spanish a1s6_91ede1cf:

    # "I don't look back to see what he kicked or punched."
    "No miro atrás para ver qué ha golpeado con el pie o el puño."

# game/a1s6.rpy:930
translate spanish a1s6_fdf7af4b:

    # "Instead, I head out into the hall, not sure at all of where I'm going."
    "En cambio, salgo al pasillo sin tener ni idea de adónde voy."

# game/a1s6.rpy:931
translate spanish a1s6_0edff0f3:

    # "I just know that I hate everything about what just happened."
    "Solo sé que odio todo lo que acaba de pasar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:935
translate spanish a1s6_155b5484:

    # "For a while, I just wander."
    "Deambulo un rato."

# game/a1s6.rpy:936
translate spanish a1s6_b28d717c:

    # "I end up pacing the halls of the palace before going outside to sit in the gardens."
    "Acabo recorriendo los pasillos del palacio antes de salir a sentarme en los jardines."

# game/a1s6.rpy:937
translate spanish a1s6_c1b9dbed:

    # "I don't see anyone."
    "No veo a nadie."

# game/a1s6.rpy:938
translate spanish a1s6_382d9f8b:

    # "It's weirdly calm outside, especially considering that the emperor could be decided tomorrow."
    "Fuera reina una calma extraña, especialmente teniendo en cuenta que mañana podría decidirse quién será emperador."

# game/a1s6.rpy:939
translate spanish a1s6_97af8384:

    # "I wonder how things are in the city, in the rest of the empire."
    "Me pregunto cómo estarán las cosas en la ciudad, en el resto del imperio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:940
translate spanish a1s6_0cca5e0c:

    # "I look out toward the faint city skyline, glinting gently in the afternoon light."
    "Miro la tenue silueta de la ciudad, que reluce suavemente bajo la luz de la tarde."

# game/a1s6.rpy:941
translate spanish a1s6_2bc49453:

    # "Amicus doesn't come after me."
    "Amicus no viene tras de mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:942
translate spanish a1s6_1026b4ad:

    # "Should he?"
    "¿Debería hacerlo?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:943
translate spanish a1s6_e8d0e56c:

    # "I'd said such horrible things to him."
    "Le dije cosas horribles."

# game/a1s6.rpy:944
translate spanish a1s6_a22412d5:

    # "But even now, I feel like I had to say them."
    "Pero incluso ahora siento que tenía que decirlas."

# game/a1s6.rpy:945
translate spanish a1s6_88b88785:

    # "I'm tired of being treated like an actual pet, and now that I might actually become one..."
    "Estoy cansado de que me traten como a una mascota de verdad, y ahora que podría convertirme realmente en una..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:946
translate spanish a1s6_48db0c2c:

    # "Still...I kind of wish he did come after me again."
    "Aun así... en cierto modo desearía que volviera a venir tras de mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:947
translate spanish a1s6_dfd95360:

    # "I do believe that he was only trying to protect me, that he thought what he was doing was the only way to do that."
    "Sí creo que solo intentaba protegerme y que pensaba que era la única forma de hacerlo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:948
translate spanish a1s6_693cb912:

    # "But after everything on the beach, after I've already told him to just keep me in the loop..."
    "Pero después de todo lo ocurrido en la playa, después de haberle dicho ya que simplemente me mantuviera informado..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:949
translate spanish a1s6_4fcdd2ac:

    # "Honestly, if he'd asked me about it first, even just told me about it, I'd probably have been okay with it."
    "Sinceramente, si me lo hubiera preguntado antes, o siquiera me lo hubiera contado, probablemente me habría parecido bien."

# game/a1s6.rpy:950
translate spanish a1s6_d69a7667:

    # "Sure...maybe a little jealous, but okay."
    "Claro... quizá con algo de celos, pero bien."

# game/a1s6.rpy:951
translate spanish a1s6_a6929987:

    # "I realize that a lot of this anger is because I just feel betrayed, and I feel that way because I really, really like Amicus."
    "Comprendo que gran parte de esta rabia se debe a que me siento traicionado, y me siento así porque Amicus me gusta muchísimo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:952
translate spanish a1s6_f69e4200:

    # "I'd expected him to treat me better after everything..."
    "Esperaba que me tratara mejor después de todo..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:954
translate spanish a1s6_ae59086f:

    # "The late afternoon heat is making me sweat, but instead of going inside, I just move under some shade."
    "El calor del final de la tarde me hace sudar, pero en lugar de entrar, me coloco a la sombra."

# game/a1s6.rpy:955
translate spanish a1s6_b70b5b82:

    # "After a while, I lay back on the bench I'm sitting on, drifting off to sleep."
    "Después de un rato, me tumbo en el banco donde estoy sentado y me quedo dormido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:959
translate spanish a1s6_9b1ea41a:

    # "When I wake up, it takes me a while to realize where I am."
    "Cuando despierto, tardo un rato en comprender dónde estoy."

# game/a1s6.rpy:960
translate spanish a1s6_ae6fd716:

    # "I stare at the flowers and leaves, gently lit up by the garden lights, until I remember that I'd fallen asleep there."
    "Miro las flores y las hojas, suavemente iluminadas por las luces del jardín, hasta recordar que me quedé dormido allí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:961
translate spanish a1s6_511d0817:

    # "Groggily, I call out for Com and according to him, I've only been out for about two hours, but the sun here always moves fast across the sky."
    "Aturdido, llamo a Com; según él, solo he dormido unas dos horas, pero aquí el sol siempre cruza el cielo deprisa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:962
translate spanish a1s6_186be029:

    # "I brush a few leaves off my robes as I get up and walk toward the palace, realizing at this point that I can't exactly avoid going back to Amicus's room forever."
    "Sacudo unas hojas de la túnica, me levanto y camino hacia el palacio, comprendiendo que no puedo evitar volver a la habitación de Amicus para siempre."

# game/a1s6.rpy:964
translate spanish a1s6_9274ba6d:

    # "At least it'll force us to talk about things after we've cooled down."
    "Al menos nos obligará a hablar después de calmarnos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:965
translate spanish a1s6_b21d12d9:

    # "...At least, I hope he's cooled down."
    "... Al menos, espero que él se haya calmado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:966
translate spanish a1s6_5587f53a:

    # "My pace starts to slow as I get closer to his bedroom, unsure what to say after everything that happened."
    "Reduzco la velocidad al acercarme a su dormitorio, sin saber qué decir después de todo lo ocurrido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:967
translate spanish a1s6_0a6f663d:

    # "I decide I'm going to apologize, but also expect an apology from him as well."
    "Decido disculparme, pero también espero una disculpa de su parte."

# game/a1s6.rpy:968
translate spanish a1s6_f8a42e07:

    # "We both made mistakes, but we could get past this if we talked it out..."
    "Los dos cometimos errores, pero podríamos superarlo si lo habláramos..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:969
translate spanish a1s6_8f946de8:

    # "Dinner is still sitting next to the door on its cart, untouched."
    "La cena sigue en el carrito junto a la puerta, intacta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:970
translate spanish a1s6_b544db46:

    # "I pause, my hand hovering over the panel, remembering what I saw the last time I opened this door."
    "Me detengo con la mano sobre el panel, recordando lo que vi la última vez que abrí esta puerta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:972
translate spanish a1s6_16637fbe:

    # "Shuddering, I steel myself and press it."
    "Me estremezco, me armo de valor y lo aprieto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:976
translate spanish a1s6_6b4d5a38:

    # "The room's empty."
    "La habitación está vacía."

# game/a1s6.rpy:977
translate spanish a1s6_7c33c5b0:

    # "No wolf in sight."
    "No se ve ningún lobo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:978
translate spanish a1s6_aa5c8ed3:

    # "Cold air creeps out of the room, chilling my bare calves as I continue to stand in the hallway."
    "El aire frío sale de la habitación y me enfría las pantorrillas desnudas mientras sigo en el pasillo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:979
translate spanish a1s6_cd0ced26:

    # "I realize then that I was holding in my breath and I let it out slowly."
    "Entonces comprendo que estaba conteniendo la respiración y suelto el aire despacio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:980
translate spanish a1s6_201c8b01:

    # "I look up and down the hall in case I might see Amicus, but as always, it's empty."
    "Miro a ambos lados del pasillo por si veo a Amicus, pero, como siempre, está vacío."

# game/a1s6.rpy:981
translate spanish a1s6_a436b890:

    # "With a soft sigh, I slowly walk in toward the bed before changing direction to sit on the sofa instead."
    "Con un suave suspiro, entro lentamente hacia la cama antes de cambiar de dirección y sentarme en el sofá."

# game/a1s6.rpy:982
translate spanish a1s6_7f5402c7:

    # "Com had told me that it was the eighteenth hour, which means Amicus should be getting ready for bed by now, a schedule he follows almost religiously."
    "Com me dijo que era la decimoctava hora, así que Amicus ya debería estar preparándose para dormir; sigue ese horario casi religiosamente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:983
translate spanish a1s6_43bb6134:

    # "Maybe he's getting ready for the trial somehow?"
    "¿Quizá se esté preparando de alguna manera para la prueba?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:984
translate spanish a1s6_ce0d524c:

    # "That would be good, but I'm also getting the uncomfortable feeling that he's just avoiding me."
    "Eso sería bueno, pero también tengo la incómoda sensación de que simplemente me evita."

# game/a1s6.rpy:985
translate spanish a1s6_a23c0bd5:

    # "That would be bad, because despite what happened, he shouldn't be thinking at all about me."
    "Eso sería malo, porque, pese a lo ocurrido, no debería estar pensando en mí en absoluto."

# game/a1s6.rpy:986
translate spanish a1s6_ff6d0aff:

    # "He could be the emperor tomorrow."
    "Mañana podría ser emperador."

# game/a1s6.rpy:987
translate spanish a1s6_07c11914:

    # "So I sit there, hugging a pillow, waiting."
    "Así que me quedo sentado, abrazando una almohada, esperando."

# game/a1s6.rpy:988
translate spanish a1s6_2bc07e1c:

    # "After a while, I grab the food from the hallway and manage to eat a little bit."
    "Al cabo de un rato, recojo la comida del pasillo y consigo comer un poco."

# game/a1s6.rpy:989
translate spanish a1s6_4d4afe2e:

    # "I wonder if I should save some for Amicus, but decide that he'd be able to get his own food from the kitchens instead of these cold leftovers if he ends up returning."
    "Me pregunto si debería guardar algo para Amicus, pero decido que, si vuelve, podrá conseguir su propia comida en las cocinas en lugar de estas sobras frías."

# game/a1s6.rpy:990
translate spanish a1s6_429aea62:

    # "So I send the rest back with the drones and continue waiting."
    "Así que devuelvo el resto con los drones y sigo esperando."

# game/a1s6.rpy:991
translate spanish a1s6_8920d118:

    # "After a few more hours, Amicus still doesn't come back, and I end up laying down on the sofa, waiting to fall asleep..."
    "Después de unas horas más, Amicus sigue sin volver y acabo tumbándome en el sofá, esperando dormirme..."

# game/a1s6.rpy:997
translate spanish a1s6_0894fe24:

    # "The sound of the door opening jolts me awake, and I quickly sit up, turning to look."
    "El sonido de la puerta al abrirse me despierta de golpe; me incorporo rápidamente y me vuelvo para mirar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:998
translate spanish a1s6_2e87079d:

    # m "\"Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿Amicus?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1000
translate spanish a1s6_4a9644c0:

    # "I stare at the jackal for a moment, feeling a sudden surge of anger in my chest."
    "Miro al chacal un momento y siento una oleada repentina de rabia en el pecho."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1001
translate spanish a1s6_7b73873c:

    # n "\"Hello, [mc]. Are you not coming to the trial?\""
    n "\"Hola, [mc]. ¿No vas a venir a la prueba?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1002
translate spanish a1s6_02513e4d:

    # "I look around."
    "Miro alrededor."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1003
translate spanish a1s6_f3291692:

    # m "\"What time is it?\""
    m "\"¿Qué hora es?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1005
translate spanish a1s6_4624c13d:

    # n "\"The seventh hour, which means the trial starts in less than an hour.\""
    n "\"La séptima hora; la prueba empieza en menos de una hora.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1006
translate spanish a1s6_54ae3d90:

    # m "\"Where's Amicus?\""
    m "\"¿Dónde está Amicus?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1007
translate spanish a1s6_11e752eb:

    # n "\"Preparing for the trial.\""
    n "\"Está preparándose para la prueba.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1008
translate spanish a1s6_e41cb36f:

    # m "\"He...hasn't been back all night.\""
    m "\"Él... no ha vuelto en toda la noche.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1010
translate spanish a1s6_2223b237:

    # n "\"He was meditating most of the night.\""
    n "\"Estuvo meditando casi toda la noche.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1011
translate spanish a1s6_5372d0bd:

    # m "\"All night?\""
    m "\"¿Toda la noche?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1013
translate spanish a1s6_e4456107:

    # n "\"Indeed.\""
    n "\"Así es.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1014
translate spanish a1s6_a7eac603:

    # "I frown at the jackal."
    "Miro al chacal con el ceño fruncido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1015
translate spanish a1s6_9caecb4d:

    # m "\"What do you want?\""
    m "\"¿Qué quieres?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1016
translate spanish a1s6_adf6b162:

    # "Neferu walks further into the room slowly before stopping in the middle, a good fifteen feet away."
    "Neferu avanza lentamente dentro de la habitación y se detiene en medio, a unos cuatro metros y medio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1019
translate spanish a1s6_330b11e5:

    # n "\"To escort you to the trial, if you'd like...and to also talk.\""
    n "\"Acompañarte a la prueba, si quieres... y también hablar.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1020
translate spanish a1s6_9cc1052b:

    # m "\"About what?\""
    m "\"¿De qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1022
translate spanish a1s6_05a09abf:

    # n "\"I've already told you that you don't need to play stupid with me, [mc].\""
    n "\"Ya te dije que no necesitas hacerte el tonto conmigo, [mc].\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1023
translate spanish a1s6_b51d4045:

    # "I sit up straight, turning to face the jackal more directly."
    "Me siento erguido y me vuelvo para mirar al chacal más directamente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1024
translate spanish a1s6_cf931234:

    # m "\"I'm not, I'm just wondering why the fuck you have the nerve to show up here after taking advantage of Amicus like that.\""
    m "\"No lo hago. Solo me pregunto por qué coño tienes la cara de aparecer aquí después de aprovecharte así de Amicus.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1026
translate spanish a1s6_520bd17d:

    # n "\"Wha—\""
    n "\"Qué...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1027
translate spanish a1s6_3a0f421a:

    # "I don't think I've ever seen Neferu caught off-guard, so the sight is kind of funny."
    "Creo que nunca he visto a Neferu desprevenido, así que la imagen resulta algo graciosa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1028
translate spanish a1s6_393dd690:

    # "I smirk."
    "Sonrío de lado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1030
translate spanish a1s6_101a4377:

    # n "\"Well...that's certainly a way to look at it.\""
    n "\"Bueno... desde luego es una forma de verlo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1031
translate spanish a1s6_220d9ce7:

    # m "\"What other way is there to look at it?\""
    m "\"¿Qué otra forma hay de verlo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1033
translate spanish a1s6_279e34bf:

    # n "\"Plenty, if you'll let me explain.\""
    n "\"Muchas, si me dejas explicarlo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1034
translate spanish a1s6_c8f2e276:

    # "I sit back on the sofa, crossing my arms."
    "Me recuesto en el sofá y cruzo los brazos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1035
translate spanish a1s6_cb9fa3b8:

    # m "\"Amicus already explained. I become your pet to protect me from Cassius and in exchange for that, you made him fuck you in the ass.\""
    m "\"Amicus ya lo explicó. Me convierto en tu mascota para protegerme de Cassius y, a cambio, lo hiciste follarte por el culo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1037
translate spanish a1s6_16761b7a:

    # "Again, the jackal looks shocked, then he laughs, the sound high and soft."
    "De nuevo el chacal parece sorprendido; después se ríe, con un sonido agudo y suave."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1039
translate spanish a1s6_b0dfaa37:

    # n "\"Hahaha...oh dear, there are many ways to look at this, aren't there?\""
    n "\"Jajaja... vaya, hay muchas maneras de ver esto, ¿no?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1040
translate spanish a1s6_55f6a14c:

    # "His suddenly cheerful mood irritates me."
    "Su repentino buen humor me irrita."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1041
translate spanish a1s6_c79fdc62:

    # m "\"Listen, I honestly don't want any part of this...\""
    m "\"Escucha, sinceramente no quiero formar parte de esto...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1043
translate spanish a1s6_289a0de9:

    # n "\"Yes, but you are already a part of it, whether you want to be or not, so please...allow me to explain some things.\""
    n "\"Sí, pero ya formas parte, quieras o no, así que, por favor... permíteme explicar algunas cosas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1044
translate spanish a1s6_ee290847:

    # "I don't say anything, keeping my arms folded, my expression bored."
    "No digo nada y mantengo los brazos cruzados, con expresión aburrida."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1045
translate spanish a1s6_8f17e6c9:

    # "The jackal seems to take that as his cue to continue."
    "El chacal parece tomarlo como señal para continuar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1047
translate spanish a1s6_d7789f30:

    # n "\"Amicus approached me about this deal a week ago, shortly after the incident with Cassius. It seemed simple enough, and I had to agree with him; your position in this power struggle is becoming evermore precarious.\""
    n "\"Amicus me propuso este trato hace una semana, poco después del incidente con Cassius. Parecía bastante sencillo y tuve que darle la razón: tu posición en esta lucha de poder es cada vez más precaria.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1048
translate spanish a1s6_09722dcb:

    # "I raise an eyebrow."
    "Alzo una ceja."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1049
translate spanish a1s6_707d2a10:

    # m "\"How so?\""
    m "\"¿Cómo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1050
translate spanish a1s6_d7b75af9:

    # n "\"The rumors about Cassius's intent to disband the triumvirates have saturated the trial, even though Cato has banned all discussion of it.\""
    n "\"Los rumores sobre la intención de Cassius de disolver los triunviratos han inundado la prueba, aunque Cato ha prohibido toda discusión al respecto.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1051
translate spanish a1s6_fe9d1045:

    # n "\"Word is that Cassius has realized who might have started the rumors.\""
    n "\"Se dice que Cassius ha descubierto quién pudo iniciar los rumores.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1053
translate spanish a1s6_864bb03f:

    # "Neferu looks pointedly at me, though I try to keep my expression neutral."
    "Neferu me mira significativamente, aunque intento mantener una expresión neutra."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1054
translate spanish a1s6_bf696462:

    # n "\"This has implications for you obviously, but not only because you possibly sabotaged his chances at the throne.\""
    n "\"Esto tiene consecuencias para ti, claro, pero no solo porque posiblemente hayas saboteado sus opciones al trono.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1055
translate spanish a1s6_87c718ee:

    # "I feel my stomach turn a little, realizing I've gotten myself into way more than I'd ever intended."
    "Siento que se me revuelve un poco el estómago al comprender que me he metido en mucho más de lo que pretendía."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1056
translate spanish a1s6_3af8d65f:

    # n "\"This also brings into question your intelligence...far too intelligent for a Simian, wouldn't you say?\""
    n "\"También pone en duda tu inteligencia... demasiado inteligente para un simiano, ¿no dirías?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1057
translate spanish a1s6_1fdc5f93:

    # "I open my mouth, but Neferu goes on."
    "Abro la boca, pero Neferu continúa."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1059
translate spanish a1s6_f68f9805:

    # n "\"Now, with all of this considered, it was only natural for Amicus to come to me for help. Your life is in danger, [mc], no matter the facade these peaceful palace halls might project.\""
    n "\"Ahora, teniendo todo esto en cuenta, era natural que Amicus acudiera a mí para pedir ayuda. Tu vida está en peligro, [mc], por mucho que estos tranquilos pasillos del palacio aparenten otra cosa.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1060
translate spanish a1s6_6bfc57b9:

    # "I stare at the jackal, surprised at how candid he's being with me."
    "Miro fijamente al chacal, sorprendido por lo sincero que está siendo conmigo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1061
translate spanish a1s6_9e010ebc:

    # n "\"He asked me what I wanted most, and I answered truthfully; an alliance with the wolves if Amicus were to become emperor.\""
    n "\"Me preguntó qué quería más y respondí con sinceridad: una alianza con los Lobos si Amicus se convertía en emperador.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1063
translate spanish a1s6_cd8dd838:

    # n "\"Of course, he declined outright, as he should have as the prospective emperor. How could he promise something so important with so many implications, all over one pet?\""
    n "\"Por supuesto, se negó rotundamente, como debía hacer al aspirar al trono. ¿Cómo iba a prometer algo tan importante, con tantas consecuencias, por una sola mascota?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1065
translate spanish a1s6_28e28ef9:

    # n "\"So, knowing that was impossible, I offered something a bit more selfish on my part; copulation with the handsome son of a wolven emperor. To this, he only needed a few moments to agree.\""
    n "\"Así que, sabiendo que era imposible, propuse algo un poco más egoísta por mi parte: copular con el atractivo hijo de un emperador de los Lobos. Solo necesitó unos momentos para aceptar.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1066
translate spanish a1s6_cd938aab:

    # "I grimace."
    "Hago una mueca."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1068
translate spanish a1s6_634c0450:

    # n "\"But I want you to understand something, [mc]. If Amicus had found even that disagreeable, I would have simply asked for nothing.\""
    n "\"Pero quiero que comprendas algo, [mc]. Si a Amicus incluso eso le hubiera parecido desagradable, simplemente no habría pedido nada.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1070
translate spanish a1s6_85bc146a:

    # n "\"It is the duty of all Khemians to protect any sapient fleeing wolven violence, whether they be sibling, child...or abandoned. Pet ownership is illegal where I'm from, and the idea is quite disgusting, don't you agree?\""
    n "\"Es deber de todos los Khemianos proteger a cualquier Sapiente que huya de la violencia de los lobos, sea Hermano, Hijo...o abandonado. Poseer mascotas es ilegal donde yo vivo, y la idea resulta bastante repugnante, ¿no crees?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1072
translate spanish a1s6_5be167d1:

    # "Neferu glances at me."
    "Neferu me mira brevemente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1073
translate spanish a1s6_09e4138d:

    # n "\"But wolves love their contracts, and no matter how different Amicus might wish himself to be, he is still a wolf. He despises the idea that he might owe something to a Khemian.\""
    n "\"Pero los lobos adoran sus contratos y, por diferente que Amicus desee ser, sigue siendo un lobo. Detesta pensar que pueda deberle algo a un Khemiano.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1075
translate spanish a1s6_877e4cad:

    # n "\"And his quickness to accept the deal showed me that despite how much he wanted to {i}not{/i} want to...'fuck' me, as you put it, there was a part of him that did. In the end, he was willing.\""
    n "\"Y la rapidez con la que aceptó el trato me demostró que, por mucho que quisiera {i}no{/i} querer... 'follarme', como dices tú, había una parte de él que sí quería. Al final, lo hizo voluntariamente.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1076
translate spanish a1s6_a4dfe006:

    # "I look away, frowning."
    "Aparto la mirada, con el ceño fruncido."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1077
translate spanish a1s6_7283cc9e:

    # n "\"And I think this is something that has caused a rift between the two of you. You must understand that sex is casual here, it means nothing more than indulging in our corporeal desires. It's one of the few cultural similarities we share with the wolves.\""
    n "\"Y creo que eso ha creado una distancia entre vosotros. Debes comprender que aquí el sexo es casual; no significa más que satisfacer nuestros deseos corporales. Es una de las pocas similitudes culturales que compartimos con los Lobos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1078
translate spanish a1s6_6fd74f4a:

    # n "\"I've been told that Simians are more similar to cats in that such things hold much more meaning, but you are no longer on Simia and must understand that things are different here.\""
    n "\"Me han dicho que los simianos se parecen más a los gatos, en el sentido de que esas cosas tienen mucho más significado, pero ya no estás en Simia y debes entender que aquí las cosas son distintas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1079
translate spanish a1s6_36cb5d8f:

    # n "\"Even if he wants to, which I believe he does, Amicus can't change his philosophy over the course of a single week.\""
    n "\"Aunque quiera, y creo que quiere, Amicus no puede cambiar su filosofía en una sola semana.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1080
translate spanish a1s6_a9edfacd:

    # "I finally find room to speak."
    "Por fin encuentro un hueco para hablar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1081
translate spanish a1s6_a8ca4a83:

    # m "\"You're acting like we're in a relationship, or something.\""
    m "\"Hablas como si tuviéramos una relación o algo así.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1083
translate spanish a1s6_6d350243:

    # n "\"You aren't, but you want to be. Amicus loves you. It's clear as Vita, as they say here.\""
    n "\"No la tenéis, pero tú quieres tenerla. Amicus te quiere. Está tan claro como Vita, como dicen aquí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1084
translate spanish a1s6_4a4c12e8:

    # "I feel that little thrill in my chest, and my face blushes furiously."
    "Siento aquel pequeño estremecimiento en el pecho y me ruborizo intensamente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1085
translate spanish a1s6_d09c5668:

    # "Neferu goes on like he didn't actually just say that, though."
    "Sin embargo, Neferu continúa como si no acabara de decir eso."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1087
translate spanish a1s6_2735ff17:

    # n "\"So yes, if you don't like the idea of Amicus 'fucking' another man, then claim him as {i}your own{/i} man.\""
    n "\"Así que sí: si no te gusta la idea de que Amicus se 'folle' a otro hombre, entonces reivindícalo como {i}tu{/i} hombre.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1088
translate spanish a1s6_e499761a_4:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1089
translate spanish a1s6_0b12ad3e:

    # m "\"Claim?\""
    m "\"¿Reclamar?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1091
translate spanish a1s6_d06c376d:

    # n "\"I'm going by wolven terms here. I'm sure you have your own.\""
    n "\"Uso los términos de los Lobos. Seguro que tú tienes los tuyos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1092
translate spanish a1s6_b593813b:

    # "Did Neferu just ask me to ask Amicus out?"
    "¿Neferu acaba de pedirme que le proponga salir a Amicus?"

# game/a1s6.rpy:1094
translate spanish a1s6_513086f6:

    # n "\"Now, does that clear things up for you?\""
    n "\"Ahora, ¿eso te aclara las cosas?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1095
translate spanish a1s6_83358dc3:

    # "Even though I just woke up, I'm already feeling exhausted."
    "Aunque acabo de despertar, ya estoy agotado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1096
translate spanish a1s6_53d12f87:

    # m "\"I...guess. There was a little more to it than that, though.\""
    m "\"Yo... supongo. Aunque había algo más.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1097
translate spanish a1s6_979054bd:

    # n "\"Which I'm sure can be settled in the future. Civil discussions can do wonders.\""
    n "\"Seguro que puede resolverse en el futuro. Las conversaciones educadas pueden hacer maravillas.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1099
translate spanish a1s6_affc4d6d:

    # n "\"Now, we really must be getting to the trial...if you're wanting to go?\""
    n "\"Ahora sí debemos ir a la prueba... ¿si quieres asistir?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1100
translate spanish a1s6_cb251dd7:

    # "Neferu raises an eyebrow at me."
    "Neferu arquea una ceja."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1101
translate spanish a1s6_2dbc183f:

    # "I find myself shaking my head, but not to deny the jackal his request."
    "Niego con la cabeza, pero no para rechazar la petición del chacal."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1102
translate spanish a1s6_c9e19b9b:

    # "Rather, it's because I don't know what the hell this guy is up to."
    "Más bien porque no sé qué demonios trama este tipo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1103
translate spanish a1s6_375e9f9b:

    # "I get up and Neferu offers his arm to me which I stare at."
    "Me levanto y Neferu me ofrece el brazo; me quedo mirándolo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1105
translate spanish a1s6_c2bb4dac:

    # n "\"Shall I escort you?\""
    n "\"¿Te acompaño?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1108
translate spanish a1s6_06e152f9:

    # "This is something I'd seen the jackal do multiple times to Vriginia and Alex."
    "He visto al chacal hacer esto varias veces con Virginia y Alex."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1109
translate spanish a1s6_33a30c69:

    # "For some reason, he seemed to really just enjoy \"escorting\" people around."
    "Por algún motivo, parecía disfrutar de verdad \"escoltando\" a la gente de un lado a otro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1110
translate spanish a1s6_84316a94:

    # "After his little lecture, I can tell that he's trying to smooth things over between me and Amicus."
    "Después de su pequeña charla, veo que intenta arreglar las cosas entre Amicus y yo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1111
translate spanish a1s6_71d254b6:

    # "So, reluctantly, I reach out and take his arm in both hands, if only to please him."
    "Así que, a regañadientes, extiendo las manos y le tomo el brazo con ambas, aunque solo sea para complacerlo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1113
translate spanish a1s6_b2f25461:

    # "And pleased he seems to be, a tugging at the corner of his muzzle making me think he's trying not to smile {i}too{/i} much."
    "Y sí que parece complacido: un movimiento en la comisura de su hocico me hace pensar que intenta no sonreír {i}demasiado{/i}."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1116
translate spanish a1s6_55a3940f:

    # "As he guides me out the door, I find myself feeling out the fur on his arm."
    "Mientras me guía hacia la puerta, me descubro palpando el pelo de su brazo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1117
translate spanish a1s6_807f040b:

    # "It's much more silky and smooth compared to Amicus, not quite as fluffy."
    "Es mucho más sedoso y liso que el de Amicus, no tan esponjoso."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1118
translate spanish a1s6_d4213ae2:

    # "It's not as nice as Amicus's coat, but it does feel nice in a different way."
    "No es tan bonito como el pelaje de Amicus, pero se siente agradable de otra manera."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1119
translate spanish a1s6_dbcb40be:

    # "There's a lot of muscle there too, and I wonder if the jackal works out in the amphitheater, though I've never seen him there."
    "También hay bastante músculo; me pregunto si el chacal entrena en el anfiteatro, aunque nunca lo he visto allí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1120
translate spanish a1s6_cd135896:

    # "I guess I can see why so many people are into this guy...if muscles are your thing."
    "Supongo que entiendo por qué a tanta gente le atrae este tipo... si te gustan los músculos."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1121
translate spanish a1s6_1d641146:

    # "As we continue through the halls, I notice we're taking a different route than the one to the throne room."
    "Mientras seguimos por los pasillos, noto que tomamos una ruta distinta de la que conduce al salón del trono."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1122
translate spanish a1s6_3b69c6f6:

    # m "\"Where are we going?\""
    m "\"¿Adónde vamos?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1124
translate spanish a1s6_11868419:

    # n "\"To meet the star of the most asinine entertainment show in the galaxy. What better way to determine the fate of all things, siblings and parents alike, than through meaningless, wolven spectacle?\""
    n "\"A conocer a la estrella del espectáculo de entretenimiento más absurdo de la galaxia. ¿Qué mejor manera de decidir el destino de todo, de Hermanos y Padres por igual, que un espectáculo lobuno sin sentido?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1125
translate spanish a1s6_c7944f8f:

    # m "\"...What?\""
    m "\"... ¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1126
translate spanish a1s6_95e30c58:

    # "Neferu pauses in front of a door, gently pulling away from me while his paw is held delicately up to the panel."
    "Neferu se detiene ante una puerta y se aparta suavemente de mí mientras mantiene la pata con delicadeza junto al panel."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1128
translate spanish a1s6_207da3c3:

    # n "\"What I'm saying is that quite a bit is depending on your wolf right now, and he might need some encouragement.\""
    n "\"Lo que digo es que ahora mucho depende de tu lobo, y quizá necesite algo de ánimo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1129
translate spanish a1s6_dbd86041:

    # "I'm still staring at the jackal when he finally presses the panel, opening the door."
    "Todavía miro fijamente al chacal cuando por fin aprieta el panel y abre la puerta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1132
translate spanish a1s6_c82a6463:

    # "This is something I'd seen the jackal do multiple times to Virginia and Alex."
    "He visto al chacal hacer esto varias veces con Virginia y Alex."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1133
translate spanish a1s6_33a30c69_1:

    # "For some reason, he seemed to really just enjoy \"escorting\" people around."
    "Por algún motivo, parecía disfrutar de verdad \"escoltando\" a la gente de un lado a otro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1134
translate spanish a1s6_855d2f34:

    # "However, I still really don't trust this guy, and I don't want him to feel like he's won any points with me."
    "Sin embargo, todavía no me fío de este tipo y no quiero que crea que se ha ganado mi favor."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1135
translate spanish a1s6_4fdf42cd:

    # "So I shake my head."
    "Así que niego con la cabeza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1136
translate spanish a1s6_31d7001a:

    # m "\"Naw, I'll just follow you.\""
    m "\"No, simplemente te seguiré.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1138
translate spanish a1s6_46ec1ee0:

    # n "\"As you wish.\""
    n "\"Como quieras.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1141
translate spanish a1s6_b445a737:

    # "I follow the jackal out the door, my footsteps much louder than Neferu's."
    "Sigo al chacal fuera; mis pasos son mucho más ruidosos que los de Neferu."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1142
translate spanish a1s6_5bfc0b5a:

    # "As we continue through the halls, I notice that we're taking a different route than the one to the throne room."
    "Mientras seguimos por los pasillos, noto que tomamos una ruta distinta de la que lleva al salón del trono."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1143
translate spanish a1s6_3b69c6f6_1:

    # m "\"Where are we going?\""
    m "\"¿Adónde vamos?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1145
translate spanish a1s6_11868419_1:

    # n "\"To meet the star of the most asinine entertainment show in the galaxy. What better way to determine the fate of all things, siblings and parents alike, than through meaningless, wolven spectacle?\""
    n "\"A conocer a la estrella del espectáculo de entretenimiento más absurdo de la galaxia. ¿Qué mejor manera de decidir el destino de todo, de Hermanos y Padres por igual, que un espectáculo lobuno sin sentido?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1146
translate spanish a1s6_c7944f8f_1:

    # m "\"...What?\""
    m "\"... ¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1147
translate spanish a1s6_1d0a4e69:

    # "Neferu pauses in front of a door, his paw held delicately up to the panel."
    "Neferu se detiene ante una puerta y mantiene la pata delicadamente junto al panel."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1149
translate spanish a1s6_fa576169:

    # n "\"What I'm saying is that quite a lot is depending on your wolf right now, and he might need some encouragement.\""
    n "\"Lo que digo es que ahora muchísimo depende de tu lobo, y quizá necesite algo de ánimo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1150
translate spanish a1s6_dbd86041_1:

    # "I'm still staring at the jackal when he finally presses the panel, opening the door."
    "Todavía miro fijamente al chacal cuando por fin aprieta el panel y abre la puerta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1156
translate spanish a1s6_b2f48c87:

    # "When I look back, I find myself looking into a much smaller room; simple and bare, just a bed and dresser."
    "Cuando vuelvo a mirar, veo una habitación mucho más pequeña, sencilla y vacía, con solo una cama y una cómoda."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1157
translate spanish a1s6_371a9c9a:

    # "The air is thick with the calming smell of incense as it creeps into the hallway and washes over me in a warm wave."
    "El aire está cargado del olor calmante del incienso; se desliza hacia el pasillo y me envuelve en una oleada cálida."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1158
translate spanish a1s6_9924e740:

    # "And there, sitting on the bed, is Amicus."
    "Y allí, sentado en la cama, está Amicus."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1159
translate spanish a1s6_349fe3df:

    # "Before I can look back at Neferu, the wolf suddenly looks up."
    "Antes de que pueda mirar de nuevo a Neferu, el lobo alza la vista de repente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1161
translate spanish a1s6_e1a1dc0a:

    # "We both stare at each other for a moment, then the wolf is suddenly on his feet, stumbling toward me."
    "Los dos nos miramos un momento; después el lobo se pone de pie de golpe y avanza hacia mí con torpeza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1163
translate spanish a1s6_1367b82d:

    # "He stops himself halfway across the room though, paws clasped in front of himself."
    "Pero se detiene a mitad de la habitación, con las patas juntas delante del cuerpo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1164
translate spanish a1s6_5a94f31f:

    # "I've never seen him so disheveled before."
    "Nunca lo he visto tan desaliñado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1165
translate spanish a1s6_02df8f60:

    # "His fur is stuck up all over his neck and shoulders, his cape is askew, his eyes are red and bleary."
    "Tiene el pelo erizado por todo el cuello y los hombros, la capa torcida y los ojos rojos y nublados."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1166
translate spanish a1s6_2d9a8e60:

    # "Before I know it, I'm walking into the room toward the wolf."
    "Antes de darme cuenta, entro en la habitación hacia el lobo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1167
translate spanish a1s6_994f6c7b:

    # m "\"Are you okay?\""
    m "\"¿Estás bien?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1168
translate spanish a1s6_e73afff6:

    # "Amicus tries to smooth his fur down, but it sticks right back up."
    "Amicus intenta alisarse el pelo, pero vuelve a levantarse enseguida."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1169
translate spanish a1s6_20edd98c:

    # a "\"I'm...I'm fine. I was just meditating.\""
    a "\"Estoy... estoy bien. Solo meditaba.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1170
translate spanish a1s6_3e9d443e:

    # m "\"You look awful. Isn't the trial in less than an hour?\""
    m "\"Tienes un aspecto horrible. ¿No es la prueba en menos de una hora?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1171
translate spanish a1s6_4eb44ffd:

    # a "\"...Yes.\""
    a "\"...Sí.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1172
translate spanish a1s6_b028bdf3:

    # "There's a moment of silence that goes by as I just stare at the wolf."
    "Pasa un momento de silencio mientras me limito a mirar al lobo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1173
translate spanish a1s6_ba5cd3fb:

    # m "\"Are...are you going then? You should get ready—\""
    m "\"¿Vas... vas a ir entonces? Deberías prepararte—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1174
translate spanish a1s6_9e17ba4d:

    # a "\"[mc]...\""
    a "\"[mc]...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1175
translate spanish a1s6_705d37e2:

    # "I stop, waiting."
    "Me detengo y espero."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1176
translate spanish a1s6_380c1cae:

    # "The pause is long, and when Amicus finally speaks, his voice is so quiet I can barely hear it."
    "La pausa es larga y, cuando Amicus habla por fin, su voz es tan baja que apenas la oigo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1179
translate spanish a1s6_8087c3b0:

    # a "\"I—I don't think I was meant for this...\""
    a "\"Yo... no creo que esté hecho para esto...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1180
translate spanish a1s6_116c68d5:

    # "My heart sinks."
    "Se me cae el alma al suelo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1181
translate spanish a1s6_376124b5:

    # m "\"Meant for what?\""
    m "\"¿Hecho para qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1182
translate spanish a1s6_e66e6d08:

    # a "\"Everything in this damned empire. I've done absolutely nothing right. Everything has been handed to me on a platter my entire life, but the first time I actually have to fight for something...\""
    a "\"Para todo en este maldito imperio. No he hecho absolutamente nada bien. Me lo han dado todo en bandeja durante toda mi vida, pero la primera vez que realmente tengo que luchar por algo...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1183
translate spanish a1s6_091b061b:

    # a "\"I know you don't think I took this seriously, but I did. I tried...I wasn't prepared, and you were right.\""
    a "\"Sé que no crees que me lo tomara en serio, pero sí lo hice. Lo intenté... no estaba preparado y tenías razón.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1184
translate spanish a1s6_d7743d29:

    # "I see a little wetness around his eyes, but he aggressively wipes at them with an arm."
    "Veo algo de humedad alrededor de sus ojos, pero los limpia bruscamente con un brazo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1185
translate spanish a1s6_dc83cc55:

    # "While weeks ago, I might have welcomed this epiphany, this is the absolute worst moment for it."
    "Aunque hace semanas habría recibido de buen grado esta revelación, este es el peor momento posible para ella."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1187
translate spanish a1s6_fb68184e:

    # a "\"I couldn't even keep my best friend. I would have been a terrible emperor.\""
    a "\"Ni siquiera pude conservar a mi mejor amigo. Habría sido un emperador terrible.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1188
translate spanish a1s6_48fe9226:

    # "It takes me a moment to realize that he's talking about me."
    "Tardo un momento en comprender que habla de mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1189
translate spanish a1s6_74f704d9:

    # m "\"Amicus—\""
    m "\"Amicus—\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1191
translate spanish a1s6_0c8c9dfa:

    # a "\"I'm sorry. I'm sorry I didn't tell you everything, that I treated you poorly, that I got you into this stupid mess in the first place...and that I can't get you out of it.\""
    a "\"Lo siento. Siento no habértelo contado todo, haberte tratado mal, haberte metido en este estúpido lío... y no poder sacarte de él.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1192
translate spanish a1s6_e4861271:

    # "The wolf's voice catches on that last part, and I wonder with some astonishment if I'm actually going to see him cry."
    "La voz del lobo se quiebra en la última parte y me pregunto con asombro si realmente voy a verlo llorar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1194
translate spanish a1s6_efca2156:

    # "But he manages to hold it together, looking down at the floor."
    "Pero consigue controlarse y mira al suelo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1195
translate spanish a1s6_413973b3:

    # a "\"I just wanted to do what was best for you, but I wasn't thinking {i}of{/i} you while I did it. I was inconsiderate, and I'm sorry.\""
    a "\"Solo quería hacer lo mejor para ti, pero no estaba pensando {i}en{/i} ti mientras lo hacía. Fui desconsiderado y lo siento.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1196
translate spanish a1s6_da9220d5:

    # "Amicus stands there quietly, apparently finished."
    "Amicus permanece callado; al parecer, ha terminado."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1197
translate spanish a1s6_8c43077f:

    # "I don't know if this is more about me, or about him feeling inadequate for the emperorship."
    "No sé si se trata más de mí o de que se siente inadecuado para el trono."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1198
translate spanish a1s6_365e2781:

    # "I have no doubt that our little fight yesterday caused it though."
    "Pero no dudo de que nuestra pequeña pelea de ayer lo provocara."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1199
translate spanish a1s6_6f5eebf2:

    # "Seeing the wolf like this...it hurts, but it also makes me kind of angry."
    "Ver al lobo así... me duele, pero también me enfada un poco."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1200
translate spanish a1s6_830c648a:

    # "This isn't the Amicus I know."
    "Este no es el Amicus que conozco."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1201
translate spanish a1s6_396ea65b:

    # "I reach up, setting a hand on his shoulder, and he suddenly looks up at me."
    "Levanto una mano y la pongo en su hombro; él alza de repente la mirada hacia mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1202
translate spanish a1s6_a3bf8b5c:

    # m "\"You're less than an hour away from becoming the emperor. You need to act like it.\""
    m "\"Estás a menos de una hora de convertirte en emperador. Tienes que actuar como tal.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1204
translate spanish a1s6_2d370d51:

    # a "\"Wha—\""
    a "\"Qué...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1205
translate spanish a1s6_3c8a16f5:

    # m "\"You think your dad would have acted like this when he wasn't sure of himself? Your grandfather, Drusus? There's a time and place and now is NOT the time.\""
    m "\"¿Crees que tu padre habría actuado así cuando no estaba seguro de sí mismo? ¿Tu abuelo? ¿Drusus? Hay un momento y un lugar, y ahora NO es el momento.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1206
translate spanish a1s6_235f599d:

    # "I don't know if they would have, but I'm grasping at straws at this point."
    "No sé si lo habrían hecho, pero a estas alturas me agarro a un clavo ardiendo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1207
translate spanish a1s6_f405a8d1:

    # a "\"I—\""
    a "\"Yo...\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1208
translate spanish a1s6_0139524f:

    # m "\"And honestly, this is about a lot more than you, or me, or anyone here. This is about the lives of millions of sapients, about your entire empire. You think it all deserves to go to shit because suddenly you're not really sure of yourself?\""
    m "\"Y, sinceramente, esto va mucho más allá de ti, de mí o de cualquiera de aquí. Se trata de las vidas de millones de Sapientes, de todo tu imperio. ¿Crees que merece irse todo a la mierda porque de repente no estás muy seguro de ti mismo?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1209
translate spanish a1s6_c2f8e12a:

    # m "\"You're such a good person, basically the opposite of what this society is, and you want to put that into your rule. That's amazing, but now you're suddenly willing to give up? What the fuck is wrong with you!?\""
    m "\"Eres tan buena persona, básicamente lo contrario de esta sociedad, y quieres reflejarlo en tu gobierno. Eso es increíble, ¿pero ahora estás dispuesto a rendirte de repente? ¿¡Qué coño te pasa!?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1211
translate spanish a1s6_4e8dc9e9:

    # m "\"Yeah, you made a bunch of mistakes, but that doesn't matter now. What matters is that you make sure that piece-of-shit-brother of yours doesn't take the throne. So you'd better get your ass out there and beat the hell out him in this stupid debate.\""
    m "\"Sí, cometiste muchos errores, pero eso ya no importa. Lo que importa es asegurarte de que ese hermano de mierda no ocupe el trono. Así que más te vale salir ahí y machacarlo en este estúpido debate.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1212
translate spanish a1s6_c9195947:

    # "I'm not sure what else to say so I stop, breathing hard."
    "No sé qué más decir, así que me detengo, respirando con fuerza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1214
translate spanish a1s6_1a03dbf5:

    # "After a moment, I realize the wolf is smiling at me, and it takes me a moment to calm down from my Hollywood movie pep talk."
    "Al cabo de un momento, noto que el lobo me sonríe; tardo un poco en calmarme después de mi discurso motivador de película de Hollywood."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1215
translate spanish a1s6_df8ec4bc_3:

    # m "\"What?\""
    m "\"¿Qué?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1216
translate spanish a1s6_548b4cb8:

    # a "\"I am going to go out there, [mc], there's no doubt about that. I just...I was just having a moment. I was trying to be more honest with you, but thank you.\""
    a "\"Voy a salir ahí, [mc], no hay ninguna duda. Es que... estaba pasando por un momento difícil. Intentaba ser más sincero contigo, pero gracias.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1217
translate spanish a1s6_e499761a_5:

    # "I frown."
    "Frunzo el ceño."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1218
translate spanish a1s6_e9e0bf95:

    # m "\"Well, you sure picked a hell of a moment to have it.\""
    m "\"Bueno, desde luego elegiste un momento de lo más oportuno.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1220
translate spanish a1s6_48b4286f:

    # a "\"I know...I've just been having a terrible time after yesterday, is all. I needed to apologize to you.\""
    a "\"Lo sé... solo he pasado un rato terrible después de ayer. Necesitaba disculparme contigo.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1221
translate spanish a1s6_b7f21db1:

    # "I deflate a little, but there's some relief there too, seeing Amicus somewhat back to his old self."
    "Me desinflo un poco, pero también siento alivio al ver a Amicus algo más parecido al de siempre."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1222
translate spanish a1s6_ebe2fa02:

    # m "\"I...well...I forgive you, but this is a lot bigger than us right now.\""
    m "\"Yo... bueno... te perdono, pero ahora esto es mucho más grande que nosotros.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1224
translate spanish a1s6_2a24001e:

    # a "\"I know it is, and what I'm feeling is a lot bigger than us as well.\""
    a "\"Sé que lo es y lo que siento también es mucho más grande que nosotros.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1225
translate spanish a1s6_fe534869:

    # "The wolf sets a paw on my shoulder."
    "El lobo me pone una pata en el hombro."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1226
translate spanish a1s6_e93db576:

    # a "\"But I'm honest about what I said; I'm sorry, and I will never do anything involving you without your consultation again...and I will take your cultural differences into better consideration in the future.\""
    a "\"Pero soy sincero con lo que dije: lo siento y nunca volveré a hacer nada que te afecte sin consultarte... y tendré más en cuenta tus diferencias culturales en el futuro.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1227
translate spanish a1s6_7aed6d82:

    # "I look up at Amicus, at his earnest face, and I find myself hugging him, and he hugs back tightly."
    "Miro a Amicus y su cara sincera; me descubro abrazándolo y él me devuelve el abrazo con fuerza."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1228
translate spanish a1s6_74da5cb4:

    # m "\"We still need to talk about things, but we can do that later. You need to kick Cassius's ass first.\""
    m "\"Todavía tenemos que hablar, pero puede ser después. Primero tienes que darle una paliza a Cassius.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1229
translate spanish a1s6_f27c8d9c_1:

    # a "\"I know.\""
    a "\"Lo sé.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1230
translate spanish a1s6_51dbda25:

    # "Amicus pulls back, both paws on my shoulders now."
    "Amicus se aparta un poco, ahora con ambas patas en mis hombros."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1231
translate spanish a1s6_89ed868d:

    # a "\"And I will.\""
    a "\"Y lo haré.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1232
translate spanish a1s6_3ddc73da:

    # "There's a gentle clearing of a throat behind us, and we both look back to see Neferu casually lounging in the doorway."
    "Se oye a alguien aclararse suavemente la garganta detrás; los dos miramos atrás y vemos a Neferu apoyado con naturalidad en la puerta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1234
translate spanish a1s6_0d4a1a12:

    # n "\"If you're finished, the trial begins in thirty minutes.\""
    n "\"Si habéis terminado, la prueba comienza en treinta minutos.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1236
translate spanish a1s6_305d58b8:

    # "Immediately, Amicus scowls at the sight of the jackal, but he nods."
    "Amicus frunce el ceño de inmediato al ver al chacal, pero asiente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1237
translate spanish a1s6_2ba2b15b:

    # a "\"I'd better be going then.\""
    a "\"Entonces debería irme.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1238
translate spanish a1s6_f5300967:

    # m "\"So you're feeling better now?\""
    m "\"¿Así que ahora te sientes mejor?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1240
translate spanish a1s6_8e3319f9:

    # a "\"Much better, thanks to you!\""
    a "\"¡Mucho mejor, gracias a ti!\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1241
translate spanish a1s6_f7a0d3ab:

    # "I smile as I feel a wave of relief, even though this is just like Amicus to be so easily cheered up."
    "Sonrío al sentir una oleada de alivio, aunque es muy propio de Amicus animarse con tanta facilidad."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1242
translate spanish a1s6_0fc1fb9a:

    # "I allow the wolf to pull me toward the door."
    "Dejo que el lobo tire de mí hacia la puerta."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1245
translate spanish a1s6_e36cc1d5:

    # "Neferu moves out of the way as we exit the stifling meditation room."
    "Neferu se aparta cuando salimos de la sofocante sala de meditación."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1247
translate spanish a1s6_84bd0351:

    # a "\"Alright, I'm on my way to a shower.\""
    a "\"Bien, voy a ducharme.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1248
translate spanish a1s6_383856db:

    # m "\"I'll be watching...the rhetoric thing, I mean.\""
    m "\"Te estaré viendo... en lo de la retórica, quiero decir.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1250
translate spanish a1s6_20b5148f:

    # a "\"Heh, I'll look for you, and...we'll talk after this?\""
    a "\"Je, te buscaré y... ¿hablaremos después?\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1251
translate spanish a1s6_7f9d840d:

    # m "\"Yeah, we'll talk after you're emperor.\""
    m "\"Sí, hablaremos cuando seas emperador.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1253
translate spanish a1s6_b6b84c66:

    # a "\"Alright.\""
    a "\"Está bien.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1254
translate spanish a1s6_769528a5:

    # "Amicus leans in to kiss me on the lips, then pauses before planting it on my cheek instead."
    "Amicus se inclina para besarme en los labios, pero se detiene y me besa la mejilla en su lugar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1255
translate spanish a1s6_4d688270:

    # "With that, he winks, then turns and dashes up the hall, running at a full sprint."
    "Entonces me guiña un ojo, se vuelve y sale disparado por el pasillo, corriendo a toda velocidad."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1257
translate spanish a1s6_04d2f856:

    # "I hear a soft chuckle behind me."
    "Oigo una risita suave detrás de mí."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1259
translate spanish a1s6_4fa30c9e:

    # n "\"Well, that went rather well. I didn't think that would be half as easy.\""
    n "\"Bueno, eso ha salido bastante bien. No creía que fuera ni la mitad de fácil.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1260
translate spanish a1s6_023fc081:

    # "I glance back at the jackal as he basically reveals he's been planning this all along."
    "Miro al chacal mientras prácticamente revela que lo había planeado desde el principio."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1261
translate spanish a1s6_9ce42112:

    # "I guess it was obvious."
    "Supongo que era evidente."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1262
translate spanish a1s6_a405d1ed:

    # n "\"Shall we head to the throne room? They'll be wanting us sitting down early so they can film us. The whole things is a dreary spectacle, after all.\""
    n "\"¿Vamos al salón del trono? Querrán que nos sentemos pronto para filmarnos. Al fin y al cabo, todo esto es un espectáculo tedioso.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1263
translate spanish a1s6_6f19d038:

    # m "\"Alright.\""
    m "\"Está bien.\""

# game/a1s6.rpy:1266
translate spanish a1s6_67719e2c:

    # "With that, I follow the jackal toward the throne room, hoping that what I'd said to Amicus is enough to get him in the right head space to help him win."
    "Dicho eso, sigo al chacal hacia el salón del trono, esperando que lo que dije a Amicus baste para ponerlo en el estado mental adecuado para ganar."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1267
translate spanish a1s6_fad6732e:

    # "In just a few hours, I'll know if I'll be leaving soon...or staying for a long, long time."
    "Dentro de unas horas sabré si me iré pronto... o si me quedaré muchísimo tiempo."

# game/a1s6.rpy:1268
translate spanish a1s6_afd25f6c:

    # "Either way, I'm just glad that this happened."
    "En cualquier caso, me alegra que esto haya ocurrido."

